Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.00,0:01:19.00,Default,,0,0,0,Banner;28;0;0,{\an8\fs18}{\bord0\b0\fnMicrosoft YaHei}本字幕由{\c&H5CBFDB&\1a&H00&}CSEG克隆字幕提取组{\c&HFFFFFF&\1a&H00&}提取分享  仅供学习交流之用  禁止压制  禁止删除字幕组及CSEG署名
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.28,0:01:03.49,Default,,0,0,0,,好了 准备好了吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Okay. You ready?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.46,0:01:18.22,Default,,0,0,0,,这太美了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}It's beautiful.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.30,0:01:20.34,Default,,0,0,0,,-这是在哪儿找的  -很可爱吧\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}-Where'd you find this? -It's cute, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.00,0:01:25.00,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8\fs18\bord0\b0\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fad(300,300)}欢迎关注新浪微博、微信公众号：{\c&H5CBFDB&\1a&H00&\b1}CSEG克隆字幕提取组
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.43,0:01:23.35,Default,,0,0,0,,啊 我太喜欢这个了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Aw, I love this!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.43,0:01:24.93,Default,,0,0,0,,真可爱\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}So cute.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.47,0:01:28.10,Default,,0,0,0,,太完美了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}It's perfect!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.40,0:01:37.11,Default,,0,0,0,,我自己挺着大肚子可没法布置这么好\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}It would've been, you know, a lot for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.19,0:01:38.99,Default,,0,0,0,,-谢谢你  -嗯\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}-Thank you. -Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.45,0:01:42.32,Default,,0,0,0,,这太完美了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}It's perfect.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.28,0:01:44.12,Default,,0,0,0,,你太完美了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You're perfect.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.12,0:01:48.66,Default,,0,0,0,,-谢谢你  -应该的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}-Thank you. -Of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.63,0:01:54.42,Default,,0,0,0,,他们已经到了吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Are they here already?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.50,0:01:56.00,Default,,0,0,0,,他们差不多早到了30分钟\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}They're like 30 minutes early.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.09,0:01:57.46,Default,,0,0,0,,-为什么 什么  -嘿\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}-Why are they-- What? -Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.55,0:01:58.46,Default,,0,0,0,,没事的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}It's okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.93,0:02:04.55,Default,,0,0,0,,我太喜欢了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I love it.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.18,0:02:06.47,Default,,0,0,0,,是吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.56,0:02:08.18,Default,,0,0,0,,老实说 我和艾利\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I'll be honest. Ally and I, you know,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.27,0:02:10.60,Default,,0,0,0,,我们都不知道要不要开这个派对\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}we weren't sure about whether to have this party,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.69,0:02:13.15,Default,,0,0,0,,但只要我们在一起 就没有什么克服不了的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}but together there's nothing we can't overcome.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.23,0:02:14.90,Default,,0,0,0,,你是我认识的最坚强的女人\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You're the strongest woman I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.98,0:02:16.77,Default,,0,0,0,,我爱你胜过一切\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I love you more than anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.86,0:02:18.11,Default,,0,0,0,,我也非常非常激动\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}And I'm so damn excited
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.19,0:02:19.90,Default,,0,0,0,,能与你共度人生\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}to keep building our lives together.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.99,0:02:22.03,Default,,0,0,0,,-我也是 我爱你  -我也爱你\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}-Me too. I love you. -Love you.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.11,0:02:24.41,Default,,0,0,0,,哦\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Aw.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.49,0:02:26.12,Default,,0,0,0,,你怎么从来没对我说过这样的话\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Why don't you ever say anything like that about me?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.20,0:02:28.37,Default,,0,0,0,,谢谢大家的到来 谢谢\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Thank you all for being here. Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.54,0:02:32.62,Default,,0,0,0,,维生素在桌上\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Vitamins are on the table.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.71,0:02:34.08,Default,,0,0,0,,谢谢 亲爱的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh. Thank you, baby.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.75,0:02:39.51,Default,,0,0,0,,-派对很不错  -嗯\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}-It was a nice party. -Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.59,0:02:40.67,Default,,0,0,0,,大家都玩得很开心\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Think everyone had a good time.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.76,0:02:42.38,Default,,0,0,0,,是的 你值得\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yeah. You deserve it.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.09,0:02:46.93,Default,,0,0,0,,你只是在抛弃我之前哄哄我罢了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You're just buttering me up before you abandon me.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.01,0:02:49.43,Default,,0,0,0,,我真希望能再拖延一下\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I wish I could delay it again.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.52,0:02:51.06,Default,,0,0,0,,-我知道  -我不想把你留在这里\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}-I know. -I don't want to leave you here.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.14,0:02:52.77,Default,,0,0,0,,你只需要去找法官\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You just go to the judge
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.85,0:02:54.73,Default,,0,0,0,,跟他说一些非常不成体统的话\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}and tell him something wildly inappropriate
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.81,0:02:56.27,Default,,0,0,0,,然后回到我身边\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}and then come back to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.36,0:02:57.94,Default,,0,0,0,,-我会的  -哦 你会吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}-I will. -Oh, you will?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.02,0:02:59.53,Default,,0,0,0,,-嗯好吧 我有些...  -哦 你会吗 怎么说\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}-Mmm-hmm. Yeah. I got some-- -Oh, you will? Like what?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.61,0:03:01.32,Default,,0,0,0,,-我会说  -什么\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}-I'll say... -What?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.40,0:03:03.15,Default,,0,0,0,,我就说我们明晚要办一场盛大的淫乱派对\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I'll say we're having a big old orgy tomorrow night
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.24,0:03:04.32,Default,,0,0,0,,在场的所有人都可以来\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}and they're all invited.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.41,0:03:05.70,Default,,0,0,0,,哎呀\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Ow!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.78,0:03:07.08,Default,,0,0,0,,哦 不 小心 小心\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Ooh. No, no, no. Be careful. Careful.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.16,0:03:08.58,Default,,0,0,0,,好了 我激动过头了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}All right. That got me too excited.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.04,0:03:12.08,Default,,0,0,0,,好了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.50,0:03:14.71,Default,,0,0,0,,嘿\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.79,0:03:16.08,Default,,0,0,0,,-不好意思  -嘿\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}-Sorry. Sorry, sorry. -Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.68,0:03:28.72,Default,,0,0,0,,提醒诸位 请尽快寄出邮寄选票\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Just a reminder to send in those mail-in ballots soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.81,0:03:30.97,Default,,0,0,0,,离选举日只有两周了 朋友们\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}We're only two weeks out from election date, folks,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.06,0:03:32.77,Default,,0,0,0,,每张选票都很重要\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}and every ballot matters.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.85,0:03:34.64,Default,,0,0,0,,确保及时投出你们的选票\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}So be sure to get yours in before it's too late.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.52,0:03:40.98,Default,,0,0,0,,费思 拜托\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Faith, come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.07,0:03:42.61,Default,,0,0,0,,民调显示你正陷入僵局 支持率仅为46%\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Polling has you at a 46-point deadlock,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.69,0:03:44.74,Default,,0,0,0,,还有8%的选民没投票\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}with 8% of voters still undecided.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.82,0:03:46.86,Default,,0,0,0,,我们需要推进你降低犯罪率的计划\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}We need to push your plan to reduce the crime rate
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.95,0:03:47.99,Default,,0,0,0,,以便争取领先\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}in order to pull ahead.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.07,0:03:49.78,Default,,0,0,0,,但这个案子就是我的竞选计划\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}But this case is my campaign.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.87,0:03:51.04,Default,,0,0,0,,他是个危险的罪犯\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}He's a dangerous criminal
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.12,0:03:52.66,Default,,0,0,0,,有长期的暴力史\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}with a long history of violence.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.75,0:03:54.54,Default,,0,0,0,,我把詹姆斯·赛思送进监狱 我们就赢了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I put James Sythe away, we win.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.62,0:03:55.96,Default,,0,0,0,,你要是输了 就没机会当地方检察官了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}If you lose, you lose your shot at being DA.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.04,0:03:57.25,Default,,0,0,0,,-好了 我得走了  -费思\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}-All right. I got to go. -Faith--
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.18,0:04:09.80,Default,,0,0,0,,哦 她来了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh. There she is.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.14,0:04:13.60,Default,,0,0,0,,嘿 不好意思\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hey. Excuse me!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.68,0:04:15.10,Default,,0,0,0,,你\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You, uh...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.18,0:04:16.14,Default,,0,0,0,,你的东西掉了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You dropped this.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.77,0:04:18.35,Default,,0,0,0,,哦 是吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh. I did.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.44,0:04:19.81,Default,,0,0,0,,天呐 谢谢 你真是帮了大忙了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, my God. Thank you. You're a lifesaver.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.90,0:04:21.32,Default,,0,0,0,,没关系 祝您愉快\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}No worries. Have a good day.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.40,0:04:22.57,Default,,0,0,0,,谢谢 你也是\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yeah. You too.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.28,0:04:28.16,Default,,0,0,0,,-穿过那扇门就是  -谢谢\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}-Through that door. -Oh, thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.70,0:04:31.53,Default,,0,0,0,,我该去哪里 我是陪审员\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Where do I go for, uh, jury duty?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.62,0:04:32.58,Default,,0,0,0,,往那边走\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Go down there.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.87,0:04:36.00,Default,,0,0,0,,谢谢\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.05,0:04:53.56,Default,,0,0,0,,好了 各位 抬头\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}All right, guys. Eyes up.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.64,0:04:54.64,Default,,0,0,0,,注意\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Pay attention.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.43,0:04:58.31,Default,,0,0,0,,您好 欢迎您\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hello. I'd like to welcome you
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.39,0:05:00.73,Default,,0,0,0,,成为佐治亚州法院的陪审员\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}as a juror in the Georgia court system.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.81,0:05:03.94,Default,,0,0,0,,作为陪审员 你要保护每个人\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}As a juror, you protect the right of every person
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.03,0:05:05.53,Default,,0,0,0,,接受陪审团审判的权利\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}to a trial by jury.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.61,0:05:07.32,Default,,0,0,0,,接受陪审团审判的权利\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}The right to a trial by jury
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.40,0:05:09.95,Default,,0,0,0,,是我们民主的基石\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}is a cornerstone of our democracy.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.03,0:05:11.49,Default,,0,0,0,,这项权利\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}That right is protected
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.57,0:05:13.33,Default,,0,0,0,,受到美国宪法的保护\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}by the United States constitution.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.04,0:05:17.08,Default,,0,0,0,,她来了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}There she is.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.16,0:05:18.71,Default,,0,0,0,,脱脂无糖 香草口味\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Sugar-free vanilla with skim.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.79,0:05:20.25,Default,,0,0,0,,不错\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Ah. You're good.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.33,0:05:21.33,Default,,0,0,0,,-你还要点别的吗  -不用了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}-Can I get you something else? -Mmm-mmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.42,0:05:22.71,Default,,0,0,0,,你有什么信息可以分享给我吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You got something for me?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.79,0:05:24.75,Default,,0,0,0,,好吧 故意杀人罪\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Okay. Voluntary manslaughter
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.84,0:05:26.38,Default,,0,0,0,,建议量刑20年\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}with a recommendation of 20 years.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.46,0:05:28.09,Default,,0,0,0,,服刑15年 缓刑5年\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Fifteen to serve, followed by five on probation.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.17,0:05:29.47,Default,,0,0,0,,哇 判得真重啊\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Wow. That's a hell of a deal.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.55,0:05:31.47,Default,,0,0,0,,如果他在我们组建陪审团之前认罪\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I will even waive the recidivist statute
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.55,0:05:33.22,Default,,0,0,0,,我甚至可以放弃累犯条款\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}if he pleads before we strike the jury.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.30,0:05:34.81,Default,,0,0,0,,要他承认他没做过的事吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}And admit to something he didn't do?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.89,0:05:37.48,Default,,0,0,0,,留着和陪审团说吧\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Save it for the jury.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.56,0:05:40.31,Default,,0,0,0,,或者不如直接让你的委托人认罪\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Better yet, why don't you plead your guy out
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.39,0:05:42.81,Default,,0,0,0,,这样你就省一桩麻烦了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}and say, free for your caseload.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.90,0:05:43.90,Default,,0,0,0,,听着\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Look...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.19,0:05:46.82,Default,,0,0,0,,我的委托人想要庭审\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}my client wants a trial.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.90,0:05:50.15,Default,,0,0,0,,那你就是在浪费我和你委托人的时间\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Well, then, you're wasting my time and your client's.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.24,0:05:51.24,Default,,0,0,0,,这是最后的机会\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Last chance.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.28,0:05:54.28,Default,,0,0,0,,您先请\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}After you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.00,0:06:06.25,Default,,0,0,0,,你们即将审理的案件是一起涉嫌故意杀人案\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}The case you're about to hear is an alleged homicide.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.34,0:06:08.88,Default,,0,0,0,,州政府指控詹姆斯·迈克尔·赛思\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}The state is charging James Michael Sythe
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.97,0:06:10.38,Default,,0,0,0,,犯预谋杀人罪\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}with malice murder
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.47,0:06:13.64,Default,,0,0,0,,杀害肯德尔·爱丽丝·卡特\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}for the death of Kendall Alice Carter.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.72,0:06:16.39,Default,,0,0,0,,如果你们中的任何人\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Now, if any of you have a personal relationship
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.47,0:06:18.60,Default,,0,0,0,,因为与被告或死者有私人关系\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}with the accused, and/or the deceased
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.68,0:06:20.98,Default,,0,0,0,,无法担任本次陪审员\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}that will prohibit you from serving on this panel
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.06,0:06:22.81,Default,,0,0,0,,无法做到公平公正\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}in an unbiased manner,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.90,0:06:24.27,Default,,0,0,0,,请现在告诉我\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}please speak now.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.70,0:06:33.61,Default,,0,0,0,,请说\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.12,0:06:38.29,Default,,0,0,0,,他坐过我的公交车\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}He used to ride my bus.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.00,0:06:41.25,Default,,0,0,0,,什么时候呢\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}And when was this?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.58,0:06:45.33,Default,,0,0,0,,我不清楚 几年前吧\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I don't know. Few years ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.42,0:06:48.96,Default,,0,0,0,,好的 那么我们没必要纠结于此\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Okay. Then there's no reason we can't leave it there.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.05,0:06:51.42,Default,,0,0,0,,我想你会是位公正的陪审员\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I think you'll make a fine juror.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.51,0:06:53.63,Default,,0,0,0,,还有没有人\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Does anyone else think
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.72,0:06:57.05,Default,,0,0,0,,觉得自己无法担任本次陪审员\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}that they're incapable of serving on this panel?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.22,0:06:59.31,Default,,0,0,0,,请说\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.10,0:07:02.60,Default,,0,0,0,,呃\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Uh...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.69,0:07:04.31,Default,,0,0,0,,法官大人 我妻子正处于妊娠晚期\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Your Honor, my wife is in the third trimester
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.40,0:07:06.23,Default,,0,0,0,,她是高危孕妇\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}of a high-risk pregnancy.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.31,0:07:08.65,Default,,0,0,0,,我希望能陪在她身边\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I'd like to be available to her.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.73,0:07:10.36,Default,,0,0,0,,你的想法值得称赞\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Well, that's commendable.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.44,0:07:12.32,Default,,0,0,0,,你通常工作多久\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}What hours do you normally work?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.32,0:07:15.45,Default,,0,0,0,,一般是早上9点到晚上6点\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Uh, 9:00 to 6:00, typically.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.53,0:07:17.20,Default,,0,0,0,,我可以向你保证 这次开庭\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Then you have my word that this court
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.28,0:07:20.87,Default,,0,0,0,,不会占用你多一分钟的时间\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}will not demand one minute more of your time than that.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.62,0:07:23.37,Default,,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.08,0:07:27.04,Default,,0,0,0,,看吧 你们不想留下的原因\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}See, the fact that you don't want to be here
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.13,0:07:28.71,Default,,0,0,0,,恰恰使你们\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}is exactly what makes you
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.79,0:07:31.88,Default,,0,0,0,,成为审判此案的最佳人选\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}the perfect group to judicate this case.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.05,0:07:34.80,Default,,0,0,0,,你们是公正的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You are impartial.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.88,0:07:38.10,Default,,0,0,0,,你们在其中没有任何利益 没有任何得失\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You have no skin in the game. Nothing to gain or lose.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.18,0:07:40.72,Default,,0,0,0,,这就是为什么我相信 陪审团制度\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}And that is why I believe that this process,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.81,0:07:43.60,Default,,0,0,0,,尽管存在缺陷\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}as flawed as it may be,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.68,0:07:46.35,Default,,0,0,0,,仍然是我们追求正义的最佳机会\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}is still our best chance at finding justice.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.27,0:07:51.48,Default,,0,0,0,,您有工作吗 奥德沃斯夫人\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Do you work, Mrs. Aldworth?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.57,0:07:53.36,Default,,0,0,0,,我的工作是最辛苦的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Well, I had the toughest job there is.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.44,0:07:55.61,Default,,0,0,0,,我抚养了两个孩子 刚送他们上大学\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I raised two kids and just sent them off to college.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.70,0:07:57.49,Default,,0,0,0,,-啊 恭喜  -谢谢\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}-Ah. Congratulations. -Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.57,0:08:00.20,Default,,0,0,0,,您以前担任过陪审员吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}And have you ever served on a jury before?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.28,0:08:02.75,Default,,0,0,0,,当过两次 都是无效审判\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Twice. Both were mistrials.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.83,0:08:04.79,Default,,0,0,0,,两次 好的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Twice. Okay. Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.87,0:08:08.71,Default,,0,0,0,,金先生 您是否曾与伴侣发生过\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Mr. King. Have you ever had a physical altercation
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.79,0:08:10.63,Default,,0,0,0,,肢体冲突\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}with a significant other?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.71,0:08:13.38,Default,,0,0,0,,你要对法庭上的每个人都问这个问题吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Are you gonna ask that question to every guy in this courtroom?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.26,0:08:16.84,Default,,0,0,0,,如果必要的话 我会\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}If I have to, I will. I...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.93,0:08:19.89,Default,,0,0,0,,我明白这些问题涉及你们的隐私\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I know these questions can be very personal--
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.97,0:08:21.14,Default,,0,0,0,,不会\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Nah, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.97,0:08:22.93,Default,,0,0,0,,我不会这么做\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}That ain't me.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.02,0:08:27.23,Default,,0,0,0,,谢谢 先生\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Thank you, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.15,0:08:31.65,Default,,0,0,0,,您在这里住了多久了 奇考斯基先生\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}How long have you lived in the area, Mr. Chicowski?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.73,0:08:33.23,Default,,0,0,0,,十年左右\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}About ten years.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.32,0:08:34.74,Default,,0,0,0,,您\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}And you, uh...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.82,0:08:36.07,Default,,0,0,0,,您经营一家花店\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, you run a flower shop?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.15,0:08:38.20,Default,,0,0,0,,是的 和我的妻子一起\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yeah. With my wife.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.28,0:08:40.37,Default,,0,0,0,,罗宾逊先生 据说您前妻拥有\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Mr. Robinson, it says here your wife has
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.45,0:08:42.74,Default,,0,0,0,,您女儿的主要监护权\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}primary custody of your daughter.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.83,0:08:43.74,Default,,0,0,0,,是这样吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Is that correct?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.87,0:08:48.75,Default,,0,0,0,,是的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.83,0:08:51.04,Default,,0,0,0,,您介意告诉我是谁提出离婚的吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Do you mind if I ask you who ended the marriage?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.84,0:08:53.84,Default,,0,0,0,,是她\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}She did.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.17,0:08:57.01,Default,,0,0,0,,谢谢各位\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Thank you. All you.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.09,0:08:58.76,Default,,0,0,0,,肯普先生\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Mr. Kemp.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.39,0:09:01.64,Default,,0,0,0,,您是杂志作家\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}And you're a magazine writer?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.72,0:09:03.01,Default,,0,0,0,,是的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Uh, that's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.10,0:09:04.39,Default,,0,0,0,,您都写哪些类型的文章\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}What kind of articles do you write?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.47,0:09:05.98,Default,,0,0,0,,大多是特写\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Features, mostly.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.06,0:09:07.73,Default,,0,0,0,,您什么题材都会写吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}So you write about a variety of topics?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.81,0:09:09.02,Default,,0,0,0,,是的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.10,0:09:11.90,Default,,0,0,0,,您写过关于谋杀案审判的文章吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Ever written about a murder trial?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.98,0:09:15.23,Default,,0,0,0,,呃 我为一家地区生活类杂志撰稿\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Uh, well, I write for a regional lifestyle magazine
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.32,0:09:17.07,Default,,0,0,0,,杂志名气不大 不像《名利场》这种\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}so it's not exactly Vanity Fair.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.99,0:09:20.61,Default,,0,0,0,,那就是没写过\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Take that as a no.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.70,0:09:22.74,Default,,0,0,0,,作为作家 您应该经常阅读\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Being a writer, I imagine you read a lot.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.83,0:09:24.83,Default,,0,0,0,,您看到过关于此案的任何消息吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You've read anything about this case?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.91,0:09:27.08,Default,,0,0,0,,不 不 我今天第一次听说\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}No. No. Today's the first I've heard about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.16,0:09:29.75,Default,,0,0,0,,好的 我认为\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Well, then, I think you'll make
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.83,0:09:32.88,Default,,0,0,0,,你完全可以成为陪审团的一员\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}a perfectly acceptable member of this jury.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.96,0:09:35.59,Default,,0,0,0,,好的 辩方接受还是质疑\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}All right. Does the defense accept or challenge?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.17,0:09:39.93,Default,,0,0,0,,我们接受 法官大人\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}We accept him, Your Honor.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.01,0:09:44.47,Default,,0,0,0,,好的 请贾斯汀·肯普担任二号陪审员\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Good. Please enter Justin Kemp as juror number two.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.35,0:09:48.64,Default,,0,0,0,,-嘿  -嗨\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}-Hey. -Hi!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.73,0:09:50.52,Default,,0,0,0,,-嗨  -怎么样\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}-Hi. -How did it go?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.60,0:09:51.98,Default,,0,0,0,,不\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.06,0:09:53.52,Default,,0,0,0,,-我选上了  -不\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}-I got picked. -No.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.61,0:09:54.98,Default,,0,0,0,,-嗯  -真遗憾\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}-Mmm. -I'm so sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.07,0:09:56.57,Default,,0,0,0,,是啊\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.65,0:09:57.69,Default,,0,0,0,,说好的非常不成体统呢\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}What happened to "wildly inappropriate"?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.78,0:09:58.86,Default,,0,0,0,,呃 我把这种话留给你了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Ah. Well, I'm saving that for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.94,0:10:00.82,Default,,0,0,0,,哦 是吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.91,0:10:03.24,Default,,0,0,0,,他们说这个审判会很快\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}They said it'll be a short trial.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.32,0:10:04.45,Default,,0,0,0,,他们老这么说\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I feel like they always say that,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.53,0:10:06.16,Default,,0,0,0,,-但愿吧  -我知道\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}-but I hope so. -I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.95,0:10:08.12,Default,,0,0,0,,你今天如何\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}How was your day?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.20,0:10:10.58,Default,,0,0,0,,挺好的 我做了这个\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}It was okay. I did this.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.66,0:10:12.46,Default,,0,0,0,,是吗 进步很大啊 看上去不错\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yeah? It's good progress. Looks good.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.54,0:10:14.42,Default,,0,0,0,,-谢谢  -做了一整天吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}-Thank you. -All day?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.50,0:10:16.05,Default,,0,0,0,,不 这可没花我一整天时间\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}No, this did not take me all day.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.13,0:10:17.80,Default,,0,0,0,,-是吗  -我看了一部纪录片\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}-Yeah. -I watched a documentary...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.88,0:10:21.38,Default,,0,0,0,,-嗯 关于什么的  -我尿尿了94次\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}-Mmm-hmm. What about? -...and I peed 94 times.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.47,0:10:24.01,Default,,0,0,0,,-94次 好吧  -我还吃了些冰块\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}-Ninety-four? Okay. -And I ate some ice.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.09,0:10:25.26,Default,,0,0,0,,-哦  -我可以再吃点吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}-Ooh. -Can I have some more?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.35,0:10:26.31,Default,,0,0,0,,-你还想再来点冰块吗  -好啊\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}-You need some more? Ice? -Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.39,0:10:27.85,Default,,0,0,0,,冰块 好的 我去拿\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Ice. Coming up. All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.28,0:10:44.37,Default,,0,0,0,,人民需要知道 我会如何让这座城市变得更安全\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}The people need to know how I'll make this city safer.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.45,0:10:46.58,Default,,0,0,0,,女性需要知道\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}And women need to know that,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.66,0:10:48.37,Default,,0,0,0,,如果她们处于虐待关系中\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}if they're in an abusive relationship,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.45,0:10:49.79,Default,,0,0,0,,社区是她们的坚强后盾\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}their community has their back.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.87,0:10:52.08,Default,,0,0,0,,至于其他的 全都不用听\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}The rest? The rest is noise.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.16,0:10:53.50,Default,,0,0,0,,谢谢\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}So, thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.75,0:10:59.17,Default,,0,0,0,,谢谢大家\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Thank you, guys. Thank you for coming.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.34,0:11:01.67,Default,,0,0,0,,谢谢 非常感谢\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Thank you. Thank you so much.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.76,0:11:04.22,Default,,0,0,0,,谢谢 非常感谢\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Thank you. Hey! Thank you so much.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.30,0:11:05.72,Default,,0,0,0,,谢谢 太感激了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Thank you. I really appreciate it.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.80,0:11:07.18,Default,,0,0,0,,非常感谢\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Thank you so much. Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.72,0:11:10.10,Default,,0,0,0,,嘿 做得好\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hey. Good job.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.40,0:11:16.56,Default,,0,0,0,,-嘿  -嘿\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}-Hey. -Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.36,0:11:18.44,Default,,0,0,0,,演讲很出色\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Nice speech.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.07,0:11:23.45,Default,,0,0,0,,谢谢\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.53,0:11:25.41,Default,,0,0,0,,正义是付诸行动的真理\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}"Justice is truth in action"?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.49,0:11:27.70,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯 尼尔森教授说的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Mmm-hmm. Professor Nielsen.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.78,0:11:29.79,Default,,0,0,0,,是的 我记得\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yeah. No. Yeah, I remember.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.37,0:11:32.54,Default,,0,0,0,,你还相信这句话\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You still believe it?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.33,0:11:35.58,Default,,0,0,0,,当然\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.88,0:11:38.46,Default,,0,0,0,,好吧 只要\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}All right. As long as it doesn't
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.54,0:11:40.42,Default,,0,0,0,,不妨碍胜利就行 是吧\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}get in the way of a win, though, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.50,0:11:43.01,Default,,0,0,0,,我的天啊 埃里克 有话就说\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, my God. If you got something to say, Eric, just say it.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.09,0:11:45.76,Default,,0,0,0,,我是说\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Mmm. I'm saying, he...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.84,0:11:48.05,Default,,0,0,0,,你知道 他爱你 你是他最喜欢的学生\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You know, he loves you. You were his favorite student.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.72,0:11:51.18,Default,,0,0,0,,你真的要拿这说事吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Are you really going there?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.27,0:11:53.68,Default,,0,0,0,,-是 我就要  -我的天啊\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}-Yeah, I'm going there. -Oh, my God!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.77,0:11:55.35,Default,,0,0,0,,而你现在是\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}And now you're a...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.06,0:11:58.23,Default,,0,0,0,,什么\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.90,0:12:00.32,Default,,0,0,0,,我是什么\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I'm a what?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.40,0:12:01.94,Default,,0,0,0,,一名政客\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}A politician.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.28,0:12:07.57,Default,,0,0,0,,早上好\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Good morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.66,0:12:09.37,Default,,0,0,0,,我们首先进行开场陈述\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}We will begin with opening statements.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.45,0:12:10.66,Default,,0,0,0,,基乐布鲁女士\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Ms. Killebrew.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.54,0:12:16.33,Default,,0,0,0,,好的 案情是这样的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Okay. The facts of the case are these.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.42,0:12:19.88,Default,,0,0,0,,一年前的10月25日 被告詹姆斯·赛思\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}One year ago, on October 25th, the defendant, James Sythe,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.96,0:12:22.59,Default,,0,0,0,,和他彼时的女友肯德尔·卡特\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}and his then-girlfriend, Kendall Carter,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.67,0:12:24.21,Default,,0,0,0,,去罗迪秘境酒吧喝酒\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}went drinking at Rowdy's Hideaway
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.30,0:12:25.38,Default,,0,0,0,,在老采石场路\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}on Old Quarry Road.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.24,0:12:27.37,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8\fs18}罗迪秘境酒吧
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.02,0:12:35.77,Default,,0,0,0,,来吧 我走了那么远才到这儿\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Come on. I walked all the way up there and got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.85,0:12:37.65,Default,,0,0,0,,-喝了这杯  -我已经醉了 宝贝\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}-Take the drink. -I'm already drunk, babe.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.12,0:12:55.91,Default,,0,0,0,,情况变得紧张起来\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Things got tense.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.00,0:12:57.25,Default,,0,0,0,,他们吵了一架\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}They had a fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.33,0:12:58.50,Default,,0,0,0,,你这样做不公平\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Not fair what you're doing.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.58,0:12:59.96,Default,,0,0,0,,算了吧\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hey, leave it alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.04,0:13:01.84,Default,,0,0,0,,你到底怎么了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}What the hell is wrong with you?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.92,0:13:03.09,Default,,0,0,0,,我已经告诉你了 我不会跟你同居的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I've already told you. We're not moving in together.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.17,0:13:04.51,Default,,0,0,0,,我不会\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I'm not...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.59,0:13:05.96,Default,,0,0,0,,-这有什么问题吗  -别推我\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}-What is wrong with it? -Stop pushing me.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.05,0:13:07.13,Default,,0,0,0,,-我说了 住手  -我没推你\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}-I told you, stop... -I'm not pushing you.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.22,0:13:08.01,Default,,0,0,0,,我说了别推了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I said stop pushing!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.31,0:13:14.89,Default,,0,0,0,,老天\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Jesus Christ.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.97,0:13:16.56,Default,,0,0,0,,她冲出酒吧\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}She stormed out of the bar
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.64,0:13:18.14,Default,,0,0,0,,他跟了上去\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}and he followed her.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.65,0:13:21.94,Default,,0,0,0,,争吵还在升级\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}The fight escalated,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.02,0:13:24.11,Default,,0,0,0,,情况很快失控了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}and things quickly got out of control.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.86,0:13:27.53,Default,,0,0,0,,嘿\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.61,0:13:28.90,Default,,0,0,0,,你到底在干什么\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}What the hell are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.99,0:13:30.91,Default,,0,0,0,,-你在干什么  -离我远点\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}-What are you doing? -Get away from me.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.99,0:13:32.24,Default,,0,0,0,,别碰我\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Don't touch me.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.32,0:13:34.03,Default,,0,0,0,,-你怎么敢  -开什么玩笑\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}-How dare you? -Are you kidding me?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.83,0:13:42.88,Default,,0,0,0,,这是意料之中的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}It was par for the course.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.96,0:13:44.63,Default,,0,0,0,,他们争吵 分手\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}They'd argue. They'd break up.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.71,0:13:46.42,Default,,0,0,0,,第二天等他们都冷静下来\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}And they'd make up the next day
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.51,0:13:47.92,Default,,0,0,0,,两人又重归于好\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}after they both had calmed down.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.01,0:13:51.14,Default,,0,0,0,,这是他们常玩的游戏\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}It was basically a game.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.22,0:13:54.30,Default,,0,0,0,,这对情侣有过很多次暴力相向\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Now, this couple had a history of violent interactions,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.39,0:13:57.43,Default,,0,0,0,,但这次她是认真的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}but this time she was serious.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.52,0:13:59.02,Default,,0,0,0,,她受够他了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}She was done with him.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.10,0:14:02.60,Default,,0,0,0,,于是她离开了 走到马路上\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}So she left and headed down the road, on foot.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.03,0:14:19.58,Default,,0,0,0,,当晚只是又上演了一出经典戏码\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}So this was just another typical night of drama.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.66,0:14:23.08,Default,,0,0,0,,詹姆斯·赛思开车回了家\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}So James Sythe got in his car and he drove home.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.17,0:14:27.96,Default,,0,0,0,,他勃然大怒\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}He flew into a violent rage
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.05,0:14:31.01,Default,,0,0,0,,一路尾随肯德尔·卡特\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}and followed Kendall Carter down the road...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.68,0:14:34.64,Default,,0,0,0,,然后杀了她\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}where he proceeded to kill her.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.74,0:14:57.45,Default,,0,0,0,,他残暴地殴打她\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}He beat her viciously.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.53,0:15:00.12,Default,,0,0,0,,把她推下栏杆让她坠入下方的溪流\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}He pushed her over a railing to the creek below...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.66,0:15:03.04,Default,,0,0,0,,留她在那里等死\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}and left her to die.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.65,0:15:47.23,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8\fs18}注意 有鹿出没
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.71,0:15:52.67,Default,,0,0,0,,詹姆斯·赛思没有袭击她\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}James Sythe didn't attack her
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.76,0:15:54.51,Default,,0,0,0,,他也不可能推她\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}and he couldn't have pushed her
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.59,0:15:56.84,Default,,0,0,0,,因为他根本没去那里\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}because he wasn't there.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.47,0:16:04.06,Default,,0,0,0,,詹姆斯·赛思\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}James Sythe...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.73,0:16:07.90,Default,,0,0,0,,夺走了一条无辜的生命\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}took an innocent life.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.48,0:16:11.15,Default,,0,0,0,,詹姆斯·赛思\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}James Sythe...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.23,0:16:12.48,Default,,0,0,0,,是无辜的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}is an innocent man.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.41,0:16:17.82,Default,,0,0,0,,谢谢\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.35,0:16:45.18,Default,,0,0,0,,好家伙\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Damn, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.27,0:16:46.89,Default,,0,0,0,,-你没事吧  -没事\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}-You... You all right? -Mmm-hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.31,0:16:50.65,Default,,0,0,0,,就是看到那些犯罪现场的照片\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yeah. Just those crime scene pictures.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.65,0:16:52.90,Default,,0,0,0,,我的胃一向比较脆弱\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Never had a strong stomach.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.90,0:16:55.61,Default,,0,0,0,,哦\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.69,0:16:57.24,Default,,0,0,0,,好了 晚安\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}All right. Well, you have a good night.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.91,0:16:58.91,Default,,0,0,0,,晚安\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.13,0:17:14.63,Default,,0,0,0,,上帝 请赐予我安宁\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}God grant me the serenity
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.71,0:17:17.34,Default,,0,0,0,,去接受我无法改变的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}to accept the things that I cannot change,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.42,0:17:20.14,Default,,0,0,0,,请赐予我勇气 去改变我能改变的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}the courage to change the things that I can,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.22,0:17:22.80,Default,,0,0,0,,请赐予我智慧 以明辨两者\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}and the wisdom to know the difference.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.06,0:17:25.31,Default,,0,0,0,,大家都做得很好\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Great work, everybody.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.39,0:17:26.81,Default,,0,0,0,,请记得再来\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Keep coming back.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.89,0:17:28.77,Default,,0,0,0,,努力就会有收获\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}It works if you work it.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.85,0:17:30.06,Default,,0,0,0,,大家都很棒\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Great job, everybody.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.31,0:17:32.27,Default,,0,0,0,,好极了 兄弟\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Right on, bro!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.15,0:17:36.49,Default,,0,0,0,,你好 贾斯汀\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hey, Justin.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.57,0:17:37.69,Default,,0,0,0,,你好\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.78,0:17:39.07,Default,,0,0,0,,你今晚很安静\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You were quiet tonight.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.15,0:17:41.41,Default,,0,0,0,,是啊 我有些心事\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yeah. I've got a lot on my mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.49,0:17:43.03,Default,,0,0,0,,我看得出来\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yeah, I can tell.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.12,0:17:45.83,Default,,0,0,0,,你想聊聊吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You want to talk about it?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.91,0:17:49.04,Default,,0,0,0,,好吧 无论你在困扰什么 我的建议都是一样的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Okay, look, whatever it is, my advice is the same.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.12,0:17:51.08,Default,,0,0,0,,你知道该做什么\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You know what to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.17,0:17:52.96,Default,,0,0,0,,肮脏的只是我们的秘密而已\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}We're only as sick as our secrets.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.84,0:17:54.84,Default,,0,0,0,,是啊\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.92,0:17:56.17,Default,,0,0,0,,好了 我随时愿意效劳\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Okay, I'm always here for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.79,0:18:10.92,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8\fs18}老采石路凶杀案嫌犯被逮捕
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.46,0:18:16.76,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8\fs18}受害者的男友在周三接受讯问
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.98,0:18:29.35,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8\fs18}2021年10月25日 预产期
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.49,0:18:42.95,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8\fs18}交通肇事罪是什么意思
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.47,0:18:45.97,Default,,0,0,0,,在加班\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Working late?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.14,0:18:48.60,Default,,0,0,0,,我马上就撤 不打扰你\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Be out of your way in a minute.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.68,0:18:49.98,Default,,0,0,0,,没事 多久都行 我待会儿再过来\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Nah, take as long as you want, I'll come back.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.79,0:19:17.84,Default,,0,0,0,,-嗨  -嗨\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}-Hey. -Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.92,0:19:20.34,Default,,0,0,0,,-抱歉我晚回了  -没关系\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}-Sorry I'm late. -That's okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.42,0:19:21.55,Default,,0,0,0,,集会怎么样\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}How was the meeting?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.63,0:19:23.13,Default,,0,0,0,,挺好的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}It was good.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.22,0:19:25.05,Default,,0,0,0,,我会后留下和拉里聊了会儿\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I stayed after to talk with Larry for a bit.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.60,0:19:27.89,Default,,0,0,0,,你还好吗 你心跳好快\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You okay? Your heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.97,0:19:30.27,Default,,0,0,0,,你还好吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}-Hmm? -Are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.73,0:19:32.73,Default,,0,0,0,,我没事\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yeah, I'm good.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.02,0:19:35.60,Default,,0,0,0,,一切都会好的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Everything's going to be fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.23,0:19:39.11,Default,,0,0,0,,我们很快就要有自己的小家庭了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}We're going to be a family soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.19,0:19:40.86,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.94,0:19:43.07,Default,,0,0,0,,希望再快一点\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Very soon, I hope.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.67,0:19:57.63,Default,,0,0,0,,什么鬼\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}What the...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.06,0:20:13.43,Default,,0,0,0,,我在酒吧里见过他们几回\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I'd seen them in there before. A couple times.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.52,0:20:16.14,Default,,0,0,0,,总是老样子\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Um, it was always the same thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.23,0:20:19.27,Default,,0,0,0,,一开始互相调笑\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}They would start off fun and flirty, and then,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.36,0:20:21.61,Default,,0,0,0,,等几杯酒下肚就变了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}after a few drinks, things would change.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.69,0:20:23.53,Default,,0,0,0,,变成什么样\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Change, how?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.61,0:20:25.74,Default,,0,0,0,,那天晚上 她走进来\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}That night, she came in,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.82,0:20:29.78,Default,,0,0,0,,想和他认真地谈一谈\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}trying to talk to him, like, seriously, you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.87,0:20:32.95,Default,,0,0,0,,但他不想\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}But he wasn't having it.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.04,0:20:34.20,Default,,0,0,0,,你想怎样\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}What's wrong with you?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.29,0:20:35.62,Default,,0,0,0,,你想让我反对吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}What, do you want me to disagree?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.71,0:20:37.25,Default,,0,0,0,,不 我想让你说 我也爱你\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}No. I want you to say, "I love you, too."
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.13,0:20:39.38,Default,,0,0,0,,我就是这个意思\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I basically did.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.46,0:20:40.59,Default,,0,0,0,,我想让你说 我也爱你\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I want you to say, "I love you, too."
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.67,0:20:42.13,Default,,0,0,0,,你自己不能意会吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Read between the goddamn lines,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.21,0:20:43.84,Default,,0,0,0,,我说了 是啊\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I said, "Yeah."
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.92,0:20:45.42,Default,,0,0,0,,-意会什么  -我受够了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}-What lines? -I'm sick of this shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.51,0:20:46.68,Default,,0,0,0,,你要我从哪里意会\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}What lines are you talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.76,0:20:47.63,Default,,0,0,0,,滚开\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hey, get out of my face!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.14,0:20:52.72,Default,,0,0,0,,他生气了 发了很大的火\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}He got mad. Like, scary.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.81,0:20:54.14,Default,,0,0,0,,她离开了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}She leaves.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.39,0:20:59.48,Default,,0,0,0,,他跟着她出去 我就也跟上了他们\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}He follows her outside. So I started following.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.56,0:21:00.69,Default,,0,0,0,,喂\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.69,0:21:03.15,Default,,0,0,0,,你他妈的在干什么\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}What the hell are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.23,0:21:04.69,Default,,0,0,0,,你要干什么\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.78,0:21:05.69,Default,,0,0,0,,我想回家\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I want to go home.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.82,0:21:09.74,Default,,0,0,0,,-我不想再这样了  -怎样\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}-I don't want to do this anymore. - -Do what?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.82,0:21:11.99,Default,,0,0,0,,我受够了 你总让我难堪\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I'm done. You're embarrassing!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.08,0:21:13.12,Default,,0,0,0,,你到底在说什么\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}What are you talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.20,0:21:14.49,Default,,0,0,0,,谁在乎那些白痴在想什么\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Who cares what these idiots think?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.79,0:21:18.71,Default,,0,0,0,,你要干什么 打我吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}What are you going to do? Hit me?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.79,0:21:20.17,Default,,0,0,0,,-放轻松 对不起  -别碰我\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}-Relax. I'm sorry. -Don't touch me.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.25,0:21:21.46,Default,,0,0,0,,-我只是  -你要干什么\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}-It was... -What are you going to do?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.54,0:21:23.50,Default,,0,0,0,,-你怎么敢  -你开什么玩笑\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}-How dare you? -Are you kidding me?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.59,0:21:24.50,Default,,0,0,0,,来啊\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Bring it on!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.84,0:21:28.80,Default,,0,0,0,,你最好马上滚开\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You better get the fuck out of here right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.72,0:21:35.43,Default,,0,0,0,,好啊 走回家吧 还冒着雨 你个蠢女人\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Fine, walk home, in the rain, you stupid bitch!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.81,0:21:41.19,Default,,0,0,0,,-肯德尔 这事没完  -我受够了 詹姆斯\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}-And, Kendall, we ain't over! -I'm done, James.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.32,0:21:52.20,Default,,0,0,0,,她就走了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}So she left,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.28,0:21:53.83,Default,,0,0,0,,然后呢\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}then what happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.91,0:21:55.91,Default,,0,0,0,,他跟着她出了停车场\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}He followed her out of the parking lot
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.99,0:21:58.08,Default,,0,0,0,,上了老采石场路\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}and onto Old Quarry Road.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.16,0:22:00.96,Default,,0,0,0,,谢谢 没有其它问题了 法官大人\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Thank you. No further questions, Your Honor.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.50,0:22:05.21,Default,,0,0,0,,那你是看见他上了老采石场路了吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}So you saw him walk down Old Quarry Road?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.71,0:22:07.38,Default,,0,0,0,,是的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.46,0:22:08.88,Default,,0,0,0,,你知道他的车就停在\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Did you know that his car was parked
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.97,0:22:10.18,Default,,0,0,0,,老采石场路上吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}down on Old Quarry Road?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.55,0:22:12.47,Default,,0,0,0,,不知道\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.60,0:22:15.10,Default,,0,0,0,,不知道\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.18,0:22:16.89,Default,,0,0,0,,你当晚喝酒了吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Were you drinking that night?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.97,0:22:18.18,Default,,0,0,0,,反对 法官大人\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Objection, Your Honor.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.81,0:22:20.39,Default,,0,0,0,,无效\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Overruled.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.48,0:22:22.10,Default,,0,0,0,,你当晚喝酒了吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Were you drinking that night?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.06,0:22:24.44,Default,,0,0,0,,喝了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.52,0:22:27.23,Default,,0,0,0,,你并不知道他那天跟着她\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}So you don't know how far he followed her
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.32,0:22:30.90,Default,,0,0,0,,在老采石场路上走了多远 对吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}down Old Quarry Road, do you?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.99,0:22:32.61,Default,,0,0,0,,不知道 那时候\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}No. Um, at that point,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.70,0:22:34.99,Default,,0,0,0,,我没在拍了 我回酒吧了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I had stopped filming and I went back inside.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:36.16,0:22:38.41,Default,,0,0,0,,没有其它问题了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}No more questions.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.50,0:22:41.04,Default,,0,0,0,,控方还有要问的吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Does the State have any more questions?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.12,0:22:42.46,Default,,0,0,0,,没有其他问题了 法官大人\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}No more questions, Your Honor.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.67,0:22:49.09,Default,,0,0,0,,谢谢 你可以离席了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Thank you. You may step down.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.17,0:22:51.63,Default,,0,0,0,,我一直待到酒吧关门\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I was at the bar till close.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.72,0:22:54.47,Default,,0,0,0,,我没看见他们中任何一人回来\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I didn't see either one of them come back in.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.55,0:22:56.01,Default,,0,0,0,,第二天我开门的时候\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}And then the next day, I opened,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:56.10,0:22:57.47,Default,,0,0,0,,做了我平常会做的事\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}and I did what I always do.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.56,0:22:59.93,Default,,0,0,0,,把前一晚的垃圾扔掉\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I took the night's trash out to the dumpster.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:03.52,0:23:06.52,Default,,0,0,0,,小姐 小姐 抱歉 我需要帮助\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Miss! Miss! I'm sorry. I need your help.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:06.61,0:23:09.48,Default,,0,0,0,,因为昨晚的雨\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Because of the rain the night before...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:09.57,0:23:11.82,Default,,0,0,0,,小路又湿又泥泞\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}the trails were all muddy and wet.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:14.91,0:23:16.95,Default,,0,0,0,,我只能过桥抄近道走老采石场路\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}So I had to cut up to Old Quarry by the bridge
Dialogue: 0,0:23:17.03,0:23:18.70,Default,,0,0,0,,才能回到马路上\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}in order to get back to the road.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.85,0:23:38.18,Default,,0,0,0,,好的 我们明确一下\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Right. And just to be clear,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:38.26,0:23:40.27,Default,,0,0,0,,当你发现肯德尔·卡特的时候\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}when you found Kendall Carter,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:40.97,0:23:42.27,Default,,0,0,0,,她已经死了吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}she was dead?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:44.48,0:23:47.31,Default,,0,0,0,,她的头在一片血泊中\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Her head was in a pool of blood.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:48.44,0:23:49.52,Default,,0,0,0,,场面很可怕\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}It was awful.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:52.65,0:23:54.24,Default,,0,0,0,,感谢您的证词 里德先生\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Thank you for your testimony, Mr. Reed.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:54.32,0:23:55.53,Default,,0,0,0,,我知道聊这些并不容易\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I know it isn't easy.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:57.03,0:23:58.16,Default,,0,0,0,,我提问完毕\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}That's all I have.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:00.29,0:24:02.16,Default,,0,0,0,,雷斯尼克先生 交给你了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Mr. Resnick, your witness.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:03.41,0:24:05.17,Default,,0,0,0,,里德先生\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Mr. Reed,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:05.25,0:24:08.08,Default,,0,0,0,,你经常在林间小路上徒步 对吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}you hike those trails in the woods frequently, don't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:09.21,0:24:10.34,Default,,0,0,0,,是的 先生\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:10.42,0:24:12.13,Default,,0,0,0,,一周至少两次\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Twice a week at least.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:12.21,0:24:14.88,Default,,0,0,0,,你认为在山坡下方徒步是不是很困难\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}In your opinion, is the hike down the hillside difficult?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:15.68,0:24:17.34,Default,,0,0,0,,是的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:17.43,0:24:19.43,Default,,0,0,0,,我猜测你徒步的时候\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I assume you wear hiking boots
Dialogue: 0,0:24:19.51,0:24:21.10,Default,,0,0,0,,是穿登山靴的对吗 里德先生\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}when you hike, Mr. Reed? Is that correct?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:22.89,0:24:24.35,Default,,0,0,0,,当然\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:24.43,0:24:27.65,Default,,0,0,0,,这张照片是那天早上你在老采石场路下方\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}This is a picture of Kendall Carter
Dialogue: 0,0:24:27.73,0:24:31.36,Default,,0,0,0,,发现的肯德尔·卡特\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}the morning you found her below Old Quarry Road.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:31.44,0:24:33.90,Default,,0,0,0,,可以请您告诉我们她穿着什么样的鞋子吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Can you please tell us what kind of shoes she's wearing?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:36.99,0:24:38.20,Default,,0,0,0,,像高跟鞋\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Looks like heels.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:39.95,0:24:42.12,Default,,0,0,0,,高跟鞋\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Heels.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:42.20,0:24:45.00,Default,,0,0,0,,如果当晚她是穿着高跟鞋冒着狂风暴雨\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}And if she's walking along the edge of Old Quarry Road
Dialogue: 0,0:24:45.08,0:24:49.54,Default,,0,0,0,,沿着老采石场路边上走\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}in a blinding rainstorm at night, in heels,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:49.63,0:24:52.92,Default,,0,0,0,,突然失去平衡的话\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}and she suddenly lost her footing,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:53.00,0:24:54.80,Default,,0,0,0,,她几乎一定会\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}it'd be next to impossible
Dialogue: 0,0:24:54.88,0:24:56.72,Default,,0,0,0,,摔下去 对吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}to prevent herself from falling, isn't that correct?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:59.76,0:25:00.51,Default,,0,0,0,,是的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:03.77,0:25:04.64,Default,,0,0,0,,谢谢\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:06.52,0:25:08.90,Default,,0,0,0,,她是着地时面朝下\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}She landed in a posterior position,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:08.98,0:25:12.77,Default,,0,0,0,,这表明她是被推下来而不是摔下来的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}which suggests she was pushed, as opposed to a fall.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:12.86,0:25:15.11,Default,,0,0,0,,尸僵表明受害者\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Rigor mortis indicated the victim had been dead
Dialogue: 0,0:25:15.19,0:25:16.90,Default,,0,0,0,,已死亡九小时左右\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}for around nine hours.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:16.99,0:25:18.15,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:18.24,0:25:19.66,Default,,0,0,0,,死因呢\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}And the cause of death?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:19.74,0:25:21.99,Default,,0,0,0,,她颅骨骨折的严重程度表明\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}The severity of her skull fractures suggests
Dialogue: 0,0:25:22.08,0:25:25.37,Default,,0,0,0,,她遭受了不明钝器的袭击\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}she was struck with a non-specific blunt instrument.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:26.66,0:25:28.54,Default,,0,0,0,,死亡性质呢\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}And the manner of death?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:29.87,0:25:30.75,Default,,0,0,0,,他杀\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Homicide.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:33.09,0:25:34.96,Default,,0,0,0,,谢谢 没有其它问题了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Thank you. No more questions.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:38.38,0:25:40.93,Default,,0,0,0,,交给你了 雷斯尼克先生\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}The witness is yours, Mr. Resnick.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:41.01,0:25:43.05,Default,,0,0,0,,她的头部损伤是否有可能是\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Is it possible that she sustained
Dialogue: 0,0:25:43.14,0:25:45.14,Default,,0,0,0,,撞到岩石造成的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}her head injuries from hitting the rocks?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:45.22,0:25:46.85,Default,,0,0,0,,有这个可能\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Possible, sure,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:46.93,0:25:48.31,Default,,0,0,0,,但从我的专业角度来看可能性不高\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}but in my professional opinion, it's not likely.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:48.39,0:25:49.98,Default,,0,0,0,,但确实有这个可能\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}But possible.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:53.11,0:25:53.98,Default,,0,0,0,,我没有其它问题了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}That's all from me.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:59.07,0:26:01.78,Default,,0,0,0,,感谢你的证词 你可以离席了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Thank you for your testimony. You may step down.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:06.16,0:26:07.66,Default,,0,0,0,,去年的10月25日\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}On October 25th of last year,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:07.75,0:26:09.12,Default,,0,0,0,,你住在老采石场路上\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}you lived on Old Quarry Road.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:09.21,0:26:11.29,Default,,0,0,0,,-对吗  -是的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}-Correct? -Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:11.37,0:26:12.96,Default,,0,0,0,,你记得那晚是否有发生过任何不寻常的事情吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}And do you remember anything unusual happening that evening?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:13.04,0:26:16.46,Default,,0,0,0,,我看见一个男人在暴雨里下了车\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I saw a man get out of his car in a storm.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:16.55,0:26:17.84,Default,,0,0,0,,你还记得具体时间吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Do you remember what time that was?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:17.92,0:26:20.09,Default,,0,0,0,,11点48分准\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}It was 11:48 on the button.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:20.97,0:26:22.09,Default,,0,0,0,,我看了钟\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I looked at the clock.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:22.89,0:26:24.60,Default,,0,0,0,,我听见雷声\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I heard thunder,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:24.68,0:26:27.10,Default,,0,0,0,,于是我走近了窗户 闪电照亮了天空\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}and so I went to the window, and lightning lit up the sky.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:28.48,0:26:29.48,Default,,0,0,0,,那人就在那里\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}There he was.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:29.56,0:26:31.14,Default,,0,0,0,,他在干什么\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}What was he doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:31.23,0:26:34.48,Default,,0,0,0,,他看了看四周 去了路边\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}He looked around, he went over to the side of the road.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:37.11,0:26:39.61,Default,,0,0,0,,看了看栏杆外面\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Peered over the railing...
Dialogue: 0,0:26:39.69,0:26:43.53,Default,,0,0,0,,回到车上开走了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}got back in his car and drove off.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:43.62,0:26:44.99,Default,,0,0,0,,你那晚看到的那个男人\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}And is that man you saw that night
Dialogue: 0,0:26:45.07,0:26:46.41,Default,,0,0,0,,今天在法庭上吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}here in the courtroom today, do you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:46.49,0:26:47.62,Default,,0,0,0,,你能指出来吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Can you point him out?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:52.92,0:26:54.17,Default,,0,0,0,,是的 他现在就在这里\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yes, he is here today.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:55.84,0:26:58.25,Default,,0,0,0,,就是他\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}That's him right there.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:58.34,0:27:00.51,Default,,0,0,0,,请记录下证人指证了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Let the record reflect that the witness has identified
Dialogue: 0,0:27:00.59,0:27:02.80,Default,,0,0,0,,他看到的就是被告\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}the man he saw as the defendant,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:02.88,0:27:05.60,Default,,0,0,0,,詹姆斯·迈克尔·赛思\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}James Michael Sythe.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:05.68,0:27:07.06,Default,,0,0,0,,没有其它问题了 法官大人\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}No more questions, Your Honor.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:08.93,0:27:11.23,Default,,0,0,0,,好的 今天的庭审\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}All right. This feels like a good time
Dialogue: 0,0:27:11.31,0:27:13.39,Default,,0,0,0,,就到这里\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}to break for the day.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:13.48,0:27:16.77,Default,,0,0,0,,法庭休庭到明早九点\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}This court is in recess until 9:00 a.m. tomorrow morning
Dialogue: 0,0:27:16.86,0:27:19.53,Default,,0,0,0,,我们会继续今天的审判\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}when we will pick up here where we left off.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:31.70,0:27:32.75,Default,,0,0,0,,贾斯汀 怎么了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Justin, what's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:34.96,0:27:36.08,Default,,0,0,0,,我需要一位律师\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I need a lawyer.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:38.00,0:27:40.21,Default,,0,0,0,,行 给我一美元\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Okay. Give me a dollar.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:40.30,0:27:42.47,Default,,0,0,0,,我没在开玩笑 那样我们就有律师当事人保密特权了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}And I'm not joking, that gives us attorney-client privilege.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:42.55,0:27:43.55,Default,,0,0,0,,坐\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Take a seat.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:46.80,0:27:48.68,Default,,0,0,0,,我那天去放空自己\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}So I went to clear my head,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:48.76,0:27:51.31,Default,,0,0,0,,进到罗迪秘境酒吧\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}and found myself at Rowdy's Hideaway...
Dialogue: 0,0:27:52.93,0:27:54.73,Default,,0,0,0,,我点了杯酒坐了一会儿\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Ordered a drink and sat there for a while,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:54.81,0:27:56.44,Default,,0,0,0,,然后我起身离开了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}then I got up and left.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:56.52,0:27:59.44,Default,,0,0,0,,我走向车 当时在下雨\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I got to the car. It was raining.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:59.52,0:28:00.86,Default,,0,0,0,,我掉头开回老采石场路\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I turned back onto Old Quarry,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:00.94,0:28:03.07,Default,,0,0,0,,我开了四分之一英里的时候\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I went about a quarter of a mile
Dialogue: 0,0:28:03.15,0:28:04.53,Default,,0,0,0,,撞到了什么东西\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}and I hit something.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:05.99,0:28:07.28,Default,,0,0,0,,我下车四处看了看\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I got out of the car and I looked around.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:07.37,0:28:08.83,Default,,0,0,0,,我检查了一圈什么也没看到\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I checked, I didn't see anything,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:08.91,0:28:11.29,Default,,0,0,0,,我猜是只鹿逃跑了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}and I figured it was a deer that ran off,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:11.37,0:28:14.21,Default,,0,0,0,,然后我回到车上开回了家\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}and then I got back in the car and went home.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:17.38,0:28:19.54,Default,,0,0,0,,好的 那问题在哪里\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Okay, what's the problem?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:19.63,0:28:21.71,Default,,0,0,0,,我被传召去履行陪审义务\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I got called for jury duty.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:21.80,0:28:24.34,Default,,0,0,0,,-肯德尔·卡特的案子  -嗯\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}-The Kendall Carter case? -Mmm-hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:24.42,0:28:27.84,Default,,0,0,0,,他们在河床上发现了她的尸体\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}And they found her body in a creek bed,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:27.93,0:28:30.60,Default,,0,0,0,,就在去年十月离酒吧四分之一英里的地方\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}about a quarter mile from Rowdy's Hideaway last October.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:33.64,0:28:34.85,Default,,0,0,0,,你是什么意思\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}What are you telling me?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:38.44,0:28:39.61,Default,,0,0,0,,也许我撞到的不是鹿\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Maybe I didn't hit a deer.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:43.69,0:28:45.24,Default,,0,0,0,,我不知道该做什么\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I don't know what to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:47.24,0:28:48.57,Default,,0,0,0,,你在酒吧点了杯酒\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You were at a bar and you had a drink?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:48.66,0:28:50.20,Default,,0,0,0,,是的 但我没喝\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yes, but I didn't touch it.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:50.28,0:28:51.49,Default,,0,0,0,,那不重要\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Doesn't matter.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:51.58,0:28:52.83,Default,,0,0,0,,鉴于你的酗酒史\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Given your history,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:52.91,0:28:54.37,Default,,0,0,0,,世界上没有一个陪审团\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}there isn't a jury in the world
Dialogue: 0,0:28:54.45,0:28:55.87,Default,,0,0,0,,会相信你当时是清醒的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}that would believe you were sober.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:55.96,0:28:57.62,Default,,0,0,0,,但如果是我自愿站出来坦白的话\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}But if I was coming forward voluntarily,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:57.71,0:28:59.08,Default,,0,0,0,,肯定有些用的对吧\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}that has to count for something, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:59.17,0:29:00.42,Default,,0,0,0,,如果我站出来说出真相\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}If I come forward and I tell them the truth...
Dialogue: 0,0:29:00.50,0:29:01.79,Default,,0,0,0,,那你以前的醉驾记录\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Then your prior DUIs,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:01.88,0:29:03.55,Default,,0,0,0,,还有你确实去了酒吧的事实\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}and the fact that you were at a bar,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:03.63,0:29:04.80,Default,,0,0,0,,都会让本州公诉机关有理由\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}gives the State reason to charge you
Dialogue: 0,0:29:04.88,0:29:06.34,Default,,0,0,0,,以一级交通肇事罪\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}with first-degree vehicular homicide
Dialogue: 0,0:29:06.42,0:29:07.51,Default,,0,0,0,,甚至是重罪谋杀的罪名逮捕你\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}or even felony murder.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:07.59,0:29:09.43,Default,,0,0,0,,刑期可长达三十年至无期\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}That's 30 years to life.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:09.51,0:29:10.85,Default,,0,0,0,,什么\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:10.93,0:29:12.47,Default,,0,0,0,,如果你现在出庭坦白\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}If you were to come forward right now,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:12.56,0:29:13.85,Default,,0,0,0,,你就彻底完蛋了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}you will be completely screwed.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:16.39,0:29:17.44,Default,,0,0,0,,就这样\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}That's it?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:17.52,0:29:18.60,Default,,0,0,0,,呃\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Uh...
Dialogue: 0,0:29:22.90,0:29:23.78,Default,,0,0,0,,我很抱歉\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:26.74,0:29:29.07,Default,,0,0,0,,辩方传召詹姆斯·赛思 法官大人\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}The defense calls James Sythe, Your Honor.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:32.49,0:29:34.79,Default,,0,0,0,,请举起你的右手\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Please raise your right hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:34.87,0:29:36.62,Default,,0,0,0,,你是否发誓会说出真相\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Do you swear to tell the truth,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:36.70,0:29:38.92,Default,,0,0,0,,全部真相 也只说真相\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}the whole truth, and nothing but the truth,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:39.00,0:29:40.12,Default,,0,0,0,,向上帝起誓\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}so help you God?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:40.21,0:29:41.42,Default,,0,0,0,,是的 法官大人\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yes, Your Honor.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:41.50,0:29:43.67,Default,,0,0,0,,好的 请坐\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}All right. Have a seat.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:46.96,0:29:49.34,Default,,0,0,0,,请陈述你的姓名以备记录\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Please state your name for the record.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:49.43,0:29:51.09,Default,,0,0,0,,詹姆斯·迈克尔·赛思\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Uh, James Michael Sythe.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:53.43,0:29:55.01,Default,,0,0,0,,雷斯尼克先生 交给你了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Mr. Resnick, your witness.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:55.10,0:29:57.48,Default,,0,0,0,,好的 詹姆斯 我们来聊聊\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Okay, James, let's talk about what happened
Dialogue: 0,0:29:57.56,0:29:58.98,Default,,0,0,0,,10月25日那晚发生了什么\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}the night of October 25th.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:59.06,0:30:00.19,Default,,0,0,0,,你能告诉我们发生了什么吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Can you tell us what happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:00.27,0:30:02.19,Default,,0,0,0,,好的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yeah, um...
Dialogue: 0,0:30:02.27,0:30:03.77,Default,,0,0,0,,肯德尔和我去了罗迪秘境酒吧\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Kendall and I went to Rowdy's
Dialogue: 0,0:30:03.86,0:30:06.36,Default,,0,0,0,,去喝几杯 吃点东西\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}to have a few drinks, get some food.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:07.69,0:30:09.74,Default,,0,0,0,,我们玩得挺开心 喝了酒打了台球\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}We were having fun, shots and pool,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:09.82,0:30:12.16,Default,,0,0,0,,打了会儿飞镖\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}played some darts, you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:12.24,0:30:15.54,Default,,0,0,0,,有证词表明你们发生了争执\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Now, there's been testimony that you guys argued.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:15.62,0:30:17.54,Default,,0,0,0,,你不否认吧\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You don't deny that, do you?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:17.62,0:30:19.83,Default,,0,0,0,,不 不 确实\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}No. No, yeah. Um...
Dialogue: 0,0:30:19.91,0:30:22.58,Default,,0,0,0,,她喝得烂醉 她\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}She got really drunk and she was...
Dialogue: 0,0:30:22.67,0:30:23.71,Default,,0,0,0,,我们俩那时候有点摩擦\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}She was giving me a hard time.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:24.54,0:30:26.55,Default,,0,0,0,,你指什么\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}What do you mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:26.63,0:30:29.09,Default,,0,0,0,,她一直在念叨我们同居的事\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}She'd been going on about us moving in together
Dialogue: 0,0:30:29.17,0:30:30.88,Default,,0,0,0,,好几周了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}for a couple of weeks and I...
Dialogue: 0,0:30:30.97,0:30:32.43,Default,,0,0,0,,我一直告诉她\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}just kept telling her that I didn't think
Dialogue: 0,0:30:32.51,0:30:34.35,Default,,0,0,0,,我还没准备好\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}that I was ready.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:34.43,0:30:35.39,Default,,0,0,0,,我们 再说吧\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}We'll... We'll see.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:37.10,0:30:39.18,Default,,0,0,0,,-再说吧  -再说吧是什么意思\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}-We'll see. -What do you mean "We'll see"?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:39.27,0:30:41.69,Default,,0,0,0,,她根本听不进去 她说我不爱她\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}And she just wasn't having it. She said I didn't love her.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:43.52,0:30:45.11,Default,,0,0,0,,然后她气冲冲地走了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}And, uh, she stormed out.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:45.19,0:30:46.61,Default,,0,0,0,,之后发生了什么\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}And then what happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:47.69,0:30:49.82,Default,,0,0,0,,我们在停车场吵架\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}We argued in the parking lot.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:49.90,0:30:51.32,Default,,0,0,0,,我不想再这样下去了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I don't want to do this anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:51.40,0:30:53.28,Default,,0,0,0,,-哪样下去  -我想回家\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}-Do what? -I want to go home.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:54.03,0:30:55.28,Default,,0,0,0,,我受够了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I'm done.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:55.37,0:30:56.74,Default,,0,0,0,,好啊 那你就走吧 自己走回去\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Fine. Get out of here. Go walk home.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:58.75,0:31:01.08,Default,,0,0,0,,淋着雨 自己走回去吧\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Go walk home then. In the rain.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:04.79,0:31:07.21,Default,,0,0,0,,她已经完全疯了 你懂吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}And she was just out of her head, you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:07.30,0:31:09.63,Default,,0,0,0,,朝我尖叫 然后走了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Screaming at me and walked off.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:10.72,0:31:12.76,Default,,0,0,0,,然后你干了什么\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}And what did you do?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:12.84,0:31:14.84,Default,,0,0,0,,刚开始我跟着她\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Followed her, at first,
Dialogue: 0,0:31:14.93,0:31:17.31,Default,,0,0,0,,但是天很冷 又下着雨\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}but it was cold, it was raining.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:18.68,0:31:20.60,Default,,0,0,0,,我记得我上了车\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I remember getting in my car.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:20.68,0:31:22.35,Default,,0,0,0,,我停在\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}So I was parked next to, uh,
Dialogue: 0,0:31:22.44,0:31:23.90,Default,,0,0,0,,217公里标志牌旁边\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}mile marker 217.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:27.23,0:31:30.78,Default,,0,0,0,,我侄女的生日是2月17号 所以\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}My niece is born February 17th, so that just...
Dialogue: 0,0:31:33.15,0:31:35.20,Default,,0,0,0,,不知怎么的 我平静了下来\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I don't know, pulled me out of everything,
Dialogue: 0,0:31:35.28,0:31:37.83,Default,,0,0,0,,然后我调转车头开回了家\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}then I turned around and just drove home.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:44.96,0:31:47.79,Default,,0,0,0,,想着 我们明天还会像往常那样见面\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}And, um, we'd see each other the next day,
Dialogue: 0,0:31:47.88,0:31:49.55,Default,,0,0,0,,我们会把问题解决\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}and we'd work it out, like...
Dialogue: 0,0:31:51.01,0:31:51.92,Default,,0,0,0,,像以前一样\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}like always.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:53.97,0:31:57.60,Default,,0,0,0,,难道我蠢吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Look, was I stupid?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:57.68,0:32:00.14,Default,,0,0,0,,就因为不想跟她住在一起\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}For not wanting to move in with her?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:00.22,0:32:02.14,Default,,0,0,0,,不想天天见到她而杀人\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}So I could see her face every day?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:04.27,0:32:05.14,Default,,0,0,0,,当然 我是蠢\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Absolutely, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:07.15,0:32:09.36,Default,,0,0,0,,但我绝对不会对她下杀手\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}But I could never put my hands on her like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:13.69,0:32:15.24,Default,,0,0,0,,我做不到\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I couldn't do that to her.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:16.36,0:32:17.57,Default,,0,0,0,,我爱她\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I... I loved her.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:20.20,0:32:23.00,Default,,0,0,0,,我理解\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Now, look, I understand,
Dialogue: 0,0:32:23.08,0:32:26.21,Default,,0,0,0,,我以前 犯过很多错\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}with my past, and the mistakes that I've made,
Dialogue: 0,0:32:26.29,0:32:28.79,Default,,0,0,0,,我知道你们在想什么 我理解\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I know what you're thinking, I do. And I get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:31.46,0:32:33.30,Default,,0,0,0,,但是我\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}But I'm...
Dialogue: 0,0:32:33.38,0:32:34.97,Default,,0,0,0,,我不再是以前的我了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I'm not that guy anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:36.22,0:32:37.39,Default,,0,0,0,,我改变了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Okay, I've changed.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:39.30,0:32:41.39,Default,,0,0,0,,我不再过以前那种生活\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I left that life behind me, and I, you know...
Dialogue: 0,0:32:41.47,0:32:43.18,Default,,0,0,0,,我以为我做得很好\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I thought I was doing really good.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:45.06,0:32:47.85,Default,,0,0,0,,我不知道发生了什么\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I don't know what happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:48.77,0:32:49.81,Default,,0,0,0,,我开车回家了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I went home. I drove...
Dialogue: 0,0:32:49.90,0:32:51.19,Default,,0,0,0,,我只是开车回家了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I just... I drove home.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:57.78,0:32:59.87,Default,,0,0,0,,我知道你心里不好受 詹姆斯\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I know how difficult this is for you, James.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:01.74,0:33:03.74,Default,,0,0,0,,慢慢来\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You take your time, and...
Dialogue: 0,0:33:03.83,0:33:05.29,Default,,0,0,0,,等你调整好告诉我\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}let me know when you're ready.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:07.25,0:33:08.12,Default,,0,0,0,,可以了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I'm good.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:10.63,0:33:13.17,Default,,0,0,0,,我现在要播放一段视频 好吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I'm gonna show you a video now, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:13.25,0:33:14.88,Default,,0,0,0,,然后我要问你几个问题\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}And then I'm gonna ask you some questions.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:16.97,0:33:19.01,Default,,0,0,0,,没事的 我没生气\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}It's fine. I'm not mad.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:19.09,0:33:20.85,Default,,0,0,0,,为什么 你对我说这些\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Why didn't you say it to me?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:26.31,0:33:27.85,Default,,0,0,0,,你看到了吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Did you see that?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:27.94,0:33:29.65,Default,,0,0,0,,-是为你准备的  -真是我的好男友\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}-That's for you. -That's my guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:32.23,0:33:34.69,Default,,0,0,0,,-我爱你  -我也爱你\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}-I love you. -I love you, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:34.78,0:33:35.90,Default,,0,0,0,,你进球了吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Did you miss or make it?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:35.99,0:33:36.86,Default,,0,0,0,,不 我没有\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}No, I didn't make it.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:36.94,0:33:38.57,Default,,0,0,0,,你没进球\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You missed it.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:38.65,0:33:41.03,Default,,0,0,0,,让我帮帮你 你太幸运了 过来\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Well, let me help you. You're good luck. Come here.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:41.78,0:33:42.87,Default,,0,0,0,,是啊\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I was.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:50.21,0:33:51.58,Default,,0,0,0,,好了 别录了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Okay, turn that shit off.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:51.67,0:33:52.92,Default,,0,0,0,,好的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:56.76,0:33:57.76,Default,,0,0,0,,谁拍摄了这段视频\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Who took that video?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:58.55,0:33:59.68,Default,,0,0,0,,肯德尔\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Kendall.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:01.59,0:34:02.55,Default,,0,0,0,,什么时候\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}When?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:02.64,0:34:03.97,Default,,0,0,0,,10月25号\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}October 25th.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:05.26,0:34:06.18,Default,,0,0,0,,去年\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Of last year.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:06.81,0:34:07.93,Default,,0,0,0,,在哪里\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}And where?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:09.31,0:34:10.98,Default,,0,0,0,,罗迪秘境酒吧\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}At Rowdy's Hideaway.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:14.32,0:34:16.48,Default,,0,0,0,,谢谢你 詹姆斯 没有别的问题了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Thank you, James. No more questions.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:20.36,0:34:21.95,Default,,0,0,0,,控方 轮到你了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Prosecution, your witness.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:22.57,0:34:24.08,Default,,0,0,0,,赛思先生\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Mr. Sythe,
Dialogue: 0,0:34:24.16,0:34:27.12,Default,,0,0,0,,你刚刚说你爱肯德尔·卡特\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}you just stated that you loved Kendall Carter.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:27.20,0:34:29.08,Default,,0,0,0,,对吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Is that right?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:29.16,0:34:31.21,Default,,0,0,0,,-她是我的最爱  -嗯\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}-More than anything. -Hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:31.29,0:34:33.08,Default,,0,0,0,,10月25日的晚上\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}And on the night of October 25th,
Dialogue: 0,0:34:33.17,0:34:34.71,Default,,0,0,0,,你和肯德尔开车去罗迪秘境酒吧\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}you and Kendall drove to Rowdy's Hideaway.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:34.79,0:34:35.75,Default,,0,0,0,,对吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Is that right?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:35.84,0:34:38.38,Default,,0,0,0,,开我的车去的 是的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}We took my car, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:38.46,0:34:39.67,Default,,0,0,0,,你们到那里之后 你们俩\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}And when you got there, the two of you
Dialogue: 0,0:34:39.76,0:34:40.97,Default,,0,0,0,,开始喝酒 对吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}started drinking, is that right?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:42.22,0:34:44.26,Default,,0,0,0,,是的 那是个酒吧\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yeah. It's a bar.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:44.35,0:34:46.35,Default,,0,0,0,,然后你们俩产生了争执\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}And then the two of you started arguing.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:46.43,0:34:47.43,Default,,0,0,0,,对吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Is that right?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:48.27,0:34:48.98,Default,,0,0,0,,是的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:50.60,0:34:52.10,Default,,0,0,0,,争执中\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}And during this argument,
Dialogue: 0,0:34:52.19,0:34:54.52,Default,,0,0,0,,你打翻了一瓶啤酒\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}you knocked a beer bottle off the table.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:54.61,0:34:55.73,Default,,0,0,0,,对吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Is that right?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:57.19,0:34:59.28,Default,,0,0,0,,是的 我是不小心的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yeah, it was an accident.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:59.36,0:35:02.53,Default,,0,0,0,,然后她离开了 你跟着她\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}And then she left, and you went after her.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:02.61,0:35:03.45,Default,,0,0,0,,对吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Is that right?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:03.53,0:35:05.24,Default,,0,0,0,,是的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:05.32,0:35:08.83,Default,,0,0,0,,酒吧外面 你们接着吵\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}And outside, the argument continued, and...
Dialogue: 0,0:35:08.91,0:35:11.12,Default,,0,0,0,,根据你的证词\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}it is your sworn testimony,
Dialogue: 0,0:35:11.21,0:35:13.46,Default,,0,0,0,,你丢下肯德尔\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}that you left Kendall Carter alone
Dialogue: 0,0:35:13.54,0:35:15.88,Default,,0,0,0,,让她一个人独自走在狭窄的双车道路上\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}to walk down a narrow two-lane road
Dialogue: 0,0:35:15.96,0:35:19.01,Default,,0,0,0,,周围一片漆黑 下着瓢泼大雨 她烂醉如泥\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}in the dark, drunk, in the pouring rain,
Dialogue: 0,0:35:19.09,0:35:21.01,Default,,0,0,0,,在那个雷雨交加的夜晚\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}in the middle of a thunderstorm.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:23.09,0:35:25.01,Default,,0,0,0,,这就是你对待心爱之人的方式吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Is that how you treat someone you love?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:29.89,0:35:31.02,Default,,0,0,0,,我没有其它问题了 法官大人\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}No more questions, Your Honor.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:33.98,0:35:36.15,Default,,0,0,0,,辩方还有其它问题吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Are there any further questions from the defense?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:36.23,0:35:39.44,Default,,0,0,0,,没有了 法官大人 辩方已陈述完毕\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}No, Your Honor. The defense rests.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:39.53,0:35:42.36,Default,,0,0,0,,感谢你的证词 你可以暂时离席\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Thank you for your testimony, you can step down.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:51.25,0:35:52.54,Default,,0,0,0,,各位陪审员\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Members of the jury,
Dialogue: 0,0:35:52.62,0:35:54.79,Default,,0,0,0,,本案的举证部分已经结束\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}the evidence in this case is now closed.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:54.87,0:35:56.21,Default,,0,0,0,,律师们 你们可以开始\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Attorneys, you may give
Dialogue: 0,0:35:56.29,0:35:58.71,Default,,0,0,0,,陈述结案陈词了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}your closing arguments at this time.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:58.79,0:36:01.01,Default,,0,0,0,,各位陪审团成员\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Ladies and gentlemen of the jury...
Dialogue: 0,0:36:02.76,0:36:06.51,Default,,0,0,0,,肯德尔·卡特的死是一场残忍的犯罪\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Kendall Carter's murder was a savage crime
Dialogue: 0,0:36:06.59,0:36:08.39,Default,,0,0,0,,凶手是一名邪恶的男性\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}committed by an evil man.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:09.56,0:36:11.22,Default,,0,0,0,,一个无辜的男人\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}An innocent man.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:11.31,0:36:15.14,Default,,0,0,0,,一个无辜的男人因为失去挚爱\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}An innocent man who was shattered
Dialogue: 0,0:36:15.23,0:36:18.56,Default,,0,0,0,,生活支离破碎\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}from losing the love of his life.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:18.65,0:36:20.78,Default,,0,0,0,,有一名目击者在受害人死亡当晚\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}We have an eyewitness who saw him at the crime scene
Dialogue: 0,0:36:20.86,0:36:23.03,Default,,0,0,0,,在犯罪现场看见了他\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}at the time of death.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:23.11,0:36:26.28,Default,,0,0,0,,那是个风雨交加的午夜 视线受阻\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}In the middle of the night, in a blinding rainstorm...
Dialogue: 0,0:36:27.28,0:36:28.74,Default,,0,0,0,,谁都有可能是凶手\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}it could have been anyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:28.82,0:36:30.79,Default,,0,0,0,,她跟他分手的那天晚上\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}When she broke up with him that night,
Dialogue: 0,0:36:30.87,0:36:33.41,Default,,0,0,0,,他意识到她是认真的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}and he realized she meant it,
Dialogue: 0,0:36:33.50,0:36:34.50,Default,,0,0,0,,他发狂了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}he snapped.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:35.87,0:36:37.46,Default,,0,0,0,,所以他残暴地袭击了她\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}And so he bludgeoned her.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:37.54,0:36:41.05,Default,,0,0,0,,本案没有发现凶器 完全没有\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}No murder weapon was recovered. Nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:41.63,0:36:43.17,Default,,0,0,0,,什么都没有\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:43.26,0:36:46.26,Default,,0,0,0,,受害者全身各处都检测到了被告的DNA\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}The defendant's DNA was all over the victim.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:46.34,0:36:47.59,Default,,0,0,0,,只有他一人的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}No one else's.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:47.68,0:36:49.39,Default,,0,0,0,,检方说发现了DNA证据\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}The State says there was DNA.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:49.47,0:36:51.97,Default,,0,0,0,,当然会有他的DNA了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Of course, there was DNA. Of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:52.06,0:36:53.43,Default,,0,0,0,,他们是情侣\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}They were a couple.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:53.52,0:36:55.98,Default,,0,0,0,,当然 他们曾经是情侣\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yeah, of course, they were a couple.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:56.06,0:36:57.73,Default,,0,0,0,,但后来他们不是了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Until they weren't.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:57.81,0:37:01.86,Default,,0,0,0,,詹姆斯·赛思勇敢地出庭作证\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}James Sythe bravely took the stand
Dialogue: 0,0:37:01.94,0:37:04.53,Default,,0,0,0,,艰难地陈述了事实\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}and admitted to some difficult truths.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:04.61,0:37:06.03,Default,,0,0,0,,作证\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}That?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:06.11,0:37:08.95,Default,,0,0,0,,那全是表演\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}That was all a performance, nothing else.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:09.62,0:37:11.41,Default,,0,0,0,,听着\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Look...
Dialogue: 0,0:37:11.49,0:37:14.66,Default,,0,0,0,,我觉得我们都同意\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I think we can all agree on this.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:14.75,0:37:18.12,Default,,0,0,0,,那个杀害肯德尔·卡特的人\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}The person responsible for Kendall Carter's death
Dialogue: 0,0:37:19.00,0:37:20.67,Default,,0,0,0,,要接受正义的审判\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}deserves to face justice.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:21.75,0:37:24.09,Default,,0,0,0,,那个人就是詹姆斯·赛思\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}That person is James Sythe.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:25.13,0:37:26.26,Default,,0,0,0,,但是那个人\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}But that person,
Dialogue: 0,0:37:27.38,0:37:28.68,Default,,0,0,0,,那个邪恶的人\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}that evil man,
Dialogue: 0,0:37:29.89,0:37:31.14,Default,,0,0,0,,依旧逍遥法外\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}is still out there.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:33.01,0:37:36.18,Default,,0,0,0,,我希望你们作出裁定\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}All I ask is that you deliver a verdict
Dialogue: 0,0:37:36.27,0:37:37.69,Default,,0,0,0,,揭示真相\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}that speaks the truth.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:39.06,0:37:41.94,Default,,0,0,0,,肯德尔到底遭遇了什么\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}The truth about what happened to Kendall.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:42.02,0:37:44.82,Default,,0,0,0,,那天夜里老采石场路上到底发生了什么\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}The truth about what happened on Old Quarry Road that night.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:46.32,0:37:47.90,Default,,0,0,0,,还有他到底做了什么\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}And the truth about him.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:51.57,0:37:53.03,Default,,0,0,0,,真相就是\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}And the truth about him...
Dialogue: 0,0:37:54.08,0:37:56.16,Default,,0,0,0,,詹姆斯·赛思\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}is that James Michael Sythe
Dialogue: 0,0:37:57.25,0:37:58.16,Default,,0,0,0,,是有罪的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}is guilty.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:59.29,0:38:00.92,Default,,0,0,0,,请裁定他有罪\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Find him guilty.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:02.92,0:38:05.38,Default,,0,0,0,,事实是 詹姆斯·赛思\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}The truth is, James Sythe...
Dialogue: 0,0:38:06.21,0:38:08.17,Default,,0,0,0,,无罪\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}is not guilty.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:11.22,0:38:12.64,Default,,0,0,0,,请裁定詹姆斯·赛思\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Find James Sythe...
Dialogue: 0,0:38:14.10,0:38:15.18,Default,,0,0,0,,无罪\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}not guilty.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:17.93,0:38:19.14,Default,,0,0,0,,谢谢\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:24.23,0:38:26.57,Default,,0,0,0,,-祝你好运  -谢谢\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}-Good luck. -Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:26.65,0:38:27.86,Default,,0,0,0,,打扰了 各位\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Um, excuse me, everyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:27.94,0:38:29.78,Default,,0,0,0,,如果没有人反对的话\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}If... If nobody objects,
Dialogue: 0,0:38:29.86,0:38:32.16,Default,,0,0,0,,我想毛遂自荐\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I'd really like to throw my name into the ring
Dialogue: 0,0:38:32.24,0:38:33.32,Default,,0,0,0,,担任陪审团主席\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}to be the forewoman.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:33.41,0:38:34.78,Default,,0,0,0,,我曾经参加过几次陪审团\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I've served on multiple juries.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:34.87,0:38:36.20,Default,,0,0,0,,-我懂流程  -我没意见\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}-I know the ropes. -I'm cool with it.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:36.29,0:38:37.58,Default,,0,0,0,,-当然 没问题  -当然\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}-Yeah. Sure. -Sure!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:37.66,0:38:39.41,Default,,0,0,0,,-我不介意  -好的 谢谢\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}-I don't mind. -Okay, great. Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:39.50,0:38:42.92,Default,,0,0,0,,好的 那么我们现在有两个选择\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Okay. So right now we can do one of two things.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:43.00,0:38:44.75,Default,,0,0,0,,我们可以先投票再讨论\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}We can vote and talk,
Dialogue: 0,0:38:44.84,0:38:46.05,Default,,0,0,0,,或者先讨论再投票\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}or talk and vote.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:46.13,0:38:47.76,Default,,0,0,0,,我建议我们直接投票\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I suggest that we just vote
Dialogue: 0,0:38:47.84,0:38:49.38,Default,,0,0,0,,了解一下大家的立场\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}and just get an idea where we all stand.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:49.47,0:38:51.01,Default,,0,0,0,,-这样可以吗  -同意\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}-Does that sound good? -Agreed.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:51.09,0:38:53.89,Default,,0,0,0,,好的 我投有罪\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Okay. So I vote "guilty."
Dialogue: 0,0:38:53.97,0:38:56.43,Default,,0,0,0,,好的女士 我也是\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yes, ma'am. Me, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:56.51,0:39:01.02,Default,,0,0,0,,我也是 整件事都很令人遗憾\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Me three. This whole thing is such a shame.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:01.10,0:39:03.73,Default,,0,0,0,,是的 绝对是他干的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yeah. I definitely think that he did it.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:03.81,0:39:04.98,Default,,0,0,0,,毫无疑问\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Definitely.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:06.15,0:39:07.23,Default,,0,0,0,,我同意\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I agree.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:08.23,0:39:09.57,Default,,0,0,0,,一切都对得上\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Everything fits together.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:10.69,0:39:12.36,Default,,0,0,0,,是的 让他去坐牢吧\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yeah. Let him rot.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:13.82,0:39:15.37,Default,,0,0,0,,阿门\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Amen.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:15.45,0:39:19.20,Default,,0,0,0,,九个人 就是九票有罪\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Nine. So that is nine for guilty.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:20.50,0:39:22.37,Default,,0,0,0,,你呢 先生\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You, sir? Hi.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:22.46,0:39:24.29,Default,,0,0,0,,哦 我也同意有罪\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yeah. Oh, yeah. Yeah, guilty's cool.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:25.67,0:39:26.59,Default,,0,0,0,,好的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:27.21,0:39:28.42,Default,,0,0,0,,还有\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}And...
Dialogue: 0,0:39:28.50,0:39:30.26,Default,,0,0,0,,哦 你呢先生 你怎么看\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh! You, sir? How about you?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:30.34,0:39:32.13,Default,,0,0,0,,那孩子本该签认罪协议的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Kid should have pled out.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:34.30,0:39:35.93,Default,,0,0,0,,就剩一个人了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}And then there was one.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:47.44,0:39:49.86,Default,,0,0,0,,好的 那你的选择是\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}All right. So... what's it gonna be?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:49.94,0:39:51.28,Default,,0,0,0,,支持还是反对\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You with us or what?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:54.36,0:39:56.03,Default,,0,0,0,,啧\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Tsk.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:58.87,0:40:00.62,Default,,0,0,0,,你不想赶紧回家陪伴怀孕的妻子吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Don't you want to get home to your pregnant wife?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:00.70,0:40:01.91,Default,,0,0,0,,我当然想\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Of... Of course I do.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:02.00,0:40:03.29,Default,,0,0,0,,好的 所以有什么问题吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}All right. So what's the problem?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:05.83,0:40:07.29,Default,,0,0,0,,我们是在决定某个人的人生\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You know, this is somebody's life we're dealing with.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:07.38,0:40:09.42,Default,,0,0,0,,我们不应该先讨论一下吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Shouldn't we at least talk about it?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:12.34,0:40:14.59,Default,,0,0,0,,真好笑\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}This is a joke.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:14.68,0:40:16.59,Default,,0,0,0,,不 这是 应该深思熟虑的事情\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}No, it's, um... Look, it's a deliberation.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:16.68,0:40:19.01,Default,,0,0,0,,你们就这样把这个人送进监狱\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You are ready to send this man to prison,
Dialogue: 0,0:40:19.10,0:40:20.51,Default,,0,0,0,,可能会是一辈子 就这么草率吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}maybe forever, just like that?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:20.60,0:40:22.68,Default,,0,0,0,,所以呢\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}And?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:22.77,0:40:24.39,Default,,0,0,0,,我听了案情 你呢\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I heard the facts of the case. Did you?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:24.48,0:40:26.56,Default,,0,0,0,,是啊 那个律师没能证明他是清白的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yeah, right. The lawyer didn't prove,
Dialogue: 0,0:40:26.65,0:40:29.23,Default,,0,0,0,,没能排除合理怀疑\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}beyond a reasonable doubt, that he was innocent.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:29.32,0:40:30.73,Default,,0,0,0,,他不需要这么做\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Well, he doesn't have to.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:30.82,0:40:32.90,Default,,0,0,0,,举证责任在控方\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}The burden of proof is on the prosecution.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:32.99,0:40:35.28,Default,,0,0,0,,就没有人对詹姆斯·赛思有罪这件事情\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Does anyone have even the slightest hesitation
Dialogue: 0,0:40:35.36,0:40:36.86,Default,,0,0,0,,产生一丝犹豫吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}that James Sythe is guilty?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:36.95,0:40:39.70,Default,,0,0,0,,我的意思是\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I mean...
Dialogue: 0,0:40:39.78,0:40:41.87,Default,,0,0,0,,听着 如果你犹豫了你就没确定\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Look, if you have to think, you aren't sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:41.95,0:40:43.41,Default,,0,0,0,,不\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:43.50,0:40:45.25,Default,,0,0,0,,我确定的是 我家里还有三个小孩\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}What I'm sure of is, I got three kids at home
Dialogue: 0,0:40:45.33,0:40:46.50,Default,,0,0,0,,等着我回去照顾\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I got to get back to.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:46.58,0:40:48.08,Default,,0,0,0,,我们都有自己的生活\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Look, we all have lives.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:48.17,0:40:49.04,Default,,0,0,0,,没有人想呆在这里\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}None of us want to be here.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:49.13,0:40:51.17,Default,,0,0,0,,好的 要不我们\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Okay. Um, how about we...
Dialogue: 0,0:40:51.25,0:40:53.63,Default,,0,0,0,,要不你告诉我们你有什么疑问\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Why don't you just tell us what your issue is
Dialogue: 0,0:40:53.71,0:40:55.63,Default,,0,0,0,,或者有哪些疑问\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}or your issues are,
Dialogue: 0,0:40:55.72,0:40:57.47,Default,,0,0,0,,我们可以一起讨论一下\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}and... and then we can all talk through it?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:57.55,0:41:00.60,Default,,0,0,0,,我 没有问题\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, I don't have an... an issue. Uh...
Dialogue: 0,0:41:00.68,0:41:02.31,Default,,0,0,0,,那你就是喜欢挑事是吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Okay. So you just like pissing me off, then?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:02.39,0:41:04.31,Default,,0,0,0,,-还是怎么样  -不 听着 我\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}-Or what? -No. Look, I...
Dialogue: 0,0:41:04.39,0:41:05.56,Default,,0,0,0,,我是有一些疑问\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I have questions.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:05.64,0:41:08.48,Default,,0,0,0,,不 这只是你的愧疚在作祟\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Nah. That's just your guilt talking.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:09.98,0:41:10.90,Default,,0,0,0,,你什么意思\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}What do you mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:14.40,0:41:16.90,Default,,0,0,0,,你只是想回到自己的街区里\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You want to go home to your little neighborhood
Dialogue: 0,0:41:16.99,0:41:18.24,Default,,0,0,0,,告诉大家\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}and tell them,
Dialogue: 0,0:41:18.32,0:41:19.95,Default,,0,0,0,,我们做出了正确的裁定\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}"We did right by that boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:20.03,0:41:23.33,Default,,0,0,0,,我们像其他人一样给了他公正的裁决\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}We gave him a fair shake, just like anybody else."
Dialogue: 0,0:41:23.41,0:41:25.83,Default,,0,0,0,,哇哦 伙计 别这样 你干嘛这么针对他\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Whoa, man. Hold up. Why're you getting on him like that?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:25.91,0:41:27.04,Default,,0,0,0,,嘿 管好你自己\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hey, mind your own damn business,
Dialogue: 0,0:41:27.12,0:41:28.54,Default,,0,0,0,,好吗 小家伙\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}all right, little fella?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:28.62,0:41:30.58,Default,,0,0,0,,-你说什么  -够了 你们两个\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}-Excuse me? -That's enough. Both of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:33.13,0:41:35.34,Default,,0,0,0,,肯普先生请 继续\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Please, Mr. Kemp, go on.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:35.42,0:41:36.38,Default,,0,0,0,,谢谢你 女士\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Thank you, ma'am.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:37.72,0:41:39.05,Default,,0,0,0,,我想说的是\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}All I'm trying to say is,
Dialogue: 0,0:41:39.13,0:41:40.55,Default,,0,0,0,,我们先把其它事放一边\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}let's put everything else aside for a minute
Dialogue: 0,0:41:40.64,0:41:43.51,Default,,0,0,0,,就记住两个关键点\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}and just remember two key points. Um...
Dialogue: 0,0:41:43.60,0:41:45.85,Default,,0,0,0,,一 赛思选择了出庭而不是接受认罪协议\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}One, Sythe went to trial instead of taking a plea,
Dialogue: 0,0:41:45.93,0:41:48.94,Default,,0,0,0,,二 他选择作证而不是根据第五修正案保持沉默\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}and two, he testified instead of taking the Fifth.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:49.98,0:41:51.40,Default,,0,0,0,,对吧 我的意思是\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Right? I mean...
Dialogue: 0,0:41:51.48,0:41:53.11,Default,,0,0,0,,这不代表他无辜\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}it doesn't mean he's innocent,
Dialogue: 0,0:41:53.19,0:41:54.73,Default,,0,0,0,,但我觉得他值得我们花几个小时\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}but I think he's earned just a few hours of our time
Dialogue: 0,0:41:54.82,0:41:56.28,Default,,0,0,0,,确认一下\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}just to be sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:56.36,0:41:58.78,Default,,0,0,0,,他是对的 你说得对\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Uh, he's right. You're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:58.86,0:42:01.24,Default,,0,0,0,,我们应该花些时间仔细考虑一下\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}We should take the time and we should go over it.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:01.32,0:42:04.24,Default,,0,0,0,,好吧 好吧 但这是浪费时间\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Fine. Fine, but it's a waste of time.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:04.33,0:42:05.70,Default,,0,0,0,,换成任何其他十二个人\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Any other group of 12 people
Dialogue: 0,0:42:05.79,0:42:07.37,Default,,0,0,0,,都会得出和我们一样的结论\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}would arrive at the exact same decision we did.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:07.45,0:42:10.04,Default,,0,0,0,,没错 说到点子上了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Mmm-hmm. That part right there.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:11.63,0:42:14.63,Default,,0,0,0,,州政府站在真相这边\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}The State has the truth on its side.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:14.71,0:42:17.09,Default,,0,0,0,,詹姆斯·赛思会为他的所作所为付出代价\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}James Sythe is going to pay for what he did.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:17.17,0:42:19.43,Default,,0,0,0,,我会为肯德尔·卡特主持公道\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}And I will get justice for Kendall Carter
Dialogue: 0,0:42:19.51,0:42:23.22,Default,,0,0,0,,为每一位家暴的受害女性伸张正义\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}and every woman who is a victim of domestic abuse.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:23.30,0:42:24.93,Default,,0,0,0,,最新的民调显示\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}How do you feel about the latest polling
Dialogue: 0,0:42:25.01,0:42:26.85,Default,,0,0,0,,赛思案的判决可能对地区检察官选举\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}that a verdict in the Sythe trial
Dialogue: 0,0:42:26.93,0:42:28.64,Default,,0,0,0,,造成五个百分点的波动 你怎么看\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}carries a five-point swing in the district attorney race?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:28.73,0:42:29.85,Default,,0,0,0,,哦 拜托\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, come on. You...
Dialogue: 0,0:42:29.94,0:42:31.77,Default,,0,0,0,,你知道我不能对此发表评论\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You know I can't comment on that.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:31.85,0:42:33.44,Default,,0,0,0,,好了 谢谢大家\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Okay. Thank you, everybody.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:40.11,0:42:44.62,Default,,0,0,0,,那么我就先从我认为\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}So I'm just going to start with what I think
Dialogue: 0,0:42:44.70,0:42:47.16,Default,,0,0,0,,最具决定性的证据开始吧\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}is the most damning evidence.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:47.24,0:42:50.21,Default,,0,0,0,,目击者看见\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Which was the man who saw
Dialogue: 0,0:42:50.29,0:42:53.04,Default,,0,0,0,,赛思出现在那条路上的护栏旁边\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Sythe on the road, at the railing,
Dialogue: 0,0:42:53.13,0:42:55.42,Default,,0,0,0,,就在肯德尔·卡特尸体的正上方\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}directly above where Kendall Carter's body was found.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:55.50,0:42:57.09,Default,,0,0,0,,是的 没错\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yes, exactly.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:57.17,0:42:58.71,Default,,0,0,0,,所以还有什么好讨论的呢\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}So what's left to even talk about?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:58.80,0:43:00.47,Default,,0,0,0,,他住在桥对面\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Well, I mean, he was a few hundred feet away,
Dialogue: 0,0:43:00.55,0:43:01.80,Default,,0,0,0,,是从几百英尺之外看到的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}looking from across the bridge.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:01.88,0:43:03.80,Default,,0,0,0,,而且当时还是半夜\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}And it was the middle of the night,
Dialogue: 0,0:43:03.89,0:43:05.51,Default,,0,0,0,,下着大雨\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}and through pouring rain.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:05.60,0:43:06.93,Default,,0,0,0,,是啊 我其实在那边\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yeah. And I've actually done
Dialogue: 0,0:43:07.01,0:43:08.47,Default,,0,0,0,,做过很多景观美化工作\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}a bunch of landscaping work up there.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:08.56,0:43:10.48,Default,,0,0,0,,那里种满了树\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}That whole area is covered by trees.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:10.56,0:43:11.89,Default,,0,0,0,,很难看清楚\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}It'd be hard to see.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:11.98,0:43:14.40,Default,,0,0,0,,但他做了明确的指认\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}The man made a positive identification.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:14.48,0:43:16.82,Default,,0,0,0,,是 但他年纪也挺大了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yeah, but dude's kind of ancient, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:18.61,0:43:22.15,Default,,0,0,0,,这老家伙的矫正视力没问题\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Well, this old bird has 20-20 vision with my glasses.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:22.24,0:43:24.91,Default,,0,0,0,,拜托 这是他的证词 他没有撒谎\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Come on, y'all. It's his testimony. He's not lying.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:24.99,0:43:26.58,Default,,0,0,0,,他没理由撒谎啊\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I mean, why would he lie?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:26.66,0:43:28.20,Default,,0,0,0,,提出这个问题意味着我们认为他在撒谎\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}And the question here means that we think he's lying.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:28.29,0:43:29.95,Default,,0,0,0,,我不认为他在撒谎\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I don't think he's lying.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:30.04,0:43:31.00,Default,,0,0,0,,你觉得他在撒谎吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You think he's lying?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:31.08,0:43:32.79,Default,,0,0,0,,不 我不觉得\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}No, I don't think he's lying--
Dialogue: 0,0:43:32.87,0:43:33.83,Default,,0,0,0,,好 那我们为什么还要讨论\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Okay. So what the hell are we talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:33.92,0:43:35.33,Default,,0,0,0,,听着 我的意思是\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Look, I'm just saying... Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:35.42,0:43:37.34,Default,,0,0,0,,他看到有人在栏杆那里 对吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}The man, he saw somebody at the railing, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:37.42,0:43:38.59,Default,,0,0,0,,大家都同意吧\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Can we all agree on that?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:38.67,0:43:39.59,Default,,0,0,0,,-是的  -对\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}-Yeah. -Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:39.67,0:43:41.38,Default,,0,0,0,,好 那有没有可能\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Okay. So isn't it possible
Dialogue: 0,0:43:41.47,0:43:43.26,Default,,0,0,0,,-他看到的不是詹姆斯·赛思而是另有其人  -噢\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}-that he saw someone other than James Sythe? -Oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:43:43.34,0:43:46.01,Default,,0,0,0,,不不不 光聊可能性能聊一天呢\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Mmm-mmm. No, we can go back and forth all day on possibilities.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:46.09,0:43:47.35,Default,,0,0,0,,这样没用\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}That's not helpful.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:47.43,0:43:48.26,Default,,0,0,0,,-我觉得我们需要讨论这部分  -不 不\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}-Well, I think we should. -No, no, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:48.35,0:43:49.56,Default,,0,0,0,,不 这不归我们管\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}No. That's not our job.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:49.64,0:43:51.35,Default,,0,0,0,,我们只需要权衡事实\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Our job is to just weigh the facts.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:52.39,0:43:54.56,Default,,0,0,0,,好吧 事实是\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Okay. Fact.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:54.65,0:43:58.02,Default,,0,0,0,,有32%的凶杀案发生于伴侣之间\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}32% of homicides occur between domestic partners.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:58.11,0:43:59.94,Default,,0,0,0,,事实是 警方在发现尸体两天后\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Fact, the police arrested James Sythe
Dialogue: 0,0:44:00.03,0:44:01.86,Default,,0,0,0,,逮捕了詹姆斯·赛思\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}two days after they found the body.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:01.94,0:44:04.91,Default,,0,0,0,,事实是 他们从未审问过其他嫌疑人\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Fact, they never questioned any other suspects.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:04.99,0:44:06.99,Default,,0,0,0,,你电影看多了 老家伙\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You watch too much TV, old man.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:08.49,0:44:10.87,Default,,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:17.00,0:44:18.17,Default,,0,0,0,,你是警察\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You're a cop?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:19.96,0:44:21.38,Default,,0,0,0,,以前是\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I was.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:21.46,0:44:23.55,Default,,0,0,0,,在职二十二年 负责调查抢劫杀人案\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Twenty-two years. Robbery-homicide.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:25.30,0:44:27.59,Default,,0,0,0,,最后选择退休 来这里\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Finally took the buyout, came down here to get away
Dialogue: 0,0:44:27.68,0:44:29.56,Default,,0,0,0,,远离中西部残酷的冬天\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}from those brutal Midwest winters
Dialogue: 0,0:44:29.64,0:44:31.22,Default,,0,0,0,,也离孙辈们近一些\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}and be closer to the grandkids.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:31.31,0:44:33.23,Default,,0,0,0,,你为什么 为什么不和律师说\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Why didn't you... Why didn't you tell the lawyers?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:33.31,0:44:34.89,Default,,0,0,0,,因为没人问我\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}'Cause nobody asked.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:34.98,0:44:36.85,Default,,0,0,0,,瞧瞧\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}How about that.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:36.94,0:44:39.31,Default,,0,0,0,,这是他们的损失 我们走运了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Well, their loss is our gain.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:39.40,0:44:41.23,Default,,0,0,0,,那你怎么看 警官\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}So what are you thinking, officer?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:41.32,0:44:42.86,Default,,0,0,0,,我是警探\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Uh, Detective.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:42.94,0:44:44.03,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Um...
Dialogue: 0,0:44:44.11,0:44:45.49,Default,,0,0,0,,听着 我认为\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Look, I think...
Dialogue: 0,0:44:45.57,0:44:47.28,Default,,0,0,0,,我认为警方\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}It seems to me like the police,
Dialogue: 0,0:44:47.36,0:44:48.74,Default,,0,0,0,,跟随着证据\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}you know, followed the evidence,
Dialogue: 0,0:44:48.82,0:44:50.66,Default,,0,0,0,,找到了他们要找的人然后立了案\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}found their guy, built their case.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:50.74,0:44:52.91,Default,,0,0,0,,这么做有什么不妥吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Okay. So what's wrong with that?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:53.00,0:44:54.91,Default,,0,0,0,,可能不会有什么问题 但这种狭窄视野\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}It may be nothing, but tunnel vision like that
Dialogue: 0,0:44:55.00,0:44:56.75,Default,,0,0,0,,可能会搬起石头砸自己的脚\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}can really bite you in the ass.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:56.83,0:44:58.88,Default,,0,0,0,,他们把赛思推给目击者看\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}They feed Sythe to that eyewitness,
Dialogue: 0,0:44:58.96,0:45:01.21,Default,,0,0,0,,他自然就会指认这个人\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}so, of course, that's who he IDs.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:01.30,0:45:03.13,Default,,0,0,0,,他们既然认为抓对了人\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Now they're sure they got their guy,
Dialogue: 0,0:45:03.21,0:45:05.42,Default,,0,0,0,,就会自动忽视其它与案件相关的事情\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}so they just ignore anything that doesn't help their case.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:05.51,0:45:08.22,Default,,0,0,0,,他们不再提出质疑\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}They stop asking questions.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:08.30,0:45:09.51,Default,,0,0,0,,确认偏误\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Confirmation bias.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:09.60,0:45:11.64,Default,,0,0,0,,没错 就是确认偏误\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yeah, confirmation bias. Exactly.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:11.72,0:45:12.81,Default,,0,0,0,,确认偏误\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Confirmation bias.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:12.89,0:45:14.64,Default,,0,0,0,,没人怀有恶意\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}There's no bad intentions.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:14.73,0:45:17.39,Default,,0,0,0,,只是有一群人企图做对的事情\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}It's just a bunch of people trying to do the right thing,
Dialogue: 0,0:45:17.48,0:45:20.77,Default,,0,0,0,,而看不到自己做错了什么\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}and they can't see everything they're doing wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:20.86,0:45:23.11,Default,,0,0,0,,很有道理\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}It's a good point.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:23.19,0:45:26.70,Default,,0,0,0,,那他们一直在讨论的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}And what about this blunt instrument murder weapon
Dialogue: 0,0:45:26.78,0:45:28.20,Default,,0,0,0,,杀人钝器是怎么回事\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}they kept talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:28.28,0:45:31.03,Default,,0,0,0,,公诉人说他们没有找到\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}The prosecutor said they couldn't recover it.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:31.12,0:45:33.45,Default,,0,0,0,,被告处理掉了凶器 这事不难\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}So he got rid of it. That's easy to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:33.54,0:45:34.87,Default,,0,0,0,,或者他可能用其他方式\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Or he could have killed her
Dialogue: 0,0:45:34.95,0:45:37.71,Default,,0,0,0,,杀了被害人\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}with something other than a blunt instrument.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:37.79,0:45:38.75,Default,,0,0,0,,比如呢\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Like what?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:40.21,0:45:42.71,Default,,0,0,0,,比如汽车\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Like a car?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:42.79,0:45:44.05,Default,,0,0,0,,可能是肇事逃逸\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}It could have been a hit-and-run.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:46.17,0:45:47.47,Default,,0,0,0,,噢 该死\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:47.55,0:45:48.76,Default,,0,0,0,,-来 我来帮你  -我很抱歉 抱歉\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}-Here. Let me help. -I'm sorry. Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:48.84,0:45:49.80,Default,,0,0,0,,-都洒在你裤子上了  -没事\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}-It got in your pants. -It's all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:49.89,0:45:51.14,Default,,0,0,0,,这是\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You know, that's...
Dialogue: 0,0:45:51.22,0:45:53.47,Default,,0,0,0,,这是个很好的观点\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}That's a really, really good theory.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:53.56,0:45:55.18,Default,,0,0,0,,-肇事逃逸  -对\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}-Hit-and-run. -Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:55.27,0:45:56.56,Default,,0,0,0,,当时下着雨 又是黑夜\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I mean, it's raining, it's night.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:56.64,0:45:58.35,Default,,0,0,0,,能见度肯定很差\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Visibility's got to be terrible.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:58.44,0:46:01.06,Default,,0,0,0,,根据那个远足者的证词 我们知道当时道路湿滑\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Well, we know it was slippery, from that hiker's testimony.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:01.15,0:46:04.02,Default,,0,0,0,,穿着高跟鞋夜游吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Wandering around in the dark in heels?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:04.11,0:46:06.15,Default,,0,0,0,,现在的年轻人啊\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Kids today...
Dialogue: 0,0:46:06.23,0:46:10.49,Default,,0,0,0,,这解释了她最后怎么会在河床上\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Um, it explains how she could have ended up in a creek.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:10.57,0:46:12.37,Default,,0,0,0,,确实\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Mmm-hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:12.45,0:46:15.79,Default,,0,0,0,,好吧 所以赛思没有袭击她而是撞死了她\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Okay. So, Sythe mowed her down instead of bashing her head in?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:15.87,0:46:17.37,Default,,0,0,0,,我们在讨论什么\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}What are we talking about here?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:17.45,0:46:18.50,Default,,0,0,0,,这不是一样吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}What difference does it make?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:18.58,0:46:21.25,Default,,0,0,0,,那家伙就是人渣\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}The guy is a piece of shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:21.33,0:46:25.38,Default,,0,0,0,,听着 直觉告诉我那个孩子不是凶手\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Look, my gut is telling me that that kid is not a killer.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:24.40,0:46:25.99,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8\fs18}目击者 邻居
Dialogue: 0,0:46:25.46,0:46:28.01,Default,,0,0,0,,你之前还投了他有罪\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}-Okay. The other day, you voted guilty. -Mmm-hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:28.09,0:46:30.01,Default,,0,0,0,,不 不 我从没说他有罪\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}No. No, I never said guilty.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:30.09,0:46:33.01,Default,,0,0,0,,我说他应该进行辩诉交易\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I said, he should have taken a plea bargain.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:33.10,0:46:34.76,Default,,0,0,0,,这项指控证据不足\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}He's got a weak case.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:34.85,0:46:36.60,Default,,0,0,0,,这可能是有原因的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Well, maybe there's a reason for that.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:36.68,0:46:39.48,Default,,0,0,0,,对 这叫公设辩护人\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yeah. It's called a public defender.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:39.56,0:46:40.60,Default,,0,0,0,,我对他没什么意见\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I mean, nothing against this guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:40.69,0:46:42.02,Default,,0,0,0,,他看着也挺聪明\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}He seems pretty smart,
Dialogue: 0,0:46:42.10,0:46:44.98,Default,,0,0,0,,但警局预算有限\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}but... the PDs are working 10 times
Dialogue: 0,0:46:45.07,0:46:48.53,Default,,0,0,0,,他们的工作量是地检署的十倍\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}the caseload of the DA's office on a fraction of the budget.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:48.61,0:46:50.15,Default,,0,0,0,,两方资源根本就不对等\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}It's just not a fair fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:50.24,0:46:52.57,Default,,0,0,0,,是 但这些不重要\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yeah, well, nothing is anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:52.66,0:46:54.20,Default,,0,0,0,,咱们尽力做好份内的事就行\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}We'll just do the best we can.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:54.28,0:46:55.45,Default,,0,0,0,,我同意\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I hear you.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:56.99,0:46:59.16,Default,,0,0,0,,以我二十二年的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}And I got 22 years on the street,
Dialogue: 0,0:46:59.25,0:47:01.04,Default,,0,0,0,,工作经验来看\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}that is telling me
Dialogue: 0,0:47:01.12,0:47:03.71,Default,,0,0,0,,这个案件还有很多隐情\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}there's a lot more to this case than we know.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:03.79,0:47:06.34,Default,,0,0,0,,好吧 如果你还是一名警探\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}All right. Then, if you were still a detective,
Dialogue: 0,0:47:06.42,0:47:07.50,Default,,0,0,0,,你会怎么做\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}what would you do?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:07.59,0:47:09.80,Default,,0,0,0,,是啊\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:09.88,0:47:12.43,Default,,0,0,0,,好了 今天就到此为止吧\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}All right, y'all. That's it for today.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:12.51,0:47:16.56,Default,,0,0,0,,咱们周一早上九点见\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}See you back here at 9:00 a.m. Monday morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:16.64,0:47:18.97,Default,,0,0,0,,噢 我差点忘了 万圣节快乐\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh! And I almost forgot. Happy Halloween.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:19.06,0:47:20.77,Default,,0,0,0,,万圣节快乐\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Happy Halloween!
Dialogue: 0,0:47:23.15,0:47:24.10,Default,,0,0,0,,嘿\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:47:24.19,0:47:26.23,Default,,0,0,0,,是啊 好久不见\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yeah, it has been a minute.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:26.31,0:47:28.48,Default,,0,0,0,,我想请你帮我个忙\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}But I was hoping you could do me a solid.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:29.48,0:47:30.69,Default,,0,0,0,,等一下\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hang on a sec.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:35.91,0:47:37.08,Default,,0,0,0,,好了 继续吧\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yeah, I'm here.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:49.28,0:47:51.03,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8\fs18}选费思担任地方检查官
Dialogue: 0,0:47:54.55,0:47:56.01,Default,,0,0,0,,我们不能破坏法律\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}"We cannot break the law.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:56.09,0:47:58.76,Default,,0,0,0,,我们只会破坏那个遵纪守法的自己\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}"We can only break ourselves of the law."
Dialogue: 0,0:48:02.73,0:48:03.89,Default,,0,0,0,,裁定尚未明确\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}No decision yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:03.98,0:48:05.35,Default,,0,0,0,,要等周末以后了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}We're breaking for the weekend.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:05.44,0:48:07.19,Default,,0,0,0,,开什么玩笑\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You're kidding.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:07.27,0:48:09.02,Default,,0,0,0,,你无法预料一群陌生人聚起来能干什么\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You never know what a dozen strangers are gonna do.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:09.11,0:48:10.98,Default,,0,0,0,,显然是 好吧 谢谢你告诉我\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Clearly. Okay. Well, thanks for letting me know.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:11.07,0:48:12.36,Default,,0,0,0,,-周一见  -嗯\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}-See you Monday. -Mmm-hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:12.44,0:48:14.45,Default,,0,0,0,,-不给糖就捣蛋  -好 万圣节快乐\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}-Trick or treat! -Yeah. Have a good one.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:18.93,0:48:21.56,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8\fs18}生活有玫瑰伴随 不止有鲜花
Dialogue: 0,0:48:32.95,0:48:35.53,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8\fs18}注意 有鹿出没
Dialogue: 0,0:49:20.26,0:49:21.68,Default,,0,0,0,,嘿 亲爱的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hey, hon.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:21.76,0:49:24.85,Default,,0,0,0,,好 我现在就回店里\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yeah, I'm heading back to the shop right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:25.60,0:49:26.73,Default,,0,0,0,,好\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:56.72,0:49:58.47,Default,,0,0,0,,嘿\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:58.55,0:50:00.30,Default,,0,0,0,,-嗨  -你收到我的短信没\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}-Hi. -Did you get my text?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:02.76,0:50:04.10,Default,,0,0,0,,噢 该死\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:04.18,0:50:05.31,Default,,0,0,0,,抱歉\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:06.35,0:50:07.89,Default,,0,0,0,,抱歉 我忘记了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I'm sorry, I forgot.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:08.85,0:50:10.23,Default,,0,0,0,,都没事吧\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Does everything look okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:12.52,0:50:13.73,Default,,0,0,0,,你还好吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:19.91,0:50:21.62,Default,,0,0,0,,嘿 嘿 怎么了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hey, hey, hey, what's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:21.70,0:50:22.87,Default,,0,0,0,,我害怕\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I'm scared.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:24.66,0:50:27.33,Default,,0,0,0,,我很怕 我们上次没到过这一步\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I'm scared. We didn't make it this far last time, and...
Dialogue: 0,0:50:28.00,0:50:28.91,Default,,0,0,0,,我就是很怕\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I'm just scared.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:30.79,0:50:32.17,Default,,0,0,0,,我不想一个人来承担\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I don't want to be doing this alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:32.25,0:50:33.79,Default,,0,0,0,,我不想一个人去经历这些事\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I don't want to go to these things alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:34.92,0:50:36.50,Default,,0,0,0,,会没事的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}It's going to be okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:36.59,0:50:38.17,Default,,0,0,0,,一切都会顺利的 我保证\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}It's going to be all right, I promise.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:38.26,0:50:39.05,Default,,0,0,0,,我不明白你今天为什么不陪我\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I don't understand why you weren't there today.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:42.55,0:50:45.60,Default,,0,0,0,,这个案件还要审理多久\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}How much longer is the trial going to go on for?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:45.68,0:50:48.64,Default,,0,0,0,,我不知道\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I have no idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:48.73,0:50:51.02,Default,,0,0,0,,-这  -裁决快出来了吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}-It's... -Are you close to a verdict?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:51.10,0:50:52.52,Default,,0,0,0,,我不应该私下和你聊这个案件\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I'm not supposed to discuss the case--
Dialogue: 0,0:50:52.60,0:50:54.27,Default,,0,0,0,,贾斯汀 裁决快出来了吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Justin, are you close to a verdict?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:54.36,0:50:57.36,Default,,0,0,0,,十二人中十人认为有罪\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Well, it's ten to two for guilty.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:59.53,0:51:00.86,Default,,0,0,0,,那周一时\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}So then, Monday,
Dialogue: 0,0:51:00.95,0:51:02.78,Default,,0,0,0,,你能去说服那两人重新投票\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}can you just go in and sway the two holdouts
Dialogue: 0,0:51:02.86,0:51:04.78,Default,,0,0,0,,然后了结这件事吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}and then be done with this?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:04.87,0:51:07.79,Default,,0,0,0,,我就是投无罪的其中一人\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Well, I'm one of them. I...
Dialogue: 0,0:51:09.54,0:51:11.25,Default,,0,0,0,,-为什么  -我很抱歉\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}-Why? -I'm sorry,
Dialogue: 0,0:51:11.33,0:51:12.83,Default,,0,0,0,,但他们就看了嫌疑人一眼然后就投票了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}but they took one look at this guy, and that was it.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:12.92,0:51:14.67,Default,,0,0,0,,没有讨论证据 什么都没有\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}No discussion of the evidence, nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:14.75,0:51:15.92,Default,,0,0,0,,我得做点什么\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I had to do something.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:19.01,0:51:20.72,Default,,0,0,0,,每个人都值得拥有一次机会 对吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Everyone deserves a chance, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:22.55,0:51:24.93,Default,,0,0,0,,我一直在想要是你没给我这个机会 我现在会怎样\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I keep thinking where I'd be if you hadn't given me one.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:30.27,0:51:32.14,Default,,0,0,0,,我能问你个事吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Can I ask you something?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:34.02,0:51:36.52,Default,,0,0,0,,当然 什么事\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yeah, sure. What?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:36.61,0:51:38.82,Default,,0,0,0,,要是我想把丰田车卖了 但不告诉买方\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}If I were to sell the 4Runner without telling someone
Dialogue: 0,0:51:38.90,0:51:40.65,Default,,0,0,0,,这车出过事故\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}it was in a wreck,
Dialogue: 0,0:51:40.74,0:51:42.53,Default,,0,0,0,,他们愿意交易 车也没有安全隐患\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}but they're happy with the deal and there's no safety risks.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:42.61,0:51:44.61,Default,,0,0,0,,-已经登广告了 贾斯汀  -我知道 我知道\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}-It was in the ad, Justin. -I know, I know,
Dialogue: 0,0:51:44.70,0:51:45.82,Default,,0,0,0,,但先听我说\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}but just go with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:45.91,0:51:47.87,Default,,0,0,0,,要是他们对此一无所知\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}If they're never the wiser,
Dialogue: 0,0:51:47.95,0:51:50.12,Default,,0,0,0,,我这样是不是不对\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}then did I do anything wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:50.62,0:51:51.75,Default,,0,0,0,,不\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:52.79,0:51:54.21,Default,,0,0,0,,我觉得没问题\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I mean, I don't think so.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:55.79,0:51:56.96,Default,,0,0,0,,好\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:59.59,0:52:00.76,Default,,0,0,0,,我要上楼了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I'm going upstairs.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:03.72,0:52:04.97,Default,,0,0,0,,冰箱里有吃的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Food's in the fridge.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:05.05,0:52:06.34,Default,,0,0,0,,楼上见\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}See you upstairs.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:32.87,0:52:35.67,Default,,0,0,0,,你来了 下一轮她请客\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}There she is. Next round's on her.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:35.75,0:52:37.71,Default,,0,0,0,,波旁威士忌 要纯的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Bourbon. Neat. And...
Dialogue: 0,0:52:37.79,0:52:39.04,Default,,0,0,0,,再来份他在喝的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}yeah, whatever he's having.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:39.13,0:52:42.59,Default,,0,0,0,,我在喝的 我喝的是\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}What I'm having? What I'm having is a...
Dialogue: 0,0:52:42.67,0:52:43.92,Default,,0,0,0,,-谢谢  -美妙的夜晚时光\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}-Thank you. -...great evening.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:44.01,0:52:45.34,Default,,0,0,0,,今晚不美好吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Isn't it a beautiful evening?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:45.43,0:52:47.59,Default,,0,0,0,,这案子本该两小时就能做出裁决\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}It should have been a two-hour verdict.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:47.68,0:52:49.80,Default,,0,0,0,,我能怎么说 他们很重视这份工作\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}What can I tell you? They're taking their job seriously.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:49.89,0:52:51.18,Default,,0,0,0,,我给他们提供了很多思路\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I gave them a lot to think about.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:51.26,0:52:53.85,Default,,0,0,0,,我给出了很多证据\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Mmm. I got a mountain of evidence.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:53.93,0:52:55.52,Default,,0,0,0,,你给的都是些烟雾弹\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You gave them smoke and mirrors.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:55.60,0:52:57.06,Default,,0,0,0,,无风不起浪\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Where there's smoke, there's fire.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:57.15,0:53:01.23,Default,,0,0,0,,我欣赏你的乐观\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I admire your optimism.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:01.32,0:53:02.90,Default,,0,0,0,,听着 是这样 你走进法庭\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Look, here's the thing. You walk into court
Dialogue: 0,0:53:02.98,0:53:06.78,Default,,0,0,0,,确信被告有罪 而我\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}convinced of the guilt of the defendant. Me, I...
Dialogue: 0,0:53:06.86,0:53:08.20,Default,,0,0,0,,我对这份工作不抱任何幻想\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I have no illusions about what I do.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:08.28,0:53:10.03,Default,,0,0,0,,我的很多客户都有罪\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}A lot of my clients are guilty,
Dialogue: 0,0:53:10.12,0:53:12.99,Default,,0,0,0,,而我的职责就是在坏局面中尽量减少损失\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}and my job is to help make the best of a bad situation.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:13.08,0:53:15.16,Default,,0,0,0,,但我跟你讲\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}But I'm telling you...
Dialogue: 0,0:53:15.25,0:53:17.08,Default,,0,0,0,,我跟你讲 人不是他杀的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I'm telling you, this guy didn't do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:20.09,0:53:23.51,Default,,0,0,0,,既然陪审团还想花时间考虑\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}And the fact that the jury's taking a little time
Dialogue: 0,0:53:23.59,0:53:25.17,Default,,0,0,0,,我觉得事情在往\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}gives me hope that things are working
Dialogue: 0,0:53:25.26,0:53:26.55,Default,,0,0,0,,合理的方向发展\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}the way they should.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:28.13,0:53:32.06,Default,,0,0,0,,好吧 那你及时行乐吧\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Well... you enjoy that while it lasts.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:35.10,0:53:38.10,Default,,0,0,0,,敬司法系统\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}To the justice system.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:38.19,0:53:41.11,Default,,0,0,0,,它可能并不完善 但已经是目前最好的了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}It ain't perfect, but it's the best we got.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:51.70,0:53:53.08,Default,,0,0,0,,-嘿  -嘿\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}-Hey. -Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:53.16,0:53:54.99,Default,,0,0,0,,昨天的事我很抱歉\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I'm sorry again about yesterday.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:55.08,0:53:56.45,Default,,0,0,0,,那桩案子让我有些累\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}It's just that case wearing on me.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:57.58,0:53:58.87,Default,,0,0,0,,我知道 能看出来\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I know. I can tell.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:58.96,0:54:00.75,Default,,0,0,0,,-对  -相信你的直觉\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}-Yeah. -Trust your gut.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:00.83,0:54:02.21,Default,,0,0,0,,你会做正确的事\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You'll do the right thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:02.29,0:54:03.88,Default,,0,0,0,,噢 等等\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh! Oh, Oh, wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:03.96,0:54:05.13,Default,,0,0,0,,等等 等等\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Wait, wait, wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:09.34,0:54:11.30,Default,,0,0,0,,-这是什么  -我的干草叉\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}-What's that? -It's my pitchfork.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:11.39,0:54:13.01,Default,,0,0,0,,-不错啊  -谢谢\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}-Nice! -Yeah. Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:13.10,0:54:14.47,Default,,0,0,0,,我自己做的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Homemade.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:17.14,0:54:19.44,Default,,0,0,0,,-不给糖就捣蛋  -嘿 万圣节快乐\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}-Trick or treat! -Hey! Happy Halloween!
Dialogue: 0,0:54:19.52,0:54:22.15,Default,,0,0,0,,我喜欢你们的装扮 每人拿两颗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I love your costumes! Take two, everyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:24.27,0:54:25.23,Default,,0,0,0,,奥利弗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oliver?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:25.32,0:54:26.94,Default,,0,0,0,,嘿 克鲁森女士\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hey, Ms. Crewson.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:27.03,0:54:29.90,Default,,0,0,0,,奥利弗 我都没认出你 你好吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oliver, I didn't even recognize you! How are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:29.99,0:54:31.45,Default,,0,0,0,,我很好 你好 肯普先生\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I'm good. Hi, Mr. Kemp.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:31.53,0:54:33.07,Default,,0,0,0,,嘿 你写得怎么样了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hey, how's the writing going?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:33.16,0:54:34.99,Default,,0,0,0,,-我的作品上学生报了  -真的吗 太棒了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}-I'm on student paper now. -No way. That's awesome.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:35.08,0:54:36.45,Default,,0,0,0,,-真不错  -恭喜你\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}-That's very cool. -Congrats.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:36.54,0:54:38.00,Default,,0,0,0,,-今晚玩得开心  -好的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}-Hey, have fun tonight. -We will.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:38.08,0:54:39.29,Default,,0,0,0,,咱们学校见\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}See you back at school?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:39.37,0:54:40.83,Default,,0,0,0,,-好 明年见  -好\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}-Yeah. Next year. -Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:40.92,0:54:42.38,Default,,0,0,0,,再见\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Well, bye.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:42.46,0:54:44.09,Default,,0,0,0,,-再见  -继续加油\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}-Bye! -Keep it up!
Dialogue: 0,0:54:44.17,0:54:46.21,Default,,0,0,0,,-天呐 他都这么大了  -是啊\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}-God, he's a giant. -I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:46.30,0:54:47.80,Default,,0,0,0,,万圣节快乐\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Happy Halloween.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:52.80,0:54:53.93,Default,,0,0,0,,谢谢\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:06.27,0:55:07.78,Default,,0,0,0,,-嘿  -嘿\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}-Hey. -Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:07.86,0:55:10.74,Default,,0,0,0,,周五庭审结束后你为什么跟着我\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Why'd you follow me after court on Friday?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:10.82,0:55:12.86,Default,,0,0,0,,我还没开出停车场就发现你了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I picked your tail up, like, halfway out of the parking lot.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:12.95,0:55:15.74,Default,,0,0,0,,你开的是绿色丰田超霸 对吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I mean, green Toyota 4Runner, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:15.83,0:55:17.70,Default,,0,0,0,,对 你\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Uh, yeah, well, you're...
Dialogue: 0,0:55:17.79,0:55:19.12,Default,,0,0,0,,离开陪审室后\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}you're not allowed to investigate the case
Dialogue: 0,0:55:19.20,0:55:20.46,Default,,0,0,0,,就不能再继续调查案件了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}outside the jury room.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:21.46,0:55:23.50,Default,,0,0,0,,对 对 我知道\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yeah. Yeah, I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:23.58,0:55:27.17,Default,,0,0,0,,但 总得有人调查\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}But... I mean, somebody's got to.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:27.25,0:55:28.71,Default,,0,0,0,,难道你不想知道究竟发生了什么吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Don't you want to know what really happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:28.80,0:55:30.34,Default,,0,0,0,,当然\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yeah. Of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:31.34,0:55:32.97,Default,,0,0,0,,听着 我\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Look, I, uh...
Dialogue: 0,0:55:33.05,0:55:34.18,Default,,0,0,0,,我做了些调查\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I did some digging.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:36.22,0:55:37.93,Default,,0,0,0,,这是县里所有已登记的汽车\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}This is every registered car in the county
Dialogue: 0,0:55:38.01,0:55:39.52,Default,,0,0,0,,在去年十月二十六日至年底\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}that was in for body work
Dialogue: 0,0:55:39.60,0:55:41.27,Default,,0,0,0,,进行过维修的记录\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}between October 26th and the end of last year.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:41.35,0:55:42.94,Default,,0,0,0,,你还觉得是肇事逃逸吗 拜托\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You're still about the hit-and-run? Come on, it's--
Dialogue: 0,0:55:43.02,0:55:44.77,Default,,0,0,0,,对 因为这个观点很有道理\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yeah, because that's a really good theory.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:44.85,0:55:47.52,Default,,0,0,0,,汽车制造商出于研发目的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Now, the automakers keep a detailed list
Dialogue: 0,0:55:47.61,0:55:50.53,Default,,0,0,0,,会保留这些维修的详细清单\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}of these repairs strictly for R and D purposes.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:50.61,0:55:53.03,Default,,0,0,0,,他们明面上从经销商那里收集记录\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}They collect it from the dealers pro forma
Dialogue: 0,0:55:53.11,0:55:55.32,Default,,0,0,0,,然后在暗地里付钱给小零售店\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}and then pay the mom-and-pop shops under the table.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:55.41,0:55:56.87,Default,,0,0,0,,我和我搭档通过这种方式\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}My partner and I recovered more cars
Dialogue: 0,0:55:56.95,0:55:58.45,Default,,0,0,0,,找回的汽车比已经扣押的还多\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}than an impound this way.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:58.53,0:56:00.79,Default,,0,0,0,,好 但这里一定记录了几百辆车吧\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Right. But there must be hundreds of cars in there.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:00.87,0:56:02.71,Default,,0,0,0,,对 需要进行排除\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yeah, so process of elimination,
Dialogue: 0,0:56:02.79,0:56:05.67,Default,,0,0,0,,所以我整个周末都在干这个\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}which is what I spent my whole weekend doing.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:05.75,0:56:08.09,Default,,0,0,0,,警方已经通报过的车\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I mean, anything there's already a police report for,
Dialogue: 0,0:56:08.17,0:56:09.30,Default,,0,0,0,,我都从名单上划去了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}crossed off the list.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:09.38,0:56:11.09,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Mmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:11.17,0:56:12.67,Default,,0,0,0,,这种肇事逃逸的汽车\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}And there's only going to be a very specific kind of damage
Dialogue: 0,0:56:12.76,0:56:13.76,Default,,0,0,0,,一定会有特定位置的损坏\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}with this kind of hit-and-run.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:13.84,0:56:16.97,Default,,0,0,0,,比如前灯 格栅 车篷\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}So a headlight, grille, hood.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:17.05,0:56:19.56,Default,,0,0,0,,-对  -我根据这些特征\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}-Yeah. -I narrowed it down to 15 vehicles
Dialogue: 0,0:56:19.64,0:56:21.81,Default,,0,0,0,,把名单上的范围缩小至十五辆车\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}that match that description on this list,
Dialogue: 0,0:56:21.89,0:56:23.27,Default,,0,0,0,,说起来 其中有一辆\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}one of which, by the way,
Dialogue: 0,0:56:23.35,0:56:26.40,Default,,0,0,0,,是九六年产的森林绿的丰田超霸\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}a '96 Toyota 4Runner, Forest Green.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:26.48,0:56:29.11,Default,,0,0,0,,跟你开的车一样 对吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I mean, that's the exact same car as yours, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:29.19,0:56:30.40,Default,,0,0,0,,我是说 如果那是你的车\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I mean, if that is your car,
Dialogue: 0,0:56:30.48,0:56:32.49,Default,,0,0,0,,我们就可以把它从名单上划掉了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}we can just cross it off the list.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:32.57,0:56:35.99,Default,,0,0,0,,行 那计划是什么\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Right. Yeah. So what's the plan?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:36.07,0:56:38.24,Default,,0,0,0,,如果你不介意帮忙的话\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Well, if you don't mind helping,
Dialogue: 0,0:56:38.32,0:56:39.70,Default,,0,0,0,,一天就二十四小时\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}there's only so many hours in the day,
Dialogue: 0,0:56:39.78,0:56:41.20,Default,,0,0,0,,大部分时间我们还得待在这里\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}and we got to spend most of them here.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:41.29,0:56:42.62,Default,,0,0,0,,所以你要帮我跑腿吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}So you want to help me with the legwork,
Dialogue: 0,0:56:42.70,0:56:44.29,Default,,0,0,0,,看看能不能找到我们要找的人\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}and see if we can find our guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:44.37,0:56:46.83,Default,,0,0,0,,行 你在挖掘真相 但是\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yeah. Okay. You know, you're reaching, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:56:46.92,0:56:48.33,Default,,0,0,0,,听着 这是肇事逃逸 孩子\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Look, I... It's a hit-and-run, kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:48.42,0:56:49.79,Default,,0,0,0,,绝对是\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I feel it in my bones.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:49.88,0:56:52.09,Default,,0,0,0,,我们要找的人一定在这份名单上\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Dollars to doughnuts, our guy is on this list.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:52.17,0:56:56.05,Default,,0,0,0,,早上好 派对时间到 各位 我们走\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, good morning. Party time, y'all, let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:58.47,0:56:59.93,Default,,0,0,0,,伙计们 赶紧的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Fellas, wrap it up.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:00.01,0:57:01.31,Default,,0,0,0,,谢谢\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:04.06,0:57:05.27,Default,,0,0,0,,我们走\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:07.52,0:57:08.56,Default,,0,0,0,,该死\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}God damn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:57:08.65,0:57:10.65,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:10.73,0:57:12.19,Default,,0,0,0,,没事吧\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Everything all right over here?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:12.28,0:57:13.61,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Mmm?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:13.69,0:57:15.07,Default,,0,0,0,,你们今天都在挑战我的神经\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Y'all working my nerve today.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:16.90,0:57:18.16,Default,,0,0,0,,这都是些什么\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}What is all this?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:22.83,0:57:25.16,Default,,0,0,0,,你们俩等我一下\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Just... You two, wait for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:27.50,0:57:30.59,Default,,0,0,0,,请帮我读一下0.01号指令\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Read instruction 0.01 for me, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:34.71,0:57:36.17,Default,,0,0,0,,呃\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Uh...
Dialogue: 0,0:57:36.26,0:57:37.55,Default,,0,0,0,,为了保持陪审团制度的公正性\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}"To maintain the integrity of the jury system,
Dialogue: 0,0:57:37.63,0:57:39.68,Default,,0,0,0,,我提醒各位必须\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I remind you that you must decide this case
Dialogue: 0,0:57:39.76,0:57:41.68,Default,,0,0,0,,仅根据审判期间接受的证据\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}based only on the evidence admitted during the trial
Dialogue: 0,0:57:39.95,0:57:45.25,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8\fs18}我们信仰上帝
Dialogue: 0,0:57:41.76,0:57:43.85,Default,,0,0,0,,以及我将向你们解释的法律来裁决此案\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}and the law I will explain to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:43.93,0:57:45.52,Default,,0,0,0,,你们不得自行研究\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You may not conduct any research
Dialogue: 0,0:57:45.60,0:57:47.39,Default,,0,0,0,,本案或庭审中提及的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}on your own about this case
Dialogue: 0,0:57:47.48,0:57:50.31,Default,,0,0,0,,任何人物或地点\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}or about any people or places mentioned during the trial."
Dialogue: 0,0:57:50.40,0:57:51.94,Default,,0,0,0,,我认为你们俩违反了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Sounds to me like you two violated
Dialogue: 0,0:57:52.02,0:57:53.57,Default,,0,0,0,,这一段里的每一条规定\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}every sentence of that paragraph.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:53.65,0:57:54.98,Default,,0,0,0,,法官大人 我申请这是无效审判\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Your Honor, I move for a mistrial.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:55.07,0:57:56.78,Default,,0,0,0,,他以前是个警察\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}He's a former cop.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:56.86,0:57:58.40,Default,,0,0,0,,谁知道他给陪审团灌输了什么思想\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Who knows what ideas he put in the jury's heads.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:58.49,0:58:00.37,Default,,0,0,0,,你在预先审查中未能提出他之前的工作经历\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Failure to elicit his previous employment
Dialogue: 0,0:58:00.45,0:58:03.20,Default,,0,0,0,,这是你的责任 雷斯尼克先生\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}during voir dire is on you, Mr. Resnick.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:03.28,0:58:04.83,Default,,0,0,0,,这是不当行为\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}It's misconduct.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:04.91,0:58:06.62,Default,,0,0,0,,把他驱逐出庭吧 法官大人 没必要重新开始\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Kick him off, Judge. There's no need to start over.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:06.70,0:58:09.25,Default,,0,0,0,,我们的资源已经捉襟见肘\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Our resources are already stretched so thin.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:12.29,0:58:14.13,Default,,0,0,0,,她说得对 动议驳回\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}She's right. Motion denied.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:14.21,0:58:15.51,Default,,0,0,0,,法官大人\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Your Honor. You know...
Dialogue: 0,0:58:16.34,0:58:17.63,Default,,0,0,0,,至于你们俩\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}As for you two...
Dialogue: 0,0:58:20.39,0:58:22.14,Default,,0,0,0,,你们违背了作为陪审员的誓言\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You violated your oath as jurors.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:24.85,0:58:26.22,Default,,0,0,0,,法官大人\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Your Honor...
Dialogue: 0,0:58:26.31,0:58:27.77,Default,,0,0,0,,如果可以的话\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}if I may. I, uh...
Dialogue: 0,0:58:27.85,0:58:30.27,Default,,0,0,0,,我恪守作为一名警察的誓言\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I upheld the oath I took as a police officer
Dialogue: 0,0:58:30.35,0:58:32.52,Default,,0,0,0,,绝不背叛自己的人格\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}to never betray my character,
Dialogue: 0,0:58:32.61,0:58:35.02,Default,,0,0,0,,操守以及公众的信任\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}my integrity, or the public trust.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:40.49,0:58:42.66,Default,,0,0,0,,奇考斯基先生\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Mr. Chicowski,
Dialogue: 0,0:58:42.74,0:58:44.95,Default,,0,0,0,,特此撤销你的陪审员资格\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}you are hereby removed from Jury Service.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:46.79,0:58:47.83,Default,,0,0,0,,鉴于你的背景\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}On account of your background,
Dialogue: 0,0:58:47.91,0:58:49.25,Default,,0,0,0,,我破例\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I'm going to make an exception
Dialogue: 0,0:58:49.33,0:58:52.08,Default,,0,0,0,,不判你藐视法庭\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}and not find you in contempt of court.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:53.29,0:58:54.63,Default,,0,0,0,,谢谢 法官大人\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Thank you, Your Honor.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:56.00,0:58:57.88,Default,,0,0,0,,肯普先生\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}So Mr. Kemp,
Dialogue: 0,0:58:57.96,0:59:00.09,Default,,0,0,0,,你不是已退休的执法人员 对吧\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}you are not a retired law enforcement officer, are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:00.17,0:59:01.97,Default,,0,0,0,,对 不是 法官大人\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}No. No, Your Honor.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:02.05,0:59:03.47,Default,,0,0,0,,那你如何解释\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}So how do you explain
Dialogue: 0,0:59:03.55,0:59:07.27,Default,,0,0,0,,自己的违规行为\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}your involvement in this transgression?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:07.35,0:59:09.98,Default,,0,0,0,,这些文件是我自行搜集的 法官大人\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I obtained those documents on my own, Your Honor.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:10.06,0:59:12.06,Default,,0,0,0,,他与此事毫无关系\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}He didn't have anything to do with it.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:13.06,0:59:14.40,Default,,0,0,0,,情况属实吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Is that true?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:14.48,0:59:15.77,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Mmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:15.86,0:59:17.53,Default,,0,0,0,,我的意思是 你有没有看过这些文件\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I mean, did you look at these documents
Dialogue: 0,0:59:17.61,0:59:19.32,Default,,0,0,0,,或者帮忙收集这些文件\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}or help to procure them
Dialogue: 0,0:59:19.40,0:59:21.86,Default,,0,0,0,,或者知道奇考斯基先生的计划\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}or know what Mr. Chicowski was intending to do?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:21.95,0:59:24.28,Default,,0,0,0,,没有 法官大人 我没有看过\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}No, Your Honor. I did not look at them
Dialogue: 0,0:59:24.37,0:59:25.58,Default,,0,0,0,,也没有提供帮助\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}and I didn't help.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:27.74,0:59:29.87,Default,,0,0,0,,那你认为你是否可以\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}So do you think that you can disregard
Dialogue: 0,0:59:29.95,0:59:31.79,Default,,0,0,0,,不考虑刚才听到的一切\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}everything that you heard just now
Dialogue: 0,0:59:31.87,0:59:34.38,Default,,0,0,0,,继续做一个不带偏见的陪审团成员\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}and remain an unbiased member of this panel?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:34.46,0:59:35.79,Default,,0,0,0,,是的 我可以\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yes, I can.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:37.55,0:59:39.88,Default,,0,0,0,,我就相信你的话吧\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I'm going to take you at your word.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:39.96,0:59:43.47,Default,,0,0,0,,法警 请护送肯普先生回陪审室\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Bailiff, please escort Mr. Kemp back to the juror room.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:45.05,0:59:49.02,Default,,0,0,0,,奇考斯基先生 你可以走了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Mr. Chicowski, you are dismissed.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:49.10,0:59:51.14,Default,,0,0,0,,法官大人 我请求将这些文件的副本\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Your Honor, I would ask that a copy of these documents
Dialogue: 0,0:59:51.23,0:59:52.64,Default,,0,0,0,,留在法庭记录中\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}be made part of the court's records
Dialogue: 0,0:59:52.73,0:59:53.98,Default,,0,0,0,,以备上诉之用\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}for purposes of appeal.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:54.06,0:59:56.27,Default,,0,0,0,,我也再次申请审判无效\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}And again, I move for a mistrial.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:56.36,0:59:59.57,Default,,0,0,0,,这些文件将作为法庭的一号证据\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}The documents will be marked as court's Exhibit One.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:59.65,1:00:03.86,Default,,0,0,0,,你的动议被驳回 雷斯尼克先生\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Your motion for a mistrial is denied, Mr. Resnick.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:03.95,1:00:06.41,Default,,0,0,0,,明白了吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Is that understood?
Dialogue: 0,1:00:06.49,1:00:09.29,Default,,0,0,0,,是的 法官大人 明白了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yes, Your Honor. It's understood.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:09.37,1:00:11.83,Default,,0,0,0,,很好 到此结束\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Good. Then we are done here.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:20.30,1:00:22.13,Default,,0,0,0,,-你是在开玩笑吧  -什么\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}-You got to be kidding me. -What?
Dialogue: 0,1:00:22.22,1:00:24.34,Default,,0,0,0,,我们的资源捉襟见肘\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}"Our resources are stretched so thin"?
Dialogue: 0,1:00:24.49,1:00:26.91,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8\fs18}最高法院法庭304 肃静 开庭中
Dialogue: 0,1:00:25.22,1:00:26.47,Default,,0,0,0,,你可真行\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You are something.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:30.18,1:00:31.27,Default,,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:38.27,1:00:39.86,Default,,0,0,0,,检察官\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Counselor.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:39.94,1:00:41.03,Default,,0,0,0,,嘿 没事的 我不再是陪审团成员了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hey, it's okay. I'm not on the jury anymore.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:41.11,1:00:42.19,Default,,0,0,0,,-你不需要  -是\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}-You don't have to... -Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:42.28,1:00:43.86,Default,,0,0,0,,确实 我知道\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yeah, made sure of that.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:46.82,1:00:48.07,Default,,0,0,0,,有压力了 是吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Feeling the pressure, huh?
Dialogue: 0,1:00:49.08,1:00:51.49,Default,,0,0,0,,这个案子吗 没有\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}In this job? Nah.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:51.58,1:00:54.54,Default,,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yeah. Okay.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:02.13,1:01:03.59,Default,,0,0,0,,嘿 我很抱歉 但我只是\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hey, I'm... Sorry, but I just...
Dialogue: 0,1:01:03.67,1:01:05.68,Default,,0,0,0,,我必须要说 你\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I can't not say this. You...
Dialogue: 0,1:01:07.43,1:01:09.76,Default,,0,0,0,,你完全搞错了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You got this case all wrong.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:10.76,1:01:12.77,Default,,0,0,0,,-噢 真的吗  -是的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}-Oh, really? -Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:12.85,1:01:14.02,Default,,0,0,0,,那是肇事逃逸\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}It's a hit-and-run.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:14.10,1:01:16.35,Default,,0,0,0,,不可能 法医会标记出来的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}No way. ME would have flagged it.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:16.44,1:01:18.65,Default,,0,0,0,,对 你是会这么想\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Well, yeah, you'd think.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:18.73,1:01:21.23,Default,,0,0,0,,那家伙那天在一天之内\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}That guy did five autopsies that day.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:21.32,1:01:23.28,Default,,0,0,0,,验了五具尸体 我核实过了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}One day. I checked.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:23.36,1:01:24.82,Default,,0,0,0,,那也说明不了什么\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Doesn't mean anything.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:29.66,1:01:31.91,Default,,0,0,0,,我就问你一个问题\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Let me just ask you one thing.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:31.99,1:01:34.45,Default,,0,0,0,,你们有没有调查过其他嫌疑人\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Did you guys ever look at any other suspect?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:36.25,1:01:38.58,Default,,0,0,0,,我们做了该做的事\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}We did our job.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:38.67,1:01:40.79,Default,,0,0,0,,恕我直言 阁下 如果你能做好你的工作\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}All due respect, Counselor, if you'd have done your job,
Dialogue: 0,1:01:40.88,1:01:42.42,Default,,0,0,0,,我觉得我们就不会站在这里了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I don't think we'd be standing here right now.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:42.50,1:01:44.46,Default,,0,0,0,,那家伙臭名昭著\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Well, that guy is bad news.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:46.88,1:01:47.72,Default,,0,0,0,,也许吧\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Maybe.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:50.18,1:01:51.60,Default,,0,0,0,,但他没有杀害那个姑娘\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}But he didn't kill that girl.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:08.57,1:02:09.86,Default,,0,0,0,,好的 事情就是这样\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}All right. So with that being said,
Dialogue: 0,1:02:09.95,1:02:12.28,Default,,0,0,0,,斯图尔特法官感谢各位的耐心等待\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Judge Stewart thanks you for your patience
Dialogue: 0,1:02:12.37,1:02:15.04,Default,,0,0,0,,并对给各位带来的不便表示歉意\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}and apologizes for any inconvenience.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:15.12,1:02:18.46,Default,,0,0,0,,十三号陪审员现在在组内拥有投票权\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Juror number 13 is now a voting member of this panel.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:19.04,1:02:20.17,Default,,0,0,0,,好吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:20.25,1:02:22.08,Default,,0,0,0,,各位请继续\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I'll let you guys get back to it.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:25.76,1:02:27.47,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么回事\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}So what happened?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:27.55,1:02:29.80,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么会有不当行为\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}What was this misconduct?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:29.88,1:02:31.76,Default,,0,0,0,,那是他和法官之间的事\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Uh, that's between him and the judge.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:31.84,1:02:34.14,Default,,0,0,0,,胡扯 你也在现场\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Bullshit. You were there.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:34.22,1:02:35.60,Default,,0,0,0,,哈罗德做了什么\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}What did Harold do?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:37.06,1:02:40.27,Default,,0,0,0,,他私自调查了此案\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}He was investigating the case on his own.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:40.35,1:02:41.40,Default,,0,0,0,,法官把他赶回家了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}The judge sent him home.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:42.81,1:02:44.15,Default,,0,0,0,,那堆文件呢\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}What about that stack of papers?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:44.23,1:02:45.48,Default,,0,0,0,,什么文件\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}What papers?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:45.57,1:02:47.19,Default,,0,0,0,,哈罗德给他的那些\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}The ones Harold gave to him.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:47.28,1:02:49.03,Default,,0,0,0,,你丢得满地都是 我们都看见了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You dropped them all over the floor. We all saw it.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:49.11,1:02:52.32,Default,,0,0,0,,我还没看文件 法警就来了 所以\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}The bailiff was on us before I looked at the papers, so...
Dialogue: 0,1:02:52.41,1:02:54.45,Default,,0,0,0,,你们聊了很久\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You were talking for quite a while.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:54.53,1:02:56.41,Default,,0,0,0,,他告诉你里面的内容了吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Did he tell you what was in them?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:58.41,1:03:00.12,Default,,0,0,0,,对 他说了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Okay, yes, he did. It...
Dialogue: 0,1:03:00.21,1:03:03.46,Default,,0,0,0,,是打印件 包括姓名 车辆登记信息\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}It was a printout. Names, vehicle registrations...
Dialogue: 0,1:03:03.54,1:03:06.17,Default,,0,0,0,,他说那些也许可以证明\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}He said that it could prove
Dialogue: 0,1:03:06.25,1:03:07.30,Default,,0,0,0,,詹姆斯·赛思的清白\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}James Sythe's innocence.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:07.38,1:03:09.38,Default,,0,0,0,,那又如何\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}So what?
Dialogue: 0,1:03:09.47,1:03:10.68,Default,,0,0,0,,难道我们现在就应该相信你\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Are we just supposed to believe you now
Dialogue: 0,1:03:10.76,1:03:11.97,Default,,0,0,0,,然后改变投票结果吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}and change our vote?
Dialogue: 0,1:03:12.05,1:03:13.30,Default,,0,0,0,,不 我只是告诉你们我所知道的事情\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}No, I'm just telling you what I know.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:15.39,1:03:17.01,Default,,0,0,0,,他认为是肇事逃逸\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}He thinks it was a hit-and-run.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:27.30,1:03:29.09,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8\fs18}姓 穆尔 名 鲍伯 地址 佐治亚州
Dialogue: 0,1:03:30.64,1:03:32.55,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8\fs18}姓名 鲍勃·穆尔\N社会安全码 xxx-xx-4823 佐治亚州签发\N驾照号码 8009DB178K
Dialogue: 0,1:03:35.35,1:03:37.56,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8\fs18}克鲁森 艾利森 1996丰田超霸 车身 车头损毁
Dialogue: 0,1:03:40.73,1:03:42.31,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8\fs18}姓 克鲁森 名 艾利森 地址 佐治亚州
Dialogue: 0,1:03:44.02,1:03:45.69,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8\fs18}姓名艾 利森·克鲁森\N社会安全码 xxx-xx-5701 佐治亚州签发\N驾照号码 7244BF7764G
Dialogue: 0,1:03:49.67,1:03:52.72,Default,,0,0,0,,那如果他认为是肇事逃逸\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}So if he thinks it was a hit-and-run...
Dialogue: 0,1:03:57.26,1:03:58.85,Default,,0,0,0,,肯德尔的身高是五英尺五英寸\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Kendall was 5'5".
Dialogue: 0,1:03:59.68,1:04:02.94,Default,,0,0,0,,如果她当时弯着腰\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}If she was hunched over,
Dialogue: 0,1:04:03.02,1:04:06.23,Default,,0,0,0,,而肇事车是一辆越野车或者卡车\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}and the car was an SUV or a truck,
Dialogue: 0,1:04:06.31,1:04:07.82,Default,,0,0,0,,那么她的头部和躯干\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}she could have easily have been hit
Dialogue: 0,1:04:07.90,1:04:09.78,Default,,0,0,0,,就很容易遭到重击\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}smack across the head and torso.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:12.15,1:04:14.86,Default,,0,0,0,,你们看她肩膀骨折的情况\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Look at the way her shoulders are fractured.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:14.95,1:04:17.07,Default,,0,0,0,,不好意思 但你是医生吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Well, I'm sorry, but are you a doctor?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:18.45,1:04:21.25,Default,,0,0,0,,目前不是 我是医学院大三的学生\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Not yet. Third-year med student.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:21.33,1:04:22.87,Default,,0,0,0,,我的意思是\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I... I mean,
Dialogue: 0,1:04:22.96,1:04:24.50,Default,,0,0,0,,我认为我们应该把这个问题留给专业人士去处理\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I think we should leave that to the professionals,
Dialogue: 0,1:04:24.58,1:04:26.58,Default,,0,0,0,,法医已经检查过尸体了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}the medical examiner who, you know, examined the body.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:26.67,1:04:29.25,Default,,0,0,0,,我是说 法医可能不够细心\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Well, I mean, doctors can be careless.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:29.34,1:04:31.59,Default,,0,0,0,,有一次 他们说我爸心脏病发作了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}One time they told my dad he was having a heart attack.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:31.67,1:04:33.67,Default,,0,0,0,,结果只是胀气\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Turned out it was just gas.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:33.76,1:04:36.30,Default,,0,0,0,,他们经常匆忙下结论\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}They're always in such a rush.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:36.39,1:04:38.30,Default,,0,0,0,,说吧 亲爱的 说说你的想法\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Go ahead, dear. Speak your mind.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:42.39,1:04:46.10,Default,,0,0,0,,左右两边锁骨都出现了非常整齐的断口\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}The right and left clavicle both show a very clean break.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:46.19,1:04:47.61,Default,,0,0,0,,你能传阅一下吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Can you pass this around?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:49.32,1:04:50.78,Default,,0,0,0,,她不可能摔成那样吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}She couldn't get that from the fall?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:51.69,1:04:53.44,Default,,0,0,0,,不太可能\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}It's not likely.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:53.53,1:04:58.28,Default,,0,0,0,,两根骨头都肯定是\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Both bones had to be broken by a single,
Dialogue: 0,1:04:58.37,1:05:00.79,Default,,0,0,0,,被来自后方的同一下猛烈撞击撞断的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}sharp, posterior impact.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:02.33,1:05:04.29,Default,,0,0,0,,嘭\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Pow.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:04.37,1:05:07.42,Default,,0,0,0,,赛思的车有撞击痕迹吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Do we know if Sythe's car had any damage?
Dialogue: 0,1:05:09.00,1:05:10.42,Default,,0,0,0,,没有 如果有的话\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}No. The police would have noted it
Dialogue: 0,1:05:10.50,1:05:11.84,Default,,0,0,0,,警察会在报告中注明的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}in their report if it did.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:11.92,1:05:13.30,Default,,0,0,0,,如果他们认为无关紧要就不会记录\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Not if they thought it was irrelevant.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:13.38,1:05:15.42,Default,,0,0,0,,警察讨厌动笔\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Cops hate paperwork.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:15.51,1:05:17.34,Default,,0,0,0,,你也是秘密警察吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}So you're some kind of secret cop now, too?
Dialogue: 0,1:05:17.43,1:05:19.80,Default,,0,0,0,,不是 我是个宠物美容师\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}No. I'm a dog groomer,
Dialogue: 0,1:05:19.89,1:05:22.60,Default,,0,0,0,,但我看过也听过很多犯罪实录\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}but I watch and listen to a lot of true crime,
Dialogue: 0,1:05:22.68,1:05:24.68,Default,,0,0,0,,第一原则就是罪犯是丈夫\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}and the first rule is the husband did it.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:25.52,1:05:27.02,Default,,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Okay, well,
Dialogue: 0,1:05:27.10,1:05:29.06,Default,,0,0,0,,丈夫 男朋友 都一样\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}husband, boyfriend. Same difference.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:29.15,1:05:30.61,Default,,0,0,0,,你同意他有罪 是吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You agree that he's guilty, right?
Dialogue: 0,1:05:30.69,1:05:31.98,Default,,0,0,0,,他是个完美嫌疑人\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}He is the perfect suspect.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:32.07,1:05:33.36,Default,,0,0,0,,好吧 谢谢\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}All right. Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:33.44,1:05:34.86,Default,,0,0,0,,但犯罪实录的第二原则是\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}But the second rule of true crime
Dialogue: 0,1:05:34.94,1:05:37.15,Default,,0,0,0,,永远没有完美的嫌疑人\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}is that it's never the perfect suspect.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:38.03,1:05:39.32,Default,,0,0,0,,上帝啊\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, my God.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:39.41,1:05:42.12,Default,,0,0,0,,我只是跟你们分享我的经验\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I'm just sharing with you my experiences.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:42.20,1:05:45.37,Default,,0,0,0,,你的经验 收听犯罪播客的经验\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Your experiences? Listening to crime podcasts.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:45.45,1:05:47.33,Default,,0,0,0,,等一下 还有看新闻头条呢\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Well, hold on. And watching Dateline.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:47.41,1:05:50.00,Default,,0,0,0,,好吧 那不能使你成为夏洛克·福尔摩斯\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Okay. Well, that doesn't make you Sherlock Holmes.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:50.08,1:05:51.50,Default,,0,0,0,,噢 谢谢\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, thank you.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:51.59,1:05:53.59,Default,,0,0,0,,不 我是说看了足够多的案件后\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}No, you burn through enough cases,
Dialogue: 0,1:05:53.67,1:05:56.34,Default,,0,0,0,,就会开始发现某种规律\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}and you start to see certain patterns.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:56.42,1:05:58.38,Default,,0,0,0,,但我会把侦探的工作留给辩护律师\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}But I leave the detective work to the forum lawyers.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:58.47,1:05:59.93,Default,,0,0,0,,好吧 好了 好了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Okay, good. Good.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:00.01,1:06:01.51,Default,,0,0,0,,因为我们不是来解谜的 好吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Because we're not here to solve a mystery, okay?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:01.60,1:06:03.72,Default,,0,0,0,,我们要做的就是确定\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}All we're here to do is decide if we're positive
Dialogue: 0,1:06:03.81,1:06:06.64,Default,,0,0,0,,詹姆斯·赛思有没有杀害肯德尔·卡特 就这件事\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}James Sythe killed Kendall Carter. That's it.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:06.73,1:06:07.64,Default,,0,0,0,,-我可以看看吗  -噢 好\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}-May I? -Oh.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:07.73,1:06:08.85,Default,,0,0,0,,我不赞同\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I'm not.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:10.81,1:06:13.52,Default,,0,0,0,,老采石场路与高速公路相连\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Old Quarry Road feeds into the highway.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:13.61,1:06:16.40,Default,,0,0,0,,道路拥堵时 GPS会提示你开到那条路\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}When traffic's heavy, GPS will send you that way.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:16.49,1:06:18.07,Default,,0,0,0,,那条路车流量就大了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}It gets busy.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:18.15,1:06:20.49,Default,,0,0,0,,是啊 到了晚上就太可怕了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yeah, and at night, I mean, it's gnarly.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:20.57,1:06:23.03,Default,,0,0,0,,我有次差点撞死一头鹿\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I nearly mowed down a deer once.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:23.12,1:06:24.70,Default,,0,0,0,,如果他们就是这样想的呢\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}What if that's what they thought?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:25.62,1:06:26.83,Default,,0,0,0,,谁这样想\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Who thought?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:28.79,1:06:30.42,Default,,0,0,0,,撞到肯德尔·卡特的那个人\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Whoever hit Kendall Carter.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:33.04,1:06:34.71,Default,,0,0,0,,对 我是说 这就解释得通了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yeah, man. I mean, that all makes sense,
Dialogue: 0,1:06:34.80,1:06:36.92,Default,,0,0,0,,但是 怎么解释我们有目击证人呢\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}but, you know, what about our eyewitness?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:38.76,1:06:40.38,Default,,0,0,0,,可能他看见的是其他人\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Maybe he saw someone else?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:40.47,1:06:42.01,Default,,0,0,0,,好了 等等 等一下\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Okay, hold up. Wait a minute.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:42.09,1:06:44.18,Default,,0,0,0,,你们的可能太多了 我不喜欢\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Y'all got way too many "maybes" for my liking.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:44.26,1:06:47.31,Default,,0,0,0,,是啊 太多的可能就是合理怀疑\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yeah, and too many maybes is reasonable doubt.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:47.39,1:06:48.43,Default,,0,0,0,,我赞同贾斯汀\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I agree with Justin.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:49.77,1:06:50.85,Default,,0,0,0,,对\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:52.56,1:06:54.02,Default,,0,0,0,,好吧 惠子呢\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Okay. Keiko?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:58.40,1:06:59.53,Default,,0,0,0,,内莉呢\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Nellie?
Dialogue: 0,1:07:01.41,1:07:04.83,Default,,0,0,0,,我不确定这个年轻人是否有罪\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I'm not sure any more that this young man is guilty.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:04.91,1:07:06.91,Default,,0,0,0,,好吧 其他人呢\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Right. Okay. Anyone else?
Dialogue: 0,1:07:08.45,1:07:09.25,Default,,0,0,0,,无罪\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Not guilty.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:09.79,1:07:11.46,Default,,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:21.51,1:07:25.10,Default,,0,0,0,,我在17号公路上睡着了 醒来时发现自己躺在沟里\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I fell asleep on Highway 17 and woke up in a ditch.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:25.18,1:07:26.89,Default,,0,0,0,,感谢上帝 医院就在附近\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Thank God the hospital was close.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:28.39,1:07:30.81,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯 好吧\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hmm. Okay.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:32.69,1:07:34.02,Default,,0,0,0,,感谢你抽出宝贵时间\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Thank you for your time.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:34.10,1:07:36.27,Default,,0,0,0,,好\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yep.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:36.36,1:07:38.61,Default,,0,0,0,,我们当时在希腊街飙车\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yeah, we were street racing down Greek Row.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:38.69,1:07:39.94,Default,,0,0,0,,很蠢的行为 我知道\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}It was dumb. I know.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:07.89,1:08:08.97,Default,,0,0,0,,有罪\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Guilty.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:10.68,1:08:11.85,Default,,0,0,0,,有罪\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Guilty.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:15.27,1:08:16.31,Default,,0,0,0,,无罪\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Not guilty.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:18.65,1:08:19.94,Default,,0,0,0,,无罪\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Not guilty.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:23.49,1:08:24.45,Default,,0,0,0,,有罪\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Guilty.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:26.20,1:08:28.62,Default,,0,0,0,,好吧 看起来是6票对6票\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}All right. It looks like we're six to six.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:29.58,1:08:30.83,Default,,0,0,0,,我们陷入僵局了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}We're deadlocked.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:30.91,1:08:32.50,Default,,0,0,0,,好吧 那我们现在怎么办\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Okay, so what do we do now?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:32.58,1:08:35.54,Default,,0,0,0,,感觉我们探讨的越多 知道的越少\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Feels like the more we talk, the less we know.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:35.62,1:08:37.96,Default,,0,0,0,,我好累\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I'm so tired.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:38.04,1:08:40.84,Default,,0,0,0,,你嗑药嗑嗨了 亲爱的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You're so stoned, dear.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:40.92,1:08:42.76,Default,,0,0,0,,我们从头再来吧\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}-Let's go back to the beginning.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:42.84,1:08:44.68,Default,,0,0,0,,一点一点拼凑案情\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Build a case piece by piece.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:44.76,1:08:47.85,Default,,0,0,0,,不 不 别再浪费我们的时间了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}No, no. Let's stop wasting our damn time.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:47.93,1:08:50.81,Default,,0,0,0,,我们休息一会儿怎么样\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}How about we all just take a breath. It's...
Dialogue: 0,1:08:50.89,1:08:52.43,Default,,0,0,0,,真是漫长的一天 但是 投票\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}It's been a long day, but, you know, votes...
Dialogue: 0,1:08:52.52,1:08:53.77,Default,,0,0,0,,投票结果有变化 对吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}votes have changed, right?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:53.85,1:08:55.27,Default,,0,0,0,,这个过程在发挥作用\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}The process is working.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:55.35,1:08:58.15,Default,,0,0,0,,不 才没有 你让我们疲惫不堪\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}No, it's not. You are wearing us down.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:58.23,1:09:00.98,Default,,0,0,0,,讨论了这么多 但说的都没用\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Talking a lot, but saying nothing.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:01.07,1:09:03.28,Default,,0,0,0,,我的意思是 见鬼 所有事情你都要翻来覆去说好几遍\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I mean, hell, you go over anything enough times,
Dialogue: 0,1:09:03.36,1:09:04.95,Default,,0,0,0,,对 我们开始有疑问了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}yeah, we'll start to question it.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:05.03,1:09:07.36,Default,,0,0,0,,对 就好像选那双鞋来穿\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yeah. Like which shoes to wear.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:07.45,1:09:09.66,Default,,0,0,0,,对 听着\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yeah. Look...
Dialogue: 0,1:09:09.74,1:09:12.54,Default,,0,0,0,,我们有这些理论 但没有新的证据\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}We got all these theories, y'all, but no new evidence.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:12.62,1:09:14.29,Default,,0,0,0,,对 但这些理论正在让我们当中的一些人\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Well, yeah, but those theories are making
Dialogue: 0,1:09:14.37,1:09:16.33,Default,,0,0,0,,对詹姆斯·赛思的罪行产生了怀疑\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}some of us question James Sythe's guilt.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:16.42,1:09:19.00,Default,,0,0,0,,不不不 你可以尽情质疑\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}No. No, no. You can question it all you want,
Dialogue: 0,1:09:19.08,1:09:21.17,Default,,0,0,0,,但我知道他有罪\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}but I know he's guilty.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:22.80,1:09:24.26,Default,,0,0,0,,看看他那该死的脖子\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Just look at his damn neck.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:26.30,1:09:27.97,Default,,0,0,0,,嘿 伙计 我知道你那本子里\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hey, my man. I know you got a picture of him
Dialogue: 0,1:09:28.05,1:09:29.05,Default,,0,0,0,,画了他的画像\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}in that book of yours.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:31.14,1:09:34.39,Default,,0,0,0,,对 画得不完美 但是\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I mean, yeah, but it's not perfect, but...
Dialogue: 0,1:09:35.77,1:09:37.90,Default,,0,0,0,,对 看见了吗 就在那儿\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yes. See? Right there.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:37.98,1:09:39.90,Default,,0,0,0,,蛇和王冠\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Snake and a crown.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:39.98,1:09:41.57,Default,,0,0,0,,那是西区王冠帮的标志\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}That's the West Side Crowns.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:41.65,1:09:44.40,Default,,0,0,0,,他们是本市最大的毒品走私团伙\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}They're the biggest drug pushers in the city.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:44.49,1:09:45.69,Default,,0,0,0,,你是怎么知道的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}How do you know that?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:45.78,1:09:48.16,Default,,0,0,0,,因为我经营着男孩女孩俱乐部\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Because I run the Boys and Girls Club.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:48.24,1:09:51.08,Default,,0,0,0,,这些人正在毒害他们的社区\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}These guys are poisoning their own community.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:54.24,1:09:55.45,Default,,0,0,0,,这个案子你掺杂了私人情感\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}This case is personal to you.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:55.54,1:09:57.04,Default,,0,0,0,,是啊 你说的一点没错\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yeah, well, you're damn right it is.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:00.83,1:10:04.34,Default,,0,0,0,,我弟弟纹身的时候\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}My little brother was 14
Dialogue: 0,1:10:04.42,1:10:05.76,Default,,0,0,0,,只有14岁\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}when he got inked.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:08.30,1:10:11.80,Default,,0,0,0,,在17岁生日的前一个月 他死了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}A month before his 17th birthday, he was dead.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:11.89,1:10:13.64,Default,,0,0,0,,在一场针锋相对的地盘争夺战中\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Caught a stray bullet in some...
Dialogue: 0,1:10:14.89,1:10:17.43,Default,,0,0,0,,被流弹打死了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}tit-for-tat turf bullshit.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:19.90,1:10:22.06,Default,,0,0,0,,对不起 我不知道\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I'm sorry. I had no idea.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:22.15,1:10:24.94,Default,,0,0,0,,对 没错 你什么都不知道\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yeah, that's right. You have no idea.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:28.40,1:10:33.37,Default,,0,0,0,,你看 赛思确实说他已经不再过那种生活了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Look, Sythe did say that he left that life behind.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:33.45,1:10:35.58,Default,,0,0,0,,只有一个办法可以离开那群人\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}There's only one way to leave that crew.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:37.58,1:10:39.08,Default,,0,0,0,,所以\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}So...
Dialogue: 0,1:10:39.16,1:10:42.21,Default,,0,0,0,,你可以继续讲你的理论\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You can keep talking about your theories.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:42.29,1:10:43.92,Default,,0,0,0,,但是人是会变的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Look, people can change.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:44.00,1:10:45.25,Default,,0,0,0,,对 你就继续自欺欺人吧\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yeah. Keep telling yourself that.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:45.34,1:10:46.63,Default,,0,0,0,,我就是这么认为的一直都是\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I... I do. Every day.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:46.71,1:10:48.42,Default,,0,0,0,,我是开公交车的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Well, I drive a bus,
Dialogue: 0,1:10:48.51,1:10:50.51,Default,,0,0,0,,每天都看着同一群人上上下下\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}and I see the same people day in and day out,
Dialogue: 0,1:10:50.59,1:10:51.97,Default,,0,0,0,,他们是不会变的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}and they do not change.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:52.05,1:10:54.39,Default,,0,0,0,,那我怎么会坐在这里呢\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Well, then how am I sitting here?
Dialogue: 0,1:10:54.47,1:10:55.68,Default,,0,0,0,,你是什么意思呢\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}What are you talking about?
Dialogue: 0,1:10:55.76,1:10:56.68,Default,,0,0,0,,我本来都该死了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I should be dead.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:57.72,1:10:58.68,Default,,0,0,0,,我差点死了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I should...
Dialogue: 0,1:11:00.06,1:11:02.10,Default,,0,0,0,,差不多四年前\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}A little over four years ago,
Dialogue: 0,1:11:02.19,1:11:03.56,Default,,0,0,0,,我开车撞到了一棵树上\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I wrapped my car around a tree
Dialogue: 0,1:11:03.65,1:11:05.61,Default,,0,0,0,,当时血液里的酒精含量高得\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}with a blood alcohol level that,
Dialogue: 0,1:11:05.69,1:11:07.07,Default,,0,0,0,,就算我没开车\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}you know, probably should have killed me
Dialogue: 0,1:11:07.15,1:11:08.44,Default,,0,0,0,,可能都要醉死了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}before I even got in the car
Dialogue: 0,1:11:08.53,1:11:11.24,Default,,0,0,0,,但是不知怎么的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}and somehow...
Dialogue: 0,1:11:11.32,1:11:12.70,Default,,0,0,0,,我最后竟然没怎么受伤\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}walked away with barely a scratch.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:12.78,1:11:14.16,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯 你真幸运\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Mmm. Lucky you.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:14.24,1:11:15.95,Default,,0,0,0,,是啊 我的刑期里有一部份\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yeah. Yeah, part of my sentence
Dialogue: 0,1:11:16.03,1:11:17.54,Default,,0,0,0,,是社区服务\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}was community service.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:17.62,1:11:19.00,Default,,0,0,0,,我每周有3天要在一所小学里\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I spent three days a week in an elementary school
Dialogue: 0,1:11:19.08,1:11:21.08,Default,,0,0,0,,教孩子们写作\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}teaching kids how to write.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:21.17,1:11:24.75,Default,,0,0,0,,呃 酒鬼 总是很有魅力\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Uh... Alcoholics, we can charm anybody.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:24.84,1:11:27.42,Default,,0,0,0,,但是负责带着我的老师\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}But the teacher I was reporting to,
Dialogue: 0,1:11:27.50,1:11:28.88,Default,,0,0,0,,她没有对我产生偏见\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I mean, she was Teflon.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:28.96,1:11:30.84,Default,,0,0,0,,她一眼就看穿我了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}She saw right through me.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:30.92,1:11:32.63,Default,,0,0,0,,而且她\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}And she...
Dialogue: 0,1:11:32.72,1:11:35.43,Default,,0,0,0,,她让我最终变得想要管好我自己\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}She made me finally want to, you know, own my shit
Dialogue: 0,1:11:35.51,1:11:38.18,Default,,0,0,0,,为自己负责\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}and just take responsibility for myself.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:40.52,1:11:41.48,Default,,0,0,0,,我\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I'm...
Dialogue: 0,1:11:41.56,1:11:43.06,Default,,0,0,0,,我到现在都还不知道自己做了什么\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I'm still not sure what I did
Dialogue: 0,1:11:43.15,1:11:44.52,Default,,0,0,0,,能让她那样的女人给我一个机会\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}to get a woman like her to give me a chance.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:44.61,1:11:48.36,Default,,0,0,0,,但是她的信念\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}But her belief and believing in myself,
Dialogue: 0,1:11:48.44,1:11:50.90,Default,,0,0,0,,还有她相信我能够改变\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}that I could change, that was...
Dialogue: 0,1:11:50.99,1:11:53.03,Default,,0,0,0,,那才是我真正改变的第一步\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}That was, you know, the first step.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:53.95,1:11:55.53,Default,,0,0,0,,而且\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}And...
Dialogue: 0,1:11:55.62,1:11:57.03,Default,,0,0,0,,你看\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Look, the, uh...
Dialogue: 0,1:11:57.12,1:11:59.49,Default,,0,0,0,,改变的过程永远都不会结束 我是知道的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}the journey never ends, I know that...
Dialogue: 0,1:11:59.58,1:12:00.54,Default,,0,0,0,,但是\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}But...
Dialogue: 0,1:12:01.87,1:12:02.87,Default,,0,0,0,,那\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}that's...
Dialogue: 0,1:12:03.92,1:12:05.71,Default,,0,0,0,,已经四年了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}that's four years.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:05.79,1:12:08.75,Default,,0,0,0,,我还是四年前的那个我吗 不是了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}And am I the same man that I was four years ago? No.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:09.63,1:12:10.84,Default,,0,0,0,,肯定不是了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Absolutely not.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:10.92,1:12:12.47,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yeah, well...
Dialogue: 0,1:12:12.55,1:12:14.22,Default,,0,0,0,,现在我看出来\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Now I can see...
Dialogue: 0,1:12:15.51,1:12:16.55,Default,,0,0,0,,你是变了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You changed.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:17.72,1:12:19.56,Default,,0,0,0,,但是像詹姆斯·赛思这样的人\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}But guys like James Sythe,
Dialogue: 0,1:12:20.47,1:12:22.18,Default,,0,0,0,,是不会变的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}they don't change.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:22.27,1:12:24.48,Default,,0,0,0,,好吧 回想一下他的的证词\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Okay. Think back to his testimony.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:24.56,1:12:28.40,Default,,0,0,0,,很原始 也很真实 我愿意相信\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}That was raw and real, and I believed it.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:28.48,1:12:30.40,Default,,0,0,0,,等等 等一下\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Wait, hold on, gang.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:30.48,1:12:32.53,Default,,0,0,0,,如果不是赛思干的 那是谁干的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}If Sythe didn't do it, then who did?
Dialogue: 0,1:12:32.61,1:12:34.74,Default,,0,0,0,,我们不用回答那个问题\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}We don't have to answer that.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:34.82,1:12:36.53,Default,,0,0,0,,所以没人会为那个女孩的遭遇付出代价吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}So no one's going to pay for what happened to that girl?
Dialogue: 0,1:12:36.62,1:12:38.95,Default,,0,0,0,,-不 会有人付出代价的  -你怎么知道的呢\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}-No, someone will pay. -How do you know that?
Dialogue: 0,1:12:39.03,1:12:40.58,Default,,0,0,0,,因为恶人总会付出代价\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Because somebody always does. Look...
Dialogue: 0,1:12:40.66,1:12:42.00,Default,,0,0,0,,听着 我知道你的感受\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Look, I get how you feel,
Dialogue: 0,1:12:42.08,1:12:44.79,Default,,0,0,0,,但是你不能被感情所左右\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}but you can't let your feelings sway you.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:44.87,1:12:46.63,Default,,0,0,0,,你可不了解我 哥们\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You don't know anything about me, man.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:46.71,1:12:47.71,Default,,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}All right.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:50.67,1:12:52.92,Default,,0,0,0,,你的女儿多大了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}How... how old's your daughter?
Dialogue: 0,1:12:53.01,1:12:54.38,Default,,0,0,0,,你钥匙扣上挂的是她 对吧\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}That's her on the key chain, right?
Dialogue: 0,1:12:57.26,1:12:59.01,Default,,0,0,0,,对 她\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yeah. She, um...
Dialogue: 0,1:12:59.10,1:13:01.27,Default,,0,0,0,,她三月就16岁了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}She turned 16 in March.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:01.35,1:13:02.60,Default,,0,0,0,,你多久和她见一次\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}How often do you get to see her?
Dialogue: 0,1:13:05.10,1:13:06.94,Default,,0,0,0,,很久才见一面\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Not often enough.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:07.02,1:13:09.56,Default,,0,0,0,,你知道吗 在庭审的时候 我就坐在\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You know, during the trial, I was sat
Dialogue: 0,1:13:09.65,1:13:11.36,Default,,0,0,0,,肯德尔父母的对面\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}right in Kendall's parents' eyeline.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:11.44,1:13:12.48,Default,,0,0,0,,我每天都可以\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I could see...
Dialogue: 0,1:13:14.19,1:13:15.78,Default,,0,0,0,,看到他们有多痛苦\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I mean, their pain each day.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:15.86,1:13:18.28,Default,,0,0,0,,而且 万一遭遇不幸的是你自己的女儿呢\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}And, you know, what if she were your daughter?
Dialogue: 0,1:13:20.58,1:13:22.54,Default,,0,0,0,,你想要伸张正义 对吧 想要以眼还眼\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You want justice, right? An eye for an eye.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:22.62,1:13:24.33,Default,,0,0,0,,对 没错\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Right. Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:24.41,1:13:26.29,Default,,0,0,0,,但是詹姆斯·赛思的家人每天也都在庭上\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}But then James Sythe's family was in court each day, too.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:26.37,1:13:27.75,Default,,0,0,0,,就是他的祖母和侄女\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You know, his grandma and his niece.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:27.83,1:13:29.63,Default,,0,0,0,,呃\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Uh...
Dialogue: 0,1:13:29.71,1:13:31.71,Default,,0,0,0,,要是他是你的儿子呢 对吧\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}What if he were your son, right?
Dialogue: 0,1:13:33.38,1:13:34.72,Default,,0,0,0,,你肯定也会想为他伸张正义吧\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Wouldn't you want justice for him, too?
Dialogue: 0,1:13:37.22,1:13:39.55,Default,,0,0,0,,对 对 我应该会的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yeah. Yeah, I suppose, I would.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:27.89,1:14:29.85,Default,,0,0,0,,那么我有什么可以帮你的呢\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}So how can I help you?
Dialogue: 0,1:14:29.94,1:14:31.36,Default,,0,0,0,,我只是想和你聊一聊\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Well, I just want to have a little chat
Dialogue: 0,1:14:31.44,1:14:32.86,Default,,0,0,0,,这里发生了什么\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}about what happened here.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:32.94,1:14:34.52,Default,,0,0,0,,单独聊聊就好了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Just have a little one on one.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:34.61,1:14:35.98,Default,,0,0,0,,要是你有什么新的发现\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Maybe I could get some more information
Dialogue: 0,1:14:36.07,1:14:39.20,Default,,0,0,0,,也许我就能得到更多信息了 你知道吧\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}if something came to you new, you know?
Dialogue: 0,1:14:39.28,1:14:43.12,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯 就和我在庭审的时候说的一样 警察过来了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Well, like I said at the trial, the police come by.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:43.20,1:14:44.62,Default,,0,0,0,,给我看了一张照片\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Showed me a picture,
Dialogue: 0,1:14:44.70,1:14:46.54,Default,,0,0,0,,问我他是不是我在那天晚上看到的男人\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}asked me if he was the man I saw that night.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:46.62,1:14:49.08,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯 他们给你看别的照片了吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Mmm. They show you any other pictures?
Dialogue: 0,1:14:49.16,1:14:50.75,Default,,0,0,0,,哦 没有 他们知道是他\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, no. They knew it was him.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:50.83,1:14:53.67,Default,,0,0,0,,他们只是需要我确认一下\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}They... They just needed me to confirm it.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:53.75,1:14:54.84,Default,,0,0,0,,对\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Right.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:55.88,1:14:57.21,Default,,0,0,0,,我很乐意这么做\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I was happy to do so.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:57.30,1:15:00.09,Default,,0,0,0,,大家都很宽容\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I mean, everyone was so generous.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:00.18,1:15:03.18,Default,,0,0,0,,要说的话 再一次被需要的感觉\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}And if I could say so, it felt pretty good
Dialogue: 0,1:15:03.26,1:15:05.51,Default,,0,0,0,,-非常好  -嗯\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}-to be needed again. -Mmm.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:06.18,1:15:07.93,Default,,0,0,0,,肯定很不错\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I'm sure it did.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:08.02,1:15:10.23,Default,,0,0,0,,好了 要是还有什么需要我帮忙的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}All right. Well, if there's anything else I can do for you,
Dialogue: 0,1:15:10.31,1:15:12.52,Default,,0,0,0,,尽管说 我随时准备着\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}just give a holler. Tea is always hot.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:12.60,1:15:14.15,Default,,0,0,0,,好的 非常感谢\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Okay. Thank you so much.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:14.23,1:15:15.02,Default,,0,0,0,,谢谢你的时间 先生\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Thanks for your time, sir.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:15.11,1:15:16.53,Default,,0,0,0,,呃 詹姆斯·赛思\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Uh, James Sythe...
Dialogue: 0,1:15:19.36,1:15:21.74,Default,,0,0,0,,他确实杀了那个女孩 对吧\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}He did kill that girl, right?
Dialogue: 0,1:15:30.33,1:15:33.42,Default,,0,0,0,,好了 还有其他人想改票吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Okay, so does anybody else want to change their vote?
Dialogue: 0,1:15:35.84,1:15:37.25,Default,,0,0,0,,呃 好吧\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Uh, well...
Dialogue: 0,1:15:39.05,1:15:40.09,Default,,0,0,0,,反正也无所谓了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}It doesn't matter anyway.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:40.17,1:15:41.93,Default,,0,0,0,,你是什么意思\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}What do you mean?
Dialogue: 0,1:15:42.01,1:15:44.51,Default,,0,0,0,,因为我没有改变主意\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Because I haven't changed my mind.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:44.59,1:15:45.89,Default,,0,0,0,,那好 我们继续聊吧\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}All right, well, let's just keep talking.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:45.97,1:15:49.10,Default,,0,0,0,,不 不要 我不想聊了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}No, no, I'm done talking.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:49.77,1:15:51.18,Default,,0,0,0,,马库斯\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Marcus.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:51.27,1:15:54.35,Default,,0,0,0,,所以呢 你准备告诉法官 我们\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}So what? You're gonna tell the judge, we...
Dialogue: 0,1:15:54.44,1:15:56.57,Default,,0,0,0,,我们没办法做出裁决吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}we can't reach a verdict?
Dialogue: 0,1:15:56.65,1:15:58.44,Default,,0,0,0,,事实就是如此\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}It is what it is.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:58.53,1:16:00.24,Default,,0,0,0,,但是我们都有进展了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}But we're actually making progress.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:00.32,1:16:03.24,Default,,0,0,0,,-进展  -对啊\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}-Progress? -Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:03.32,1:16:05.74,Default,,0,0,0,,我们连裁决都无法达成 还要怎么继续\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}How can we continue if we can't even reach a verdict?
Dialogue: 0,1:16:05.82,1:16:08.41,Default,,0,0,0,,我们这样都不知道多久了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}We've been at this for I don't even know how long.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:09.12,1:16:10.45,Default,,0,0,0,,我的孩子还在等我回家呢\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}My kids need me.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:12.21,1:16:13.87,Default,,0,0,0,,我只是想做好我的工作\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I'm just trying to do my job here.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:15.04,1:16:17.63,Default,,0,0,0,,好吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Okay? Um...
Dialogue: 0,1:16:17.71,1:16:19.67,Default,,0,0,0,,科特妮 你呢 你还想继续吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Courtney, what about you? Do you want to keep going?
Dialogue: 0,1:16:19.75,1:16:22.38,Default,,0,0,0,,我不知道 你看 他吼了她\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I don't know. Look, he yelled at her.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:22.47,1:16:25.18,Default,,0,0,0,,他抓着她的手臂 叫她婊子\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}He grabbed her arm. He called her a bitch.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:25.26,1:16:27.35,Default,,0,0,0,,他占有欲强 而且脾气暴躁\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}He was possessive and temperamental.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:27.43,1:16:30.47,Default,,0,0,0,,不 他是虐待狂 去他的吧\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}No, he was abusive. Screw him.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:31.56,1:16:33.44,Default,,0,0,0,,没错 你是对的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yeah. You're right.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:34.10,1:16:35.56,Default,,0,0,0,,去他的吧\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Screw him.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:35.65,1:16:37.56,Default,,0,0,0,,太好了 已经第三次了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Great. For the third time,
Dialogue: 0,1:16:37.65,1:16:38.90,Default,,0,0,0,,我要回家告诉我丈夫\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I get to go home and tell my husband,
Dialogue: 0,1:16:38.98,1:16:39.98,Default,,0,0,0,,你猜怎么着 亲爱的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}"Guess what, honey?
Dialogue: 0,1:16:40.07,1:16:42.40,Default,,0,0,0,,我又什么都没做成\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I did nothing."
Dialogue: 0,1:16:42.49,1:16:44.57,Default,,0,0,0,,他真的会很开心的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}He gets a real kick out of that.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:44.65,1:16:46.62,Default,,0,0,0,,抱歉 丹妮丝 我不会改票的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I'm sorry, Denice. I'm not changing my vote.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:47.53,1:16:49.03,Default,,0,0,0,,我也不会\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Neither am I.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:49.12,1:16:51.24,Default,,0,0,0,,我也是\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yeah. Me, too.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:55.96,1:16:57.25,Default,,0,0,0,,那我们要怎么办\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}So what do we do then?
Dialogue: 0,1:16:57.96,1:16:58.84,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Um...
Dialogue: 0,1:17:00.42,1:17:02.17,Default,,0,0,0,,有一个办法我们可以试试看\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}there's one thing we could try.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:03.51,1:17:06.26,Default,,0,0,0,,陪审团主席\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Madam Foreperson.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:07.76,1:17:09.72,Default,,0,0,0,,我通常不会同意\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Sending a jury to visit a crime scene
Dialogue: 0,1:17:09.80,1:17:11.35,Default,,0,0,0,,陪审团在审议开始之后\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}once deliberations have begun
Dialogue: 0,1:17:11.43,1:17:13.77,Default,,0,0,0,,去犯罪现场\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}is not something I would typically allow.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:13.85,1:17:15.35,Default,,0,0,0,,恕我直言 法官阁下\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}With all due respect, Your Honor,
Dialogue: 0,1:17:15.44,1:17:18.31,Default,,0,0,0,,这可不是常规的审议\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}this has not been a typical deliberation.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:18.40,1:17:20.23,Default,,0,0,0,,但是我真的觉得这样可以帮我们\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}But I do think it will be beneficial
Dialogue: 0,1:17:20.32,1:17:21.90,Default,,0,0,0,,达成一致的裁决\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}in helping us reach a verdict.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:21.98,1:17:22.94,Default,,0,0,0,,我明白了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I see.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:25.65,1:17:27.07,Default,,0,0,0,,雷斯尼克先生 有异议吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Mr. Resnick. Any objections?
Dialogue: 0,1:17:28.20,1:17:29.45,Default,,0,0,0,,没有 法官阁下\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}No, Your Honor.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:29.53,1:17:30.78,Default,,0,0,0,,好的 那基乐布鲁小姐呢\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Okay, Miss Killebrew?
Dialogue: 0,1:17:32.83,1:17:34.58,Default,,0,0,0,,我们对此没有意见\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}The State's fine with it.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:34.66,1:17:35.66,Default,,0,0,0,,那好\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}All right, then.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:36.58,1:17:39.17,Default,,0,0,0,,请听好规则\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Here are the rules.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:39.25,1:17:41.67,Default,,0,0,0,,在外出的时候 你们不可以\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}During your visit, you are not to speak
Dialogue: 0,1:17:41.75,1:17:43.67,Default,,0,0,0,,和陪审团以外的任何人交谈\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}to anyone outside of your jury panel,
Dialogue: 0,1:17:43.76,1:17:48.34,Default,,0,0,0,,也不可以相互讨论此案\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}nor are you to speak to each other about this case.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:48.43,1:17:50.39,Default,,0,0,0,,还有 你们要去查看的是案发现场\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}All right, you are there to view the locations
Dialogue: 0,1:17:50.47,1:17:53.52,Default,,0,0,0,,还有周围的情况\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}in and around where the crime took place.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:53.60,1:17:58.19,Default,,0,0,0,,你们不可以收集任何证据\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}And you are not to collect evidence of any kind.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:58.27,1:18:00.61,Default,,0,0,0,,大家都听明白规则了吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Does everyone understand these rules?
Dialogue: 0,1:18:00.69,1:18:02.61,Default,,0,0,0,,-明自了 女士  -明白了 法官阁下\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}-Yes, ma'am. -Yes, Your Honor.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:02.69,1:18:03.69,Default,,0,0,0,,那好\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}All right, then.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:05.07,1:18:06.32,Default,,0,0,0,,现在休庭\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}This court is adjourned.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:08.53,1:18:10.32,Default,,0,0,0,,嘿 嘿 我们能说几句吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hey. Hey. Can... Can we talk?
Dialogue: 0,1:18:12.08,1:18:14.24,Default,,0,0,0,,好 太好了 我们到时候见 谢谢\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yeah, great. Great. I'll see you there. Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:30.14,1:18:31.60,Default,,0,0,0,,你好\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hello?
Dialogue: 0,1:18:31.68,1:18:34.31,Default,,0,0,0,,哦 嘿 你是艾利森·克鲁森吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, hey, are you Allison Crewson?
Dialogue: 0,1:18:34.39,1:18:36.14,Default,,0,0,0,,是的 对 你是谁\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yes, I am. Yeah. Who are you?
Dialogue: 0,1:18:36.22,1:18:37.89,Default,,0,0,0,,我是 嗯 我是费思·基乐布鲁\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I'm, um... I'm Faith Killebrew.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:37.98,1:18:40.48,Default,,0,0,0,,我是地方检察官办公室的一名检察官\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I'm a prosecutor with the District Attorney's office.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:40.56,1:18:42.77,Default,,0,0,0,,我们可以谈谈吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Do you mind if we talk?
Dialogue: 0,1:18:42.86,1:18:44.65,Default,,0,0,0,,我正准备躺下呢 请问有什么事吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I was just about to lay down, but what is this about?
Dialogue: 0,1:18:44.73,1:18:46.94,Default,,0,0,0,,一分钟就好\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}It'll only be a minute.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:47.03,1:18:48.86,Default,,0,0,0,,-好 进来吧  -好的 谢谢你\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}-Okay. Come in. -Okay. Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:55.29,1:18:56.83,Default,,0,0,0,,呃 很抱歉打扰你\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Uh, I'm sorry for the intrusion.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:56.91,1:18:58.62,Default,,0,0,0,,我很快就好\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I won't be long.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:58.71,1:19:00.54,Default,,0,0,0,,我正在跟进\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I'm following up on a...
Dialogue: 0,1:19:00.62,1:19:03.04,Default,,0,0,0,,去年10月发生的几起事故\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}on a few different accidents from October last year,
Dialogue: 0,1:19:03.13,1:19:05.17,Default,,0,0,0,,所以在针对那段时间里\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}just doing routine checks on any cars
Dialogue: 0,1:19:05.25,1:19:08.01,Default,,0,0,0,,因为车身严重受损而维修过的车辆做例行检查\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}that were serviced for major body damage around that time.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:08.09,1:19:09.22,Default,,0,0,0,,好的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:09.30,1:19:11.09,Default,,0,0,0,,所以去年10月25日\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}So on October 25th last year,
Dialogue: 0,1:19:11.18,1:19:14.80,Default,,0,0,0,,你是不是有一辆1996年的绿色丰田超霸\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}did you own a 1996 green Toyota 4Runner?
Dialogue: 0,1:19:14.89,1:19:16.39,Default,,0,0,0,,是的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yes.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:16.47,1:19:17.81,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯哼 那你是否记得在那段时间\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Mmm-hmm. And do you remember having any body work
Dialogue: 0,1:19:17.89,1:19:20.35,Default,,0,0,0,,-维修过车身呢  -是的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}-done on it around that time? -Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:20.44,1:19:23.52,Default,,0,0,0,,好的 你的车是怎么损坏的呢\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Okay. And how was your car damaged?
Dialogue: 0,1:19:23.61,1:19:25.36,Default,,0,0,0,,我丈夫贾斯汀撞到了一头鹿\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}My husband, Justin, hit a deer.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:25.44,1:19:26.98,Default,,0,0,0,,好的 还记得在哪里吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Okay. Any idea where?
Dialogue: 0,1:19:28.19,1:19:29.65,Default,,0,0,0,,硫磺峡谷那里\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Up on Brimstone Pass.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:30.53,1:19:31.70,Default,,0,0,0,,你确定吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You sure?
Dialogue: 0,1:19:31.78,1:19:34.74,Default,,0,0,0,,确定\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:34.82,1:19:36.79,Default,,0,0,0,,有没有可能是在老采石场路呢 或者\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Could it have been Old Quarry Road? Or...
Dialogue: 0,1:19:38.50,1:19:40.12,Default,,0,0,0,,不是 就是在硫磺峡谷\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}No, it was Brimstone Pass.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:41.67,1:19:42.67,Default,,0,0,0,,你确定吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You're positive.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:43.75,1:19:44.88,Default,,0,0,0,,确定\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Positive.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:46.84,1:19:49.55,Default,,0,0,0,,好了 很好 我就需要了解这些\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Okay. Great. Well, that's all I have.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:51.30,1:19:53.84,Default,,0,0,0,,真的很感谢你的时间 克鲁森夫人\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Thank you very much for your time, Mrs. Crewson.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:53.93,1:19:56.64,Default,,0,0,0,,还有 恭喜你 你的预产期是什么时候\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}And, uh, congratulations. When are you due?
Dialogue: 0,1:19:57.76,1:19:59.22,Default,,0,0,0,,呃\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Uh...
Dialogue: 0,1:19:59.31,1:20:00.52,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯 马上了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yeah, any day now.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:00.60,1:20:01.89,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯 祝你好运\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Well, good luck with that.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:01.98,1:20:03.73,Default,,0,0,0,,走之前还有什么需要我做的吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You want me to do anything before I go?
Dialogue: 0,1:20:03.81,1:20:05.15,Default,,0,0,0,,-没 没了  -好的 那我就先走了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}-No, no. No. -Okay. Well, I'll just see myself out.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:05.23,1:20:06.56,Default,,0,0,0,,-别 我来送你  -不用了 你待着就好\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}-No. I'll get you... -No, you stay there.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:06.65,1:20:08.32,Default,,0,0,0,,-好吧  -没事的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}-Okay, all right. -No, it's good.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:08.40,1:20:09.36,Default,,0,0,0,,-祝你顺利  -谢谢 谢谢你的时间\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}-Have a good one. -Thank you. Thanks for your time.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:09.44,1:20:10.32,Default,,0,0,0,,-再见  -再见\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}-Bye. -Bye, now.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:32.09,1:20:34.47,Default,,0,0,0,,嘿 抱歉没有早点见你\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hey. Sorry I couldn't meet you earlier.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:34.55,1:20:36.18,Default,,0,0,0,,-没关系  -你在想什么\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}-No worries. -What's on your mind?
Dialogue: 0,1:20:36.26,1:20:37.43,Default,,0,0,0,,庭审\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}The trial.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:37.51,1:20:39.39,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯 我猜到了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Well, yeah, I figured.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:39.47,1:20:41.10,Default,,0,0,0,,陪审团还是悬而未决\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}It's headed for a hung jury.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:41.18,1:20:42.14,Default,,0,0,0,,贾斯汀\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Justin!
Dialogue: 0,1:20:43.10,1:20:45.06,Default,,0,0,0,,-谢谢  -请慢用\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}-Thanks. -Enjoy.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:45.15,1:20:47.77,Default,,0,0,0,,-我给你带了杯咖啡  -谢谢\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}-I got you a coffee. -Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:47.86,1:20:49.61,Default,,0,0,0,,显然 我想裁定那人无罪\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Obviously, I want to acquit the guy,
Dialogue: 0,1:20:49.69,1:20:52.07,Default,,0,0,0,,但是如果陪审团达不成一致 那就是无效审判了 对吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}but if the jury hangs, it's a mistrial, right?
Dialogue: 0,1:20:52.15,1:20:54.65,Default,,0,0,0,,-是的  -那问题就解决了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}-That's right. -So problem solved.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:54.74,1:20:56.57,Default,,0,0,0,,考虑到媒体对这个案子的关注\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Well, given all the press on this case,
Dialogue: 0,1:20:56.66,1:20:58.74,Default,,0,0,0,,公众肯定会要求重审的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}the public's going to demand a retrial.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:58.83,1:21:01.08,Default,,0,0,0,,我们又得重新对付赛思了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}We're just gonna have to do it all over again with Sythe.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:01.16,1:21:03.16,Default,,0,0,0,,除非地方检察官办公室认定\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Unless the District Attorney's office decides
Dialogue: 0,1:21:03.25,1:21:06.67,Default,,0,0,0,,他不是凶手 那他们会找到真凶的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}that he's not the guy, then they'll find the guy.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:06.75,1:21:09.04,Default,,0,0,0,,这个案子不会在没有裁决的情况下结束的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}And there's no way that this case ends without a verdict.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:09.13,1:21:11.67,Default,,0,0,0,,一旦产生裁决 那就结束了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Once they get that, then, yeah, it's over. Then it's done.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:11.76,1:21:13.59,Default,,0,0,0,,所以你的意思是必须得做出裁决\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}So you're saying I need a verdict?
Dialogue: 0,1:21:14.30,1:21:15.43,Default,,0,0,0,,恐怕是\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I'm afraid so.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:32.78,1:21:34.78,Default,,0,0,0,,嘿 你能来县检察院里见我吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hey, can you meet me at County?
Dialogue: 0,1:21:55.42,1:21:56.42,Default,,0,0,0,,嘿\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hey.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:57.43,1:21:59.80,Default,,0,0,0,,嘿 还好吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hey. Everything okay?
Dialogue: 0,1:22:01.81,1:22:03.93,Default,,0,0,0,,我在检查车 可能有买家了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Just checking the car. Might have a buyer.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:10.44,1:22:11.82,Default,,0,0,0,,你在哪里撞的鹿来着\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Where'd you hit that deer again?
Dialogue: 0,1:22:13.94,1:22:16.15,Default,,0,0,0,,硫磺峡谷 对吧\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Up on Brimstone Pass, right?
Dialogue: 0,1:22:17.74,1:22:18.70,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Mmm.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:20.37,1:22:22.37,Default,,0,0,0,,你确定不是在老采石场路吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Are you sure that it wasn't Old Quarry Road?
Dialogue: 0,1:22:23.54,1:22:24.83,Default,,0,0,0,,我确定\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I'm positive.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:25.83,1:22:26.83,Default,,0,0,0,,那是\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}That's...
Dialogue: 0,1:22:27.54,1:22:29.75,Default,,0,0,0,,只是\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Just that's ex...
Dialogue: 0,1:22:29.83,1:22:32.25,Default,,0,0,0,,确定 我就是这么告诉\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}"Positive," that's what I said to the...
Dialogue: 0,1:22:32.34,1:22:33.92,Default,,0,0,0,,你参与的案子的检察官的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}prosecutor from your trial
Dialogue: 0,1:22:34.00,1:22:36.26,Default,,0,0,0,,她刚刚在我们的客厅里讯问了我\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}when she just interrogated me in our living room.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:37.42,1:22:38.84,Default,,0,0,0,,-什么 她来了吗  -对\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}-What? She was here. -Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:40.59,1:22:42.68,Default,,0,0,0,,我搜了她 她想了解你车祸的事\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I looked her up. She wanted to know about your accident.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:44.26,1:22:45.18,Default,,0,0,0,,那\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}That--
Dialogue: 0,1:22:46.81,1:22:48.31,Default,,0,0,0,,你是怎么和她说的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}What'd you tell her?
Dialogue: 0,1:22:48.39,1:22:49.39,Default,,0,0,0,,按实说的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}The truth.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:51.94,1:22:52.98,Default,,0,0,0,,你在硫磺峡谷\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}That you hit a deer
Dialogue: 0,1:22:53.94,1:22:55.40,Default,,0,0,0,,撞了一头鹿\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}up on Brimstone Pass.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:56.78,1:22:58.86,Default,,0,0,0,,好 很好\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Okay. Good.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:00.49,1:23:01.61,Default,,0,0,0,,这是事实 对吧\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}That is the truth, right?
Dialogue: 0,1:23:03.99,1:23:05.91,Default,,0,0,0,,那天晚上 你有从老采石场路\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Did you take the shortcut...
Dialogue: 0,1:23:05.99,1:23:07.50,Default,,0,0,0,,抄近道回家吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}home through Old Quarry that night?
Dialogue: 0,1:23:09.66,1:23:11.62,Default,,0,0,0,,你在罗迪秘境酒吧停车了吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Did you stop at Rowdy's Hideaway?
Dialogue: 0,1:23:23.01,1:23:24.01,Default,,0,0,0,,你喝酒了吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Did you drink?
Dialogue: 0,1:23:32.65,1:23:33.77,Default,,0,0,0,,喝了吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Did you?
Dialogue: 0,1:23:35.69,1:23:37.86,Default,,0,0,0,,贾斯汀 你喝酒了吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Justin. Did you drink?
Dialogue: 0,1:23:39.15,1:23:41.70,Default,,0,0,0,,-和我说话  -没 没有 我没喝酒\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}-Talk to me. -No, no, I didn't drink.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:41.78,1:23:43.91,Default,,0,0,0,,我没喝酒 好吗 我\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I didn't drink. Okay? I...
Dialogue: 0,1:23:47.12,1:23:48.91,Default,,0,0,0,,我停车了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I stopped and I...
Dialogue: 0,1:23:49.00,1:23:50.50,Default,,0,0,0,,我点了酒 但是没有喝\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I ordered the drink, but I didn't touch it.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:50.58,1:23:52.62,Default,,0,0,0,,点了但是没喝 我凭什么相信你\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Ordered, but didn't drink. Why would I believe that?
Dialogue: 0,1:23:52.71,1:23:54.42,Default,,0,0,0,,-因为就是这样的 我保证 我发誓  -你发誓吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}-Because that's the truth. I promise. I swear. -You swear?
Dialogue: 0,1:23:54.50,1:23:56.17,Default,,0,0,0,,我为什么要相信你 我为什么还要\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Why should I believe that? Why should I believe anything
Dialogue: 0,1:23:56.25,1:23:57.50,Default,,0,0,0,,-相信你说的鬼话  -我保证 我对你发誓\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}-that you're saying anymore? -I promise. I swear to you.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:57.59,1:23:58.59,Default,,0,0,0,,-我对你发誓  -你对我发誓\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}-I swear to you. -You swear to me?
Dialogue: 0,1:23:58.67,1:23:59.63,Default,,0,0,0,,-我发誓  -别对我撒谎\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}-I swear. -Don't lie to me.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:59.71,1:24:01.01,Default,,0,0,0,,我没撒谎 我保证\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I'm not lying. I promise.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:01.09,1:24:03.01,Default,,0,0,0,,我保证 这就是事实\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I promise. That is the truth.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:03.09,1:24:03.93,Default,,0,0,0,,好吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Okay?
Dialogue: 0,1:24:05.26,1:24:06.26,Default,,0,0,0,,你看\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Look, it...
Dialogue: 0,1:24:08.22,1:24:09.06,Default,,0,0,0,,这\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}It...
Dialogue: 0,1:24:11.10,1:24:13.44,Default,,0,0,0,,那时候正是双胞胎的预产期 我没法应对\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}It was the twins' due date and I couldn't deal
Dialogue: 0,1:24:13.52,1:24:14.69,Default,,0,0,0,,我当时的那种感受\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}with the feelings that I was having.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:14.77,1:24:16.40,Default,,0,0,0,,我没法应付\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I couldn't deal with them,
Dialogue: 0,1:24:16.48,1:24:18.07,Default,,0,0,0,,我并不想把情绪带回家 让你来承担\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}so I didn't want to bring them home and put them on you.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:18.82,1:24:20.07,Default,,0,0,0,,所以我去了那里\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}So I went there.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:20.15,1:24:21.86,Default,,0,0,0,,我在那坐了一会儿\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I sat there for a while, and then I...
Dialogue: 0,1:24:21.95,1:24:23.86,Default,,0,0,0,,之后我回了家\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}and then I came home.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:23.95,1:24:26.03,Default,,0,0,0,,你为什么之前什么都不告诉我\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Why didn't you tell me any of this?
Dialogue: 0,1:24:26.12,1:24:27.70,Default,,0,0,0,,你为什么瞒着我\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Why did you keep this from me?
Dialogue: 0,1:24:27.78,1:24:29.04,Default,,0,0,0,,-我想 我想告诉你的  -你应该跟我谈谈的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}-I wanted... I wanted to. -You could've talked to me.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:29.12,1:24:30.37,Default,,0,0,0,,但你当时已经很痛苦了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}But you were in so much pain.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:30.45,1:24:32.66,Default,,0,0,0,,我当然很痛苦\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Of course I was in pain.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:32.75,1:24:34.37,Default,,0,0,0,,我一直觉得我有责任\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I kept thinking that I was somehow responsible,
Dialogue: 0,1:24:34.46,1:24:35.83,Default,,0,0,0,,感觉那是我的错 一直都是我的错\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}that it was my fault, that it's still my...
Dialogue: 0,1:24:35.92,1:24:37.38,Default,,0,0,0,,不 不 不是你的错\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}No. No. It was not your fault.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:37.46,1:24:38.92,Default,,0,0,0,,-他们是我的孩子  -这不是 不是\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}-They were my babies. -It's not... It's not...
Dialogue: 0,1:24:39.00,1:24:40.67,Default,,0,0,0,,-他们是我们的孩子  -我知道\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}-They were our babies. -I know.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:40.76,1:24:43.80,Default,,0,0,0,,没有 这些都不是你的错 好吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}None... None... None of this is your fault, okay?
Dialogue: 0,1:24:43.88,1:24:45.97,Default,,0,0,0,,我们都很受伤 这依然很痛苦\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}We were both hurting. It still hurts.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:48.51,1:24:49.60,Default,,0,0,0,,我还是很痛苦\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I'm still hurting.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:53.60,1:24:54.60,Default,,0,0,0,,我也是\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Me, too.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:56.31,1:24:57.86,Default,,0,0,0,,是的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yeah. Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:03.78,1:25:06.16,Default,,0,0,0,,我不要一个人面对了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I'm not doing this alone.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:06.24,1:25:08.32,Default,,0,0,0,,不 你不会的 不会的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}No, you're not. You're not.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:08.41,1:25:09.62,Default,,0,0,0,,你不会的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You are not.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:09.70,1:25:12.62,Default,,0,0,0,,我会保护我们的家庭 我会的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I will protect our family. I will.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:14.71,1:25:16.12,Default,,0,0,0,,我保证 好吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I promise. Okay?
Dialogue: 0,1:25:19.50,1:25:21.34,Default,,0,0,0,,嘿 过来 过来\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hey, come here. Come here.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:37.52,1:25:38.90,Default,,0,0,0,,发生什么了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}What the hell is going on?
Dialogue: 0,1:25:38.98,1:25:40.94,Default,,0,0,0,,-呃 我需要见他  -为什么\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}-Ugh, I need to see him. -Why?
Dialogue: 0,1:25:41.02,1:25:42.15,Default,,0,0,0,,我需要他直视我的眼睛\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I need him to look me in the eye
Dialogue: 0,1:25:42.23,1:25:43.44,Default,,0,0,0,,告诉我他没有这么做\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}and tell me he didn't do it.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:45.40,1:25:46.53,Default,,0,0,0,,所以你正在怀疑是吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}So you're having doubts?
Dialogue: 0,1:25:46.61,1:25:47.66,Default,,0,0,0,,我是对的 你对此有质疑吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I'm right. You're doubting it?
Dialogue: 0,1:25:47.74,1:25:49.66,Default,,0,0,0,,我不知道\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I... I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:49.74,1:25:51.24,Default,,0,0,0,,什么叫你不知道\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}What do you mean you don't know?
Dialogue: 0,1:25:51.33,1:25:52.70,Default,,0,0,0,,拜托了 你知道这里有什么不对劲\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Come on. You know something isn't right here.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:52.79,1:25:54.75,Default,,0,0,0,,陪审团知道的 这只是\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}The jury knows it. It's just...
Dialogue: 0,1:25:54.83,1:25:56.66,Default,,0,0,0,,你能证明这就是当时的情况吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Can you prove that's what happened?
Dialogue: 0,1:25:56.75,1:25:59.00,Default,,0,0,0,,你能证明不是吗 你能吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Can you prove it didn't? Can you?
Dialogue: 0,1:25:59.08,1:26:01.04,Default,,0,0,0,,我不知道 只是让我进去吧\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I don't know. Just get me in there.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:16.81,1:26:17.94,Default,,0,0,0,,你在这干什么\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}What are you doing here?
Dialogue: 0,1:26:19.65,1:26:20.61,Default,,0,0,0,,请坐\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Have a seat.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:22.23,1:26:23.48,Default,,0,0,0,,我不应该跟你交谈\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I shouldn't be talking to you.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:24.61,1:26:25.49,Default,,0,0,0,,没关系的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}It's okay.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:31.70,1:26:33.08,Default,,0,0,0,,你想要什么\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}What do you want?
Dialogue: 0,1:26:34.29,1:26:36.25,Default,,0,0,0,,和你一样\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Same thing as you.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:36.33,1:26:37.87,Default,,0,0,0,,为肯德尔·卡特寻求正义\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Justice for Kendall Carter.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:37.96,1:26:39.96,Default,,0,0,0,,那就去找那个犯案的混蛋啊\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}So go find the son of a bitch who did it.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:42.59,1:26:44.17,Default,,0,0,0,,听着 这里没有陪审团\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Look, there's no jury,
Dialogue: 0,1:26:44.25,1:26:46.96,Default,,0,0,0,,没有法官 也没有镜头\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}no judge, no cameras. So just...
Dialogue: 0,1:26:47.05,1:26:48.38,Default,,0,0,0,,告诉我那晚发生了什么\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}tell me what happened that night.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:48.47,1:26:50.43,Default,,0,0,0,,我告诉过你 我回家了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I told you. I went home.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:52.68,1:26:54.72,Default,,0,0,0,,是的 但是首先你\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Right, but first, you...
Dialogue: 0,1:26:54.81,1:26:56.85,Default,,0,0,0,,你跟踪了她 是吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}you followed her, right?
Dialogue: 0,1:26:58.02,1:26:59.23,Default,,0,0,0,,是的 我是说 她喝多了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yeah. I mean, she was wasted.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:00.73,1:27:02.69,Default,,0,0,0,,不 你觉得很愤怒\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, no. So you felt angry
Dialogue: 0,1:27:02.77,1:27:04.98,Default,,0,0,0,,厌倦了被玩弄\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}and, I don't know, sick of being played?
Dialogue: 0,1:27:05.07,1:27:07.24,Default,,0,0,0,,不 不是这种情况 好吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}No, no, that wasn't it. Okay?
Dialogue: 0,1:27:08.69,1:27:10.57,Default,,0,0,0,,只是肯德尔是这种人\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}It's just how Kenny was.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:10.66,1:27:12.57,Default,,0,0,0,,她会变得很激动 你知道吗 把话说得很绝\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}She'd get all worked up, you know, talk this big game,
Dialogue: 0,1:27:12.66,1:27:15.33,Default,,0,0,0,,之后新的一天 就会变得像什么都没发生过\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}and the next day, it'd be like nothing happened.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:15.41,1:27:17.12,Default,,0,0,0,,她只是需要冷静一下\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}So she just needed to chill out.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:18.12,1:27:19.12,Default,,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Right.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:20.62,1:27:21.58,Default,,0,0,0,,是的 我\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yes, okay, I...
Dialogue: 0,1:27:23.08,1:27:26.13,Default,,0,0,0,,我知道我们的感情不完美\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I know our relationship wasn't perfect.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:28.34,1:27:29.67,Default,,0,0,0,,但我们确实曾彼此相爱\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}But we did love each other.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:32.72,1:27:34.43,Default,,0,0,0,,现在 听着 女士\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Now, listen, lady...
Dialogue: 0,1:27:34.51,1:27:36.97,Default,,0,0,0,,我这一生做了很多事\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I've done a lot of things in my life
Dialogue: 0,1:27:37.06,1:27:38.27,Default,,0,0,0,,并不光彩的事\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}that I'm not proud of.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:40.27,1:27:42.77,Default,,0,0,0,,但我没有做这件事\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}But I didn't do this.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:46.94,1:27:48.15,Default,,0,0,0,,我这一生\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}The biggest regret...
Dialogue: 0,1:27:49.86,1:27:51.15,Default,,0,0,0,,最后悔的事\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}of my life...
Dialogue: 0,1:27:53.16,1:27:54.37,Default,,0,0,0,,就是我那晚\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}is that I didn't go after Kendall
Dialogue: 0,1:27:54.45,1:27:55.70,Default,,0,0,0,,没有开车追上肯德尔\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}in my car that night.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:57.66,1:27:58.70,Default,,0,0,0,,因为如果我追上了她\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Because if I did...
Dialogue: 0,1:28:00.58,1:28:02.12,Default,,0,0,0,,肯德尔就不会有事\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Kenny would still be alive.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:05.38,1:28:06.17,Default,,0,0,0,,我说完了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I'm done.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:22.10,1:28:24.02,Default,,0,0,0,,好的 大家 上公交车 我们走\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}All right, everybody, on the bus. Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:01.10,1:29:03.48,Default,,0,0,0,,嘿 只能看 手不能碰\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Ah. Look, but don't touch.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:04.56,1:29:05.56,Default,,0,0,0,,把那个放回去\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Put it back.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:05.29,1:30:07.79,Default,,0,0,0,,好的 大家准备好了吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Okay, y'all. You ready to go?
Dialogue: 0,1:30:40.11,1:30:42.28,Default,,0,0,0,,这就是他们吵架的地方\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}So this is where they fought.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:46.56,1:31:48.02,Default,,0,0,0,,嘿 你还好吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hey, you all right?
Dialogue: 0,1:31:49.23,1:31:50.73,Default,,0,0,0,,是的 我还好 谢谢\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yeah. I'm fine, thanks.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:51.35,1:31:52.40,Default,,0,0,0,,你不好 兄弟\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Nah, man.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:54.11,1:31:55.82,Default,,0,0,0,,自从这件事开始你就没有踏实过\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You haven't been fine since the start.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:58.19,1:32:00.36,Default,,0,0,0,,我觉得你这段时间一直在耍我们\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I think you've been playing us this whole time.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:01.74,1:32:02.66,Default,,0,0,0,,我不知道你什么意思\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I don't know what you mean.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:05.16,1:32:06.83,Default,,0,0,0,,出席陪审团的那天 你\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}The day you got on the jury, you were...
Dialogue: 0,1:32:08.24,1:32:11.08,Default,,0,0,0,,你在厕所里吐了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}puking in the bathroom.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:11.16,1:32:13.67,Default,,0,0,0,,开花店的警察和那些文件的事\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}All that stuff with the Flower Man cop and those papers.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:15.79,1:32:17.13,Default,,0,0,0,,你声称自己是理性之声\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You claim to be the voice of reason,
Dialogue: 0,1:32:17.21,1:32:18.71,Default,,0,0,0,,但你真的只是\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}but you're really just...
Dialogue: 0,1:32:18.80,1:32:20.26,Default,,0,0,0,,在说一些我们想听的话\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}telling us what we want to hear.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:29.14,1:32:30.68,Default,,0,0,0,,我不知道你在搞什么把戏 伙计\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Now, I don't know what game you're playing, man,
Dialogue: 0,1:32:30.77,1:32:31.77,Default,,0,0,0,,但是我看着你呢\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}but I see you.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:35.52,1:32:37.90,Default,,0,0,0,,我知道那晚到底发生什么了吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Do I know exactly what happened that night?
Dialogue: 0,1:32:37.98,1:32:39.53,Default,,0,0,0,,不\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}No.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:39.61,1:32:41.57,Default,,0,0,0,,但是你也不知道\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}But neither do you.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:43.11,1:32:45.36,Default,,0,0,0,,你跟我一样都不确定\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}And you can't be any more sure
Dialogue: 0,1:32:45.45,1:32:47.95,Default,,0,0,0,,詹姆斯·赛思是上了他的车\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}that James Sythe got in his car
Dialogue: 0,1:32:48.03,1:32:51.00,Default,,0,0,0,,径直开车回了家\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}and drove home that night than I'm sure he...
Dialogue: 0,1:32:52.79,1:32:54.54,Default,,0,0,0,,还是捡起了一块石头\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}picked up one of these rocks
Dialogue: 0,1:32:54.62,1:32:56.46,Default,,0,0,0,,砸向了那个可怜女孩的脑袋\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}and bashed that poor girl's head in.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:58.25,1:32:59.67,Default,,0,0,0,,把她的尸体扔在了河床上\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}And threw her body in the creek.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:06.05,1:33:08.30,Default,,0,0,0,,天哪 伙计\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Jesus, man.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:08.39,1:33:10.47,Default,,0,0,0,,-你差点滑倒了  -是的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}-You nearly slipped. -Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:15.69,1:33:18.23,Default,,0,0,0,,也许那个登山客是对的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Maybe that hiker was right.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:18.31,1:33:20.52,Default,,0,0,0,,-可能会滑倒  -是的 可能 可能\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}-Could have slipped. -Yeah, maybe. Maybe.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:21.98,1:33:23.15,Default,,0,0,0,,但是这没关系\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}But it doesn't matter.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:26.78,1:33:29.49,Default,,0,0,0,,那个混蛋那晚把她留在那\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}That piece of shit left her there that night...
Dialogue: 0,1:33:30.33,1:33:32.62,Default,,0,0,0,,把她一个人留在那等死\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}alone, to die.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:32.70,1:33:33.83,Default,,0,0,0,,留在水沟里\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}In a ditch.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:36.25,1:33:37.79,Default,,0,0,0,,她的死都怪他\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Her death is on him.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:37.88,1:33:40.54,Default,,0,0,0,,这就是为什么我永远不会裁定詹姆斯·赛思无罪\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Which is why I will never acquit James Sythe.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:41.96,1:33:42.92,Default,,0,0,0,,永远\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Ever.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:47.18,1:33:48.68,Default,,0,0,0,,审判只有两种结果\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}This trial ends in only two ways,
Dialogue: 0,1:33:48.76,1:33:51.64,Default,,0,0,0,,要么定罪 要么被判无效\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}either with a conviction or a hung jury.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:51.72,1:33:52.89,Default,,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}All right.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:52.97,1:33:54.52,Default,,0,0,0,,大家准备好回家了吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Is everybody ready to head home?
Dialogue: 0,1:33:56.94,1:33:58.52,Default,,0,0,0,,大家都看完了吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Is everybody done here, please?
Dialogue: 0,1:34:00.36,1:34:01.48,Default,,0,0,0,,是的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:06.20,1:34:07.20,Default,,0,0,0,,好的 我们走吧\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Okay, let's go.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:10.49,1:34:11.66,Default,,0,0,0,,你看够了吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Have you seen enough?
Dialogue: 0,1:34:12.62,1:34:13.54,Default,,0,0,0,,是的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:19.14,1:35:20.35,Default,,0,0,0,,全体起立\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}All rise!
Dialogue: 0,1:35:40.79,1:35:42.04,Default,,0,0,0,,陪审团主席\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Madam Foreperson.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:45.46,1:35:46.96,Default,,0,0,0,,陪审团作出裁决了吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Has the jury reached a verdict?
Dialogue: 0,1:35:47.84,1:35:49.51,Default,,0,0,0,,是的 法官大人\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yes, Your Honor.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:49.59,1:35:51.68,Default,,0,0,0,,这是一致的裁决吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}And is that verdict unanimous?
Dialogue: 0,1:35:52.51,1:35:53.64,Default,,0,0,0,,是的 法官大人\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yes, Your Honor.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:21.00,1:36:23.71,Default,,0,0,0,,请被告起立 宣读判决书\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Will the defendant please stand for the reading of the verdict?
Dialogue: 0,1:36:30.38,1:36:34.51,Default,,0,0,0,,乔治亚州诉詹姆斯·迈克尔·赛斯一案\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}"In the matter of the State of Georgia vs. James Michael Sythe,
Dialogue: 0,1:36:34.59,1:36:39.68,Default,,0,0,0,,案件编号 C-R-20211715532\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}case number C-R-20211715532,
Dialogue: 0,1:36:40.97,1:36:42.56,Default,,0,0,0,,陪审团\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}we, the jury
Dialogue: 0,1:36:42.64,1:36:45.31,Default,,0,0,0,,认为被告詹姆斯·迈克尔·赛斯\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}find the defendant, James Michael Sythe
Dialogue: 0,1:36:45.40,1:36:47.94,Default,,0,0,0,,谋杀罪名成立\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}guilty of count one malice murder.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:49.19,1:36:51.32,Default,,0,0,0,,在此日期签署并注明日期\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Signed and dated this day,
Dialogue: 0,1:36:51.40,1:36:54.11,Default,,0,0,0,,丹妮丝·奥德沃斯 陪审团主席\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Denice Aldworth, Foreperson."
Dialogue: 0,1:36:55.66,1:36:56.74,Default,,0,0,0,,陪审团主席\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Madam Foreperson?
Dialogue: 0,1:36:57.78,1:36:59.16,Default,,0,0,0,,据我所知\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}To the best of your knowledge,
Dialogue: 0,1:36:59.24,1:37:01.79,Default,,0,0,0,,这是你们在陪审室做出的裁决吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}was this your verdict in the jury room?
Dialogue: 0,1:37:01.87,1:37:04.33,Default,,0,0,0,,这是出于自由意志 自愿做出的决定吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Was it freely and voluntarily given?
Dialogue: 0,1:37:04.42,1:37:05.71,Default,,0,0,0,,这仍然是你们的裁决吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}And is this still your verdict?
Dialogue: 0,1:37:07.04,1:37:08.54,Default,,0,0,0,,是的 法官大人\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yes, Your Honor.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:08.63,1:37:09.88,Default,,0,0,0,,好的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Very well.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:09.96,1:37:11.96,Default,,0,0,0,,被告将被继续拘留候审\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Then the defendant is hereby remanded
Dialogue: 0,1:37:12.05,1:37:14.76,Default,,0,0,0,,由州政府看管\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}to the custody of the State.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:14.84,1:37:16.93,Default,,0,0,0,,判决将在稍后宣布\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Sentencing will be at a later date.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:21.31,1:37:23.35,Default,,0,0,0,,哦 詹姆斯\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, James.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:27.65,1:37:29.61,Default,,0,0,0,,感谢你们的服务\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Thank you for your service.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:29.69,1:37:30.86,Default,,0,0,0,,现在结案\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}It is now concluded.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:32.48,1:37:33.74,Default,,0,0,0,,本庭休庭\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}This court is adjourned.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:02.28,1:39:04.45,Default,,0,0,0,,嘿 好 就在这\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hey. Good. Right there.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:06.20,1:39:07.79,Default,,0,0,0,,-嘿  -嗨\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}-Hey. -Hey.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:07.87,1:39:09.50,Default,,0,0,0,,-什么时候开始  -很快 我正准备出发\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}-What time does it start? -Soon. I'm going to head out.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:09.58,1:39:10.79,Default,,0,0,0,,你确定你想去吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You sure you want to go?
Dialogue: 0,1:39:11.46,1:39:12.54,Default,,0,0,0,,嘿 贾斯汀\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hey! Justin.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:12.63,1:39:14.50,Default,,0,0,0,,他不是个好人\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}He wasn't a good guy.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:14.59,1:39:15.84,Default,,0,0,0,,这不是你的错\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}It's not your fault.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:18.13,1:39:19.38,Default,,0,0,0,,我没有为他说话\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I didn't stand up for him.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:21.13,1:39:22.97,Default,,0,0,0,,我告诉他们 他们想听到的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I told them what they needed to hear,
Dialogue: 0,1:39:23.05,1:39:24.39,Default,,0,0,0,,说他不会改变\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}and said he couldn't change.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:25.89,1:39:27.72,Default,,0,0,0,,我得承担这一切 所以\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}And I have to live with that, so...
Dialogue: 0,1:39:31.48,1:39:32.48,Default,,0,0,0,,我能做的只有到场了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}The least I can do is be there.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:38.28,1:39:39.49,Default,,0,0,0,,嗨 小宝贝\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hi, peanut.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:54.33,1:39:55.21,Default,,0,0,0,,这是给你的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}This came for you.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:11.58,1:40:16.63,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8\fs18}感谢您给我们带来平静 为我们的女儿讨回公道 真诚的 琳达·卡特 和 特里·卡特
Dialogue: 0,1:40:28.37,1:40:31.37,Default,,0,0,0,,请被告起立 现在宣读判决\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Will the defendant please stand for sentencing?
Dialogue: 0,1:40:35.29,1:40:40.96,Default,,0,0,0,,对肯德尔·卡特的谋杀是暴力无端的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}The murder of Kendall Carter was violent and senseless.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:41.05,1:40:43.63,Default,,0,0,0,,陪审团已裁定你犯有谋杀罪\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}The jury has found you guilty of that murder,
Dialogue: 0,1:40:43.72,1:40:46.93,Default,,0,0,0,,为此 本法庭对你作出如下判决\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}for which this court sentences you as follows.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:47.80,1:40:50.06,Default,,0,0,0,,罪名一 预谋杀人罪\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Count one, malice murder.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:51.85,1:40:53.06,Default,,0,0,0,,判处无期徒刑\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Life in prison
Dialogue: 0,1:40:53.14,1:40:55.06,Default,,0,0,0,,不得假释\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}without the possibility of parole.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:57.11,1:40:59.02,Default,,0,0,0,,被告即刻还押至法院\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}The defendant is hereby remanded
Dialogue: 0,1:40:59.11,1:41:01.03,Default,,0,0,0,,交由惩教局监管\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}to the Department of Corrections
Dialogue: 0,1:41:01.11,1:41:03.07,Default,,0,0,0,,执行终身监禁\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}to serve the rest of his life in prison.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:28.26,1:41:29.76,Default,,0,0,0,,我的丈夫 贾斯汀 撞到了一头鹿\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}My husband, Justin, hit a deer.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:29.85,1:41:31.31,Default,,0,0,0,,我的妻子是高危孕妇\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}My wife is of a high-risk pregnancy.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:35.08,1:41:40.88,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8\fs18}艾利森·克鲁森的丈夫
Dialogue: 0,1:41:45.36,1:41:47.20,Default,,0,0,0,,本庭休庭\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}This court is now adjourned.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:08.55,1:42:09.68,Default,,0,0,0,,嘿\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hey.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:11.30,1:42:12.97,Default,,0,0,0,,我很惊讶你今天来了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I'm surprised you came today.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:15.98,1:42:17.64,Default,,0,0,0,,我想坚持到底\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I wanted to see this through.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:18.48,1:42:19.56,Default,,0,0,0,,是的 我也是\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yeah. Me too.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:24.78,1:42:26.03,Default,,0,0,0,,你看起来很累\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You look tired.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:28.49,1:42:29.45,Default,,0,0,0,,彼此彼此\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Likewise.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:30.91,1:42:32.16,Default,,0,0,0,,当然 我家有个新生儿\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Well, I have a new baby at home.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:33.54,1:42:34.66,Default,,0,0,0,,我不是这个意思\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}That's not what I meant.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:42.09,1:42:43.55,Default,,0,0,0,,祝贺你赢得选举\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Congratulations on winning your election.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:43.63,1:42:45.67,Default,,0,0,0,,-我在报纸上看到了  -哦 是的 谢谢你\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}-I saw it in the paper. -Oh, yeah. Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:45.76,1:42:47.51,Default,,0,0,0,,这真是了不起 你一定付出了很多努力\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}It's a pretty big deal. You must have worked hard for it.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:47.59,1:42:48.59,Default,,0,0,0,,哦 是的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, I did.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:50.93,1:42:53.06,Default,,0,0,0,,你可以在岗位上做出更多成绩\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}There's a lot of good you can do in that job, I'd imagine.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:54.35,1:42:55.39,Default,,0,0,0,,有时可以\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Sometimes.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:57.27,1:42:59.06,Default,,0,0,0,,不像你想象的那么简单\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}It's not as easy as you think, though.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:00.60,1:43:02.23,Default,,0,0,0,,从来不是\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Never is.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:02.31,1:43:04.48,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯 有的时候你试图做正确的事\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Mmm. Sometimes you try and do the right thing
Dialogue: 0,1:43:04.57,1:43:06.19,Default,,0,0,0,,但却发现你做错了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}only to realize you got it all wrong.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:11.70,1:43:14.28,Default,,0,0,0,,当你搞清楚事情的时候\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}And when you figure things out,
Dialogue: 0,1:43:14.37,1:43:16.29,Default,,0,0,0,,你意识到你追缉的那个人并不是\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}you realize the guy you're after isn't some...
Dialogue: 0,1:43:17.41,1:43:19.12,Default,,0,0,0,,变态\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}psycho.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:19.21,1:43:20.71,Default,,0,0,0,,他甚至不是一个罪犯\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}He's not even really a criminal.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:22.67,1:43:24.21,Default,,0,0,0,,他只是个普通人\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}He's just a regular guy.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:28.22,1:43:29.76,Default,,0,0,0,,如果这只是意外呢\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}What if it was an accident?
Dialogue: 0,1:43:29.84,1:43:31.05,Default,,0,0,0,,这不是意外\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}This is no accident.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:34.39,1:43:36.77,Default,,0,0,0,,不管怎样 这没办法证明\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}It's impossible to prove, either way.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:36.85,1:43:39.02,Default,,0,0,0,,就好比他当时并没有发现\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Just like him not realizing at the time
Dialogue: 0,1:43:39.10,1:43:40.85,Default,,0,0,0,,他的车撞到了人\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}that he hit someone with his car. It's...
Dialogue: 0,1:43:44.52,1:43:45.86,Default,,0,0,0,,你只是需要信任他\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You just have to trust him.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:47.86,1:43:48.99,Default,,0,0,0,,我为什么要这么做\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Why would I do that?
Dialogue: 0,1:43:50.11,1:43:52.36,Default,,0,0,0,,因为他是个好人\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Because he's a good person.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:52.45,1:43:54.95,Default,,0,0,0,,他只是遇到很糟糕的状况\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}He was caught in terrible circumstances.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:55.03,1:43:57.49,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯 你是对的 这是\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Mmm-hmm. No, you're right. This is a...
Dialogue: 0,1:43:57.58,1:43:59.00,Default,,0,0,0,,一个很棘手的情况\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}It's a tough one.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:01.46,1:44:03.04,Default,,0,0,0,,他有一个家庭需要他照顾\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}He has a family depending on him,
Dialogue: 0,1:44:03.13,1:44:04.96,Default,,0,0,0,,就像你也有人依靠着你\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}just like you have people depending on you.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:06.09,1:44:07.46,Default,,0,0,0,,那正义怎么办\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}And what about justice?
Dialogue: 0,1:44:13.84,1:44:15.64,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯 有的时候\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Well, sometimes...
Dialogue: 0,1:44:15.72,1:44:17.97,Default,,0,0,0,,真相并不是正义\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}the truth isn't justice.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:18.06,1:44:20.39,Default,,0,0,0,,你真的相信这个\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You really believe that?
Dialogue: 0,1:44:26.06,1:44:28.32,Default,,0,0,0,,如果你一直这么活下去\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}If you keep going with this,
Dialogue: 0,1:44:28.40,1:44:30.61,Default,,0,0,0,,这份压力会生吞了你\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}the press will eat you alive.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:30.69,1:44:32.65,Default,,0,0,0,,好吗 这个案子会纠缠你一生\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Okay? This case will follow you forever.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:32.74,1:44:34.16,Default,,0,0,0,,同时\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}In the meantime,
Dialogue: 0,1:44:34.24,1:44:36.28,Default,,0,0,0,,一些政客会抢走你的岗位\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}some politician will take your job,
Dialogue: 0,1:44:36.37,1:44:38.41,Default,,0,0,0,,一个罪犯会回到街上\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}a criminal goes back on the street,
Dialogue: 0,1:44:38.49,1:44:40.79,Default,,0,0,0,,一个好人和他的家庭会\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}and a good man and his family will be...
Dialogue: 0,1:44:42.16,1:44:43.58,Default,,0,0,0,,被毁掉\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}just destroyed.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:46.75,1:44:49.00,Default,,0,0,0,,那时正义又在哪里呢\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Where is the justice in that?
Dialogue: 0,1:45:22.66,1:45:23.87,Default,,0,0,0,,阿门\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Amen.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:41.97,1:45:43.35,Default,,0,0,0,,看起来风暴过去了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Looks like the storm passed.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:44.35,1:45:46.23,Default,,0,0,0,,是的 我也觉得\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yeah. I think so.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:10.46,1:46:12.46,Default,,0,0,0,,哈喽 我们的新地方检察官呢\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hello? Where's our new DA?
Dialogue: 0,1:46:14.01,1:46:16.13,Default,,0,0,0,,-嘿  -嗨\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}-Hey. -Hey.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:16.22,1:46:18.05,Default,,0,0,0,,-给你的礼物  -哦\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}-For the new digs. -Oh.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:18.13,1:46:20.30,Default,,0,0,0,,-谢谢  -是的 是真的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}-Thanks. -Yeah. It's real.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:20.39,1:46:22.26,Default,,0,0,0,,很容易养活的植物\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Easy plant to take care of.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:23.85,1:46:26.77,Default,,0,0,0,,你没发现的时候它就已经茁壮成长了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}It really thrives on neglect.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:26.85,1:46:28.94,Default,,0,0,0,,你做到了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You did it.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:30.61,1:46:32.02,Default,,0,0,0,,我希望这一切都值得\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I hope it was worth it.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:37.86,1:46:39.66,Default,,0,0,0,,一会儿啤酒屋见\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Ale House later.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:39.74,1:46:40.62,Default,,0,0,0,,你来结账\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You're buying.
