Dialogue: 0,1:47:09.19,1:47:10.06,Default,,0,0,0,,好耶\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:13.69,1:47:14.52,Default,,0,0,0,,过来\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Come here.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:20.99,1:47:22.07,Default,,0,0,0,,-嗨  -哦\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}-Hi. -Oh.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:23.70,1:47:25.12,Default,,0,0,0,,早上好 爸爸\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Good morning. Dada.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:25.20,1:47:26.49,Default,,0,0,0,,好耶\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:26.58,1:47:28.46,Default,,0,0,0,,-小宝贝  -过来 来吧\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}-There she goes. -Come here. Here we go.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:28.54,1:47:31.67,Default,,0,0,0,,是的 是的 你非常棒 嗨\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yeah. Yeah. You're doing good. Hi.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:31.75,1:47:34.79,Default,,0,0,0,,不妙 我觉得她遗传了我的眼睛\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}It sucks. I think she has my eyes.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:34.88,1:47:35.96,Default,,0,0,0,,-真的吗  -是的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}-Really? -Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:36.05,1:47:38.13,Default,,0,0,0,,-不  -是的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}-No. -Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:38.21,1:47:39.59,Default,,0,0,0,,-你的眼睛很漂亮  -好吧\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}-You have beautiful eyes. -Well...
Dialogue: 0,1:47:40.63,1:47:42.22,Default,,0,0,0,,你看 我觉得 也许像我的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Look, I think, maybe mine.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:42.30,1:47:43.47,Default,,0,0,0,,它们变了一点\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}They're changing a little bit.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:43.55,1:47:46.35,Default,,0,0,0,,是的 嗨\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yeah, hi.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:46.43,1:47:48.14,Default,,0,0,0,,-她遗传了我的嘴  -我希望不要\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}-She has my mouth. -I hope not.
